<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ISA" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">Isayaasa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Isayaasa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Isa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Isayaasa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Isayaasa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha maxaafay, K.Y.S. 800 laytha heeran Yerusalaamen de7ida, bayra nabe gidida Isayaasa sunthan xeegetees. Ha maxaafa, heedzu gita bessan shaakidi be7anaw danda7etees.</para>
  <para style="ipi">1. Shempo 1—39 gakanaw de7iya kifiley, wolqaama gidida Asoorey, Yihuda kawotetha waatidi qohidako odees. Yihuda hessa mela meton yeggiday, Asoore kawotetha minotethi gidonashin, asa nagaranne Xoosse kiitetonna ixuwa. Asaynne enta ayseysati, xillotethinne suure pirdi kumida de7oko simmana mela nabey qoncen qofisees. Xoosse kiitetetha ixoy gamma dhaysidi, dhayoko kaaletheysa erana mela akeekisees. Isayaasi yaana laythan, alamiya polo sarotethan aysiya Dawita koche gidida kawoy yaanaysa sinthatidi odis.</para>
  <para style="ipi">2. Shempo 40-55 gakanaw de7iya kifiley, Yihuda asay di7etidi Babiloone bida wode, enta duussay kundidaysanne enti ufaysi qanxida wodetaba odees. Nabey, Xoossay ba asaa la77a kessanaysanne enti ooratha duussi doomana mela enta Yerusalaame zaariya wodey matidaysa odis. Ha shempota giddon daro keydi bentiya kaara qofay, Xoossay taarike Goda gideysanne kawotethata ubbaas halchida halchuwa, Isra7eele baggara polanaw de7eysa akeekisees. Ha kifiliyan, nabey odida harabay, oyddu Xoossa aylliya mazmureta (Isa 42:1-4; 49:1-6; 50:4-9; 52:13—53:12).</para>
  <para style="ipi">3. Shempo 56-66 gakanaw de7iya kifiley, di7ope Yerusalaame simmida asaynne Xoossay Isra7eele asaas gelida qaalay poletaneko geeshshidi eranaw malla koya deriyaba oykis. Enti bayrayidi oothana mela koyetida oosoti xillotethi, suure pirda, Sambaata boncho, yarsho shiishonne qanxonna woosa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha kifiliyan eretida nibaabey shempoy 61:1-2 bolla de7iya qaala. Ika, “Ubba Haariya Godaa Ayyaanay ta bolla de7ees; manqotas lo77oba odana mela Goday tana tiyis. Wozani meqidaysata koolana mela, di7etidaysata la77a kessana melanne qashetidaysata billana mela Goday tana kiittis” yaagees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Pirdanne hanqo tinbiteta <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ISA 1:1-35:10">1:1—35:10</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io2">Yihudasinne Isra7eeles odetida kiitata <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ISA 1:1-5:30">1:1—5:30</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io2">Isayaasa kiitetetha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ISA 6:1-13">6:1-13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io2">Yaana Kiristoosaba odetida tinbiteta <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ISA 7:1-12:6">7:1—12:6</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io2">Allaga kawotethata bolla odetida tinbiteta <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ISA 13:1-23:18">13:1—23:18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io2">Meto giddon de7iya asaas ufaysi de7ees <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ISA 24:1-27:13">24:1—27:13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io2">Makallanchoti pirdetana <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ISA 28:1-35:10">28:1—35:10</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Hizqiyaasara gahetida taarike <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ISA 36:1-39:8">36:1—39:8</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossay ba asaa ashshananne zaarana <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ISA 40:1-48:22">40:1—48:22</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Waaye ekanaw de7iya aylliya <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ISA 49:1-53:12">49:1—53:12</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossay ba caaquwa naagees <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ISA 54:1-59:21">54:1—59:21</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Sinthafe yaana Yerusalaame bonchuwa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ISA 60:1-66:24">60:1—66:24</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ISA 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 1:1" />Ooziyani, Iyo7atami, Akaazinne Hizqiyaasi Yihudan kaalli kaallidi kawotida wode Amoxe na7ay Isayaasi Yihudabaanne Yerusalaameba be7ida qoncethay haysa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:1-7">2 Kawo 15:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 15:32-16:20">15:32—16:20</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:1-20">18:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 26:1-32:33">2 Taari 26:1—32:33</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Si7onna Dere</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 1:2" />Saloto si7ite; sa7aw hayza si7a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:2">Goday haysada yaagees;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:2">“Ta nayta yelada dichas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:2">shin enti taw makallidosona.<verse eid="ISA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 1:3" />Boori ba godaa erees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:3">hareyka bana haaridaysa zadaluwa erees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:3">Shin Isra7eeley erenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:3">ta asay akeekenna.<verse eid="ISA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 1:4" />Hinteno, nagarancho kawotethato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">bala ooson deexidaysato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">iitaa oothiya yeletethato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">tuna oosos imetida nayto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">Godaa aggidaysato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">hintena ayye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">Isra7eele Geeshshaa kadhideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">iyaw zoko zaarideta.<verse eid="ISA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 1:5" />Makalla bolla makalla ayis gujeetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:5">Ayis zaari zaari shoceteetii?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:5">Hinte huuphey hargetis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:5">hinte wozanay daaburis.<verse eid="ISA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 1:6" />Huuphe binaanape toho xugunthi gakanaw payyatethi baawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:6">madunthi, kixinne dhuusi ma7is.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:6">Enti giiybookona, woyko meecetidi qashetibookona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:6">woyko zayten tiyetidi looxikbookona.<verse eid="ISA 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 1:7" />“Hinte biittay oxis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:7">hinte katamati taman xuugetidosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:7">Hinte be7ishin hinte goshsha allagati ekana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:7">imatha asati hinte biitta quu7e kessana.<verse eid="ISA 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 1:8" />Yerusalaamey woyne gaden de7iya shaqarada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:8">leehe giddon de7iya gaabbadanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:8">morken teqetida katamada hanada attana.<verse eid="ISA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 1:9" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday nuus guutha koche ashshonaako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:9">nuuni Soodomenne Gamoora katamaada hananashin”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Medhe 19:24</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:29">Roome 9:29</ref>.</char></note> yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 1:10" />Hinteno, Soodome halaqato, Godaa qaala si7ite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:10">Hinteno, Gamoora asaw, nu Xoossa higgiya si7ite!<verse eid="ISA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 1:11" />“Hinte yarsho daroy taw ay oothii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:11">Hanno gakanaw hinte taw shiishida urge dorsaanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:11">modho mehe xuussa yarshoy taw gidana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:11">Taani kormata, dorsa urgetanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:11">deeshata suuthan ufaytike.<verse eid="ISA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 1:12" />Hinte ta sinthan bentanaw yaa wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:12">ta keethaa dabaaba hinte yedhana mela oone oychiday?<verse eid="ISA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 1:13" />Hada yarshuwa eheysa aggite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:13">Hinte cuyisiya ixaaney tana shaattees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:13">Ageena xeeron hinte bonchiya gallasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:13">Sambaatanne iitatethan hinte shiiqiya shiiquwa taani ixayis.<verse eid="ISA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 1:14" />Ageena xeeron hinte bonchiya gallasaanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:14">hinte ba7aale gallasata taani ixas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:14">enti taw tooho gididosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:14">taani enta tookanaw danda7ike.<verse eid="ISA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 1:15" />Hinte kushe miccidi tana woossiya wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:15">taani ta ayfiya hintefe genthana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:15">Hinte kushey suuthan kumida gisho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:15">hinte darsi woossikoka taani si7ike.<verse eid="ISA 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 1:16" />Meecetite; hintena geeshshite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:16">hinte iita oosuwa ta sinthafe diggite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:16">gene hanuwa aggite.<verse eid="ISA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 1:17" />Lo77oba ooso tamaarite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:17">xillo pirdaa koyite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:17">Un7etidaysata ashshite; yi7otas eqite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:17">am7etas mootetite”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 1:17">yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ISA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 1:18" />“Haayite; ane woli ammanthoos. Hinte nagaray baara biittada zo7ikoka, shachada booxana; suuthada zo7ikoka puutoda booxana. <verse eid="ISA 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 1:19" />Hinte ero gidi taw kiitetiko biitta anjuwa maana. <verse eid="ISA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 1:20" />Shin hinte ixas gidi makalliko, mashshan meetetana” yaagees Goday ba doonan.<verse eid="ISA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 1:21" />Ammanetida katamiya waanada layma gidadee? Kase suuretethinne xillotethi I giddon kumis, shin ha77i shempo wodheysati I giddon de7ees. <verse eid="ISA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 1:22" />Ne biray baltis; ne mal7o woyney haathan yeletis. <verse eid="ISA 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 1:23" />Hinte halaqati makallanchotanne kayso lagge gididosona; enti ubbay wodhaafe doseysatanne kushe xeelleyisata. Yi7otas suure pirdokona; am7eta waasuwa si7okona.<verse eid="ISA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 1:24" />Hessa gisho, Goday, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Xoossay, Isra7eele Wolqaamay, haysada yaagees; “Ha77i taani ta morketa bolla ta hanquwa gussana; taara eqeteyisata halo keyana. <verse eid="ISA 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 1:25" />Taani ta kushiya ne bolla zaarana; ne baltetha geeshshana; ne tunatetha ubbaa neepe diggana. <verse eid="ISA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 1:26" />Taani beniysada ne halaqata, koyroysada ne zoranchota denthana. Hessafe guye, neeni ammanetida biitta; xillotetha Katama geetetana” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 1:27" />Xiyooney suure pirdan, banta nagara paaxeysatika xillotethan wozetana. <verse eid="ISA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 1:28" />Shin makallanchotinne nagaranchoti issife meqana; Godaa aggeysati dhayana. <verse eid="ISA 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 1:29" />Hinte ufaytida yarsho wolan yeellatana; hinte doorida kooran kawuyana. <verse eid="ISA 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 1:30" />Hinte haythi qoqofetidi wurida woladanne haathi dhayida atakilte bessada gidana. <verse eid="ISA 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 1:31" />Bana mino gey buuxa gidana; iya oosoyka pol7u gidi to7iya tama gidana; enti issife xuugetana; he tama toysana asi baawa.<verse eid="ISA 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ISA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Godaa Zuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 2:1" />Amoxe na7ay Isayaasi Yihudabaanne Yerusalaameba be7idaysi haysa.<verse eid="ISA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 2:2" />Wursetha gallasatan Godaa keethay keexetida zumay, zumata ubbaafe dhoqu gidi bentana; zuma ubbaafe bollara dhoqu gaana. Kawotethati ubbay iyako baana. <verse eid="ISA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 2:3" />Higgey Xiyoonepe, Godaa qaalay Yerusalaamepe keyiya gisho, daro asay yidi, “Ane haayite! Godaa zumako, Yayqooba Xoossa keethaako keyoos. Nuuni iya ogiyan baana mela I nuna ba ogiya tamaarsana” yaagana. <verse eid="ISA 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 2:4" />I kawotethata giddon pirdana; daro asata palama shaakana. Enti banta mashshaa marasha, banta toora baaca kessana. Kawotethati kawotethata bolla mashsha denthokona; hizape enti ola timirte tamaarokona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:10">Iyyu 3:10</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 2:5" />Hinteno, Yayqooba kochato, haayite! Ane Godaa poo7uwan hemetoos.<verse eid="ISA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Godaa Gallasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 2:6" />Godaw, ne asaa, Yayqooba kochata aggadasa. Enti doloha bagga asaa Bitaaninne Filisxeeme asaa murunnuwan kumidosona; allaga asaara issifidosona. <verse eid="ISA 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 2:7" />Enta biittan birinne worqey kumis; enta miishiyas zawi baawa. Enta biittan pari kumis; enta para gaariyas zawi baawa. <verse eid="ISA 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 2:8" />Enta biittan eeqi kumidosona; enti banta kushe oosuwa goyinnoosona.<verse eid="ISA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 2:9" />Hessa gisho, asa ubbay tooshettananne kawuyana. Enta nagaraa atto goopa.<verse eid="ISA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 2:10" />Godaa daganthuwafenne yashshiya bonchuwafe attanaw zaallako biite; biitta giddon qosetite! <verse eid="ISA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 2:11" />Otoranchoti kawuyana; ceeqeteysati guuxana; he gallas Godaa xalaali dhoqu dhoqu gaana. <verse eid="ISA 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 2:12" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, issi gallas otoranchota, ceeqeteysatanne bantana dhoqu dhoqu ootheyisata kawushana. <verse eid="ISA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 2:13" />Adussa Libaanose zigatanne Baasane wola ubbaa dhaysana; <verse eid="ISA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 2:14" />Dhoqa deretanne zumata dembayana. <verse eid="ISA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 2:15" />Katamaa naagiya adussa shakotanne mino dirsa gimbeta ziqi oothana. <verse eid="ISA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 2:16" />Goday gitanne lo77o markabeta haathan mitisana. <verse eid="ISA 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 2:17" />Asa otoroy ziqi gaana; iya ceeqetethay dhayana. He gallas Godaa xalaali dhoqu dhoqu gaana. <verse eid="ISA 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 2:18" />Eeqa ubbay polo dhayana.<verse eid="ISA 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 2:19" />Goday biitta qaathanaw dendiya wode iya daganthuwafenne iya yashshiya bonchuwafe attanaw asay shucha gongoloninne biitta ollan qosetana. <verse eid="ISA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 2:20" />He gallasay asay goyinnanaw medhida banta bira misiletanne banta worqa misileta girotasinne shirshiqotas yeggana. <verse eid="ISA 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 2:21" />Goday biitta qaathanaw dendiya wode iya daganthuwafenne iya yashshiya bonchuwafe attanaw enti gongolo giddonne shucha za7o giddo baqatana.<verse eid="ISA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 2:22" />Hiza shempoy siidhen de7iya, ha hayqiya asan ammanetofite. Asi ay maaddii?<verse eid="ISA 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ISA 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalaamenne Yihuda Pirdetetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 3:1" />Heko, Goday, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Xoossay, minjanne maado ubbaa, katha minjanne haatha minja ubbaa Yerusalaamepenne Yihudape diggana. <verse eid="ISA 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 3:2" />Minotanne olanchota, daynnanne nabiya, biteysanne cima, <verse eid="ISA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 3:3" />toora moconanne deriya ayseysa, zoreysa, hiillanchuwanne qara marota ubbaa diggana.<verse eid="ISA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 3:4" />Taani yooga nayta enta halaqa oothana; guutha nayti enta haarana. <verse eid="ISA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 3:5" />Asay asa bolla, shooroy shooruwa bolla dendidi, issoy issuwa sugana. Na7atethay cima bolla, kadhetidaysi bonchetidaysa bolla dendana.<verse eid="ISA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 3:6" />Issi asi ba aawa keethan de7iya ba ishatape issuwa oykidi, “New ma7oy de7ees; neeni nuus halaqa gida; ha laaletida bessaa aawatethan eka” yaagana.<verse eid="ISA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 3:7" />He gallas, I ba qaala dhoqu oothidi, “Taani maaddike; ta son kathi woyko ma7oy baawa; hinte bolla tana shuumopite” yaagana.<verse eid="ISA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 3:8" />Yerusalaamey gandigarasu; Yihudi kundanaw matasu; enti banta odaaninne banta oosuwan Godaa bolla dendidi, iya bonchuwa toochidosona. <verse eid="ISA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 3:9" />Enta som7oy enta bolla markatees; enti banta nagaraa Soodome asaa mela awaajosona; banta nagaraa qottokona. Enti banta bolla dhayo ehida gisho enta ayye!<verse eid="ISA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 3:10" />Enti banta oosuwa ayfiya maana gisho, xillotas lo77o gidana gada oda. <verse eid="ISA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 3:11" />Enti banta kushe oosuwa gatiya ekana gishonne dhayoy enta bolla yida gisho iitata ayye! <verse eid="ISA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 3:12" />Na7atethati ta asaa un7ethoosona; maccasati enta haaroosona. Ta asaw, hintena kaaletheysati balethoosona; hinte biya ogiyape kare kessoosona.<verse eid="ISA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 3:13" />Goday ba araatan uttis; asaa bolla pirdanaw giigetis. <verse eid="ISA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 3:14" />Goday deriya cimatanne kaaletheyisata pirdanaw shiishidi, “Ta woyne gadiya dhaysiday hintena; manqotape bonqidaysi hinte son de7ees. <verse eid="ISA 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 3:15" />Hinte ta asaa ayis tincherethetii? Manqota som7uwa ayis kareethetii?” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="ISA 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 3:16" />Goday, “Xiyoone maccasati otortidosona; banta qoodhiya adussidi, banta ayfiyan qam7otoosona; banta hemethaa laammidi, banta toho albuwa giirsishe hemetoosona. <verse eid="ISA 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 3:17" />Hessa gisho, Goday Xiyoone maccasa huuphiya dhuusan kunthana; Goday enta huuphiya bo77ayana” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 3:18" />He gallas Goday Xiyoone maccasa alleeqota, hessika, toho albuwa, shaashiya, qoodhe worqaa, <verse eid="ISA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 3:19" />haytha worqa, kushe ambaare, som7o kama, <verse eid="ISA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 3:20" />huuphe kama, qese santhalaata, dancuwa, shittuwa, gozdda, <verse eid="ISA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 3:21" />siidhe worqa, biradhe migiduwa, <verse eid="ISA 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 3:22" />koyse ma7uwa, adussa ma7uwa, kaaba, borsa, <verse eid="ISA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 3:23" />mastootiya, liinuwa, huuphe alleeqota, sharbiya ubbaa entafe ekana.<verse eid="ISA 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 3:24" />Shitto gisho xinqo, danco gisho wodoro, goofare gisho bo77a, koyse ma7o gisho kayo ma7o, lo77otetha gisho beeta gidana.<verse eid="ISA 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 3:25" />Ne asati mashshan, ne olanchoti olan hayqana. <verse eid="ISA 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 3:26" />Xiyoone pengeti yeekananne zeleelana; kayotada sa7an uttida maccasada hanana.<verse eid="ISA 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ISA 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 4:1" />He gallas laapun maccasati issi adde oykidi, “Nuuni nu kathi maana; nu ma7o ma7ana. Ne sunthan xeegetana mela oothada nu kawusha nuupe diggarkii?” yaagidi woossana.<verse eid="ISA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Mitha Tashe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 4:2" />He wode Godaa tashey, lo77ananne bonchetana; attida Isra7eele asaas biitta kathay ceeqonne boncho gidana. <verse eid="ISA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 4:3" />Xiyoonen attidaysati, Yerusalaamen dhayope kessi ekidaysatinne de7os xaafetidaysati geeshshata geetetana. <verse eid="ISA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 4:4" />Goday Xiyoone maccasa qita meeccana; ba pirdaaninne ba ayyaana taman suutha guso Yerusalaamepe diggana. <verse eid="ISA 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 4:5" />Goday Xiyoone zumaa bollanne yan shiiqiya ubbaa bolla gallas shaara cuyanne qamma tama laco medhana; iya boncho ubbaa bolla kama gidana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:21">Kessa 13:21</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 24:16">24:16</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 4:6" />I, gallasa mishape ashshiya kuyanne uushopenne irape qosetiya besse gidana.<verse eid="ISA 4:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ISA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Woyne Gade Leemiso</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 5:1" />Ta dosiya addiya woyne gadiyaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:1">siiqo yethi yexana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:1">Taani dosiya addiyas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:1">aradda zuma bolla iyaw woyne gadey de7ees.<verse eid="ISA 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 5:2" />Biitta bookidi, shuchaa qori kessidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">lo77o woyne tokis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">Naago shako iya giddon shakis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">woyniya gum7iya bessaa giigisis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">Hessafe guye, lo77o ayfe ayfana gidi naagis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">shin caala ayfe ayfis.<verse eid="ISA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 5:3" />“Hinteno, Yerusalaamen de7eysato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:3">hinteno Yihuda asaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:3">taapenne ta woyne gadiya giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:3">de7iya odaa ane pirdite.<verse eid="ISA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 5:4" />Taani ta woyne gadiyas oothidaysafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:4">haraa ay oothanabay attidee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:4">Lo77o ayfe ayfana gada naagas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:4">shin ayis caala ayfe ayfidee?<verse eid="ISA 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 5:5" />Ha77i taani ta woyne gadiya bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:5">oothanaba hintew odana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:5">Taani iya dirsaa diggana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:5">woyney dhayanaada oothana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:5">Taani gimbiya laallana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:5">woyne gadey yedhetana.<verse eid="ISA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 5:6" />Taani he gadiya quu7e oothana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:6">woyney xintetenna, harmetenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:6">He bessan kinchoteynne agunthi dolana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:6">Iri iya bolla bukonna mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:6">taani shaara kiittana” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 5:7" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">woyne gadey Isra7eele asaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">I, ufaytiya atakilte bessay Yihuda asaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">Enta suure pirdoosona gidi naagis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">shin suuthi gussidosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">Xillotethi oothosona gidi naagis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">shin un7a waasoy darana mela oothidosona.<verse eid="ISA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iitata Ayye!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 5:8" />Bessi dhayin, hinte xalaala biitta bolla daana gakanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:8">keethe keetha bolla, gade gade bolla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:8">gujeysato hintena ayye!<verse eid="ISA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 5:9" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday haysada gidi caaqishin ta si7as.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:9">“He gita keethati kaysatana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:9">he lo77o keethatan daanaw asi dhayana.<verse eid="ISA 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 5:10" />Tammu waaxan tokida woyniyape,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:10">issi oto gum7etha woyne xalaala ekana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:10">Hospun tammu kilo giraame zerida gadepe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:10">tammanne hospun kilo giraame xalaala ekana” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 5:11" />Mathoya ushsha koyanaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:11">wonta guura dendeysatanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:11">woyne ushshay xuuggana gakanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:11">yan qamisiya asaa ayye!<verse eid="ISA 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 5:12" />Enta imatuwan maasinqoy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:12">diithi, karaaboy, suusul7eynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:12">woyne ushshi de7ees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:12">Shin enti Godaa oosuwa be7ibookona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:12">iya kushe oosuwa akeekokona.<verse eid="ISA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 5:13" />Hiza ta asay akeeka dhayida gisho, di7etana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:13">ayseysati koshan hayqana; asay saamon xuugetana.<verse eid="ISA 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 5:14" />Duufoy ba gompaa dalgisis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:14">ba doona zawi bayna dooyis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:14">Yerusalaamen de7iya gita asaa, daro asaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:14">wocameysatanne ufayteyisata mittana.<verse eid="ISA 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 5:15" />Asi tooshetana; asa koche ubbay kawuyana; otortiya ubbay guuxana. <verse eid="ISA 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 5:16" />Shin Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, ba suure pirdan dhoqu dhoqu gaana; Xoossaa geeshshatethay iya xillotethan qoncana. <verse eid="ISA 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 5:17" />He wode dorsati he bessan heemetana; dorsa urgeti laaletida keetha bessatan maana.<verse eid="ISA 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 5:18" />Cimo wodoron nagara, gaare wodoron iitatethi goocheyisata ayye! <verse eid="ISA 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 5:19" />“Ane Xoossay elleso! Nuuni be7ana mela ba oosuwa eesoyo! Nuuni erana mela Isra7eele Geeshshay qopida qofaa polo” yaageyisata ayye!<verse eid="ISA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 5:20" />Iitaa lo77o, lo77uwa iita; dhumaa poo7o, poo7uwa dhuma; camuwa mal7o, mal7uwa camo geyisata ayye!<verse eid="ISA 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 5:21" />Bantana cincanne qara geyisata ayye!<verse eid="ISA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 5:22" />Woyne ushshan eretida asaanne mathoyiya ushshu walakanaw wozani mino gidida asaa ayye! <verse eid="ISA 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 5:23" />Qohida uraa xillisanaw wodhaafe ekidi, xillo asaa suure pirdaa geellayeyisata ayye! <verse eid="ISA 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 5:24" />Enti Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa higgiya ixida gishonne Isra7eele Geeshshaa qaala kadhida gisho tama lacoy kale oykeysadanne buurey taman meetetidi dhayeysada enta xaphoy wooqana. Enta ciishshay baanada laaletidi dhayana. <verse eid="ISA 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 5:25" />Hessa gisho, Godaa hanqoy iya asaa bolla eexis; iya kushey dendidi, enta dhaysis. Dereti qaaxidosona; hayqida asaa ahay oge bolla buureda hanis. He ubbanka iya hanqoy simmibeenna; iya kushey ha77ika dendida bessan de7ees.<verse eid="ISA 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 5:26" />Goday haaho son de7iya kawotethatas malla dhoqan essis; sa7aa gaxan de7iya asaa suyqidi xeegis; enti dirgishe puttu goosona. <verse eid="ISA 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 5:27" />Enta giddon daabureynne dhubetey baawa; entafe issoyka dhiskenna woyko zin7enna. Xeessan dancida saqey birshetena; enta caamma wodoroy duuxenna. <verse eid="ISA 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 5:28" />Enta tooray qara; enta dongeyka waaxetidi de7ees. Enta parata tohoy qara shucha mela; enta para gaareta gertoy gote mela. <verse eid="ISA 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 5:29" />Enti gaammo mela guummoosona; wodala gaammo mela gudoosona. Enti sarbuqishe miyaba oykidi, tooki ekidi boosona; entafe wothidi ekey oonika baawa.<verse eid="ISA 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 5:30" />He wode enti gita abba guunthada Isra7eele bolla guummana. Issi asi he biitta xeelliya wode dhuminne waayey be7ana; poo7oy shaaran mitettana.<verse eid="ISA 5:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ISA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Isayaasa Xeegetethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 6:1" />Kawoy Ooziyani hayqida laythi Goday dhoqa araataninne boncho bessan uttidaysa be7as; iya ma7oy Xoossa keethaa kumis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:7">2 Kawo 15:7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 26:23">2 Taari 26:23</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 6:2" />Surafeela geetetiya kiitanchoti iyape bollara de7oosona; issi issi kiitanchuwas usupun qefeti de7oosona; nam7u qefetan ba som7uwa kammees; nam7u qefetan ba tohuwa kammees; nam7u qefetan piradhees. <verse eid="ISA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 6:3" />Enti issoy issuwako, “Geeshshay, geeshshay, geeshshay, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa! Sa7a ubbay iya bonchuwan kumis”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:8">Qon 4:8</ref>.</char></note> yaagosona. <verse eid="ISA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 6:4" />Enta girsa waasuwa gaason Xoossa keethaa baasoy qaaxis; Xoossa keethay cuyan kumis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 15:8">Qon 15:8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 6:5" />Yaatin, “Taani mettershay tunida asaa giddon de7ayis; ta mettershayka tuna. Taani Kawa, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa ta ayfen be7ida gisho, tana ayye! Ta dhayas!” yaagas.<verse eid="ISA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 6:6" />He kiitanchotape issoy yarsho bessaafe bonqo tama qaphera ekidi piradhishe taako yis. <verse eid="ISA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 6:7" />Bonqo taman ta mettersha bochidi, “Heko; ha bonqo tamay ne mettershay bochida gisho ne naaqoy neepe kichis; ne nagaray atto geetetis” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 6:8" />Hessafe guye Goday, “Oona kiitto? Nuus oone baanay?” yaagishin si7as. Taani, “Heko, tana kiitta, taani baana” yaagas.<verse eid="ISA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 6:9" />Goday taako, “Bada ha asaa, ‘Hinte sissi si7eeta, shin akeekeketa; hinte xeelleta, shin demmeketa’ ” yaagada oda. <verse eid="ISA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 6:10" />Kaallidika, “Ha asaa wozanaa muumisa; enta haythaa tullisa; enta ayfiya gooza. Hessi hanonna ixiko, enti banta ayfiyan be7idi, banta haythan si7idi, banta wozanan akeekidi, taako simmana; zaaridi paxana”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:14-15">Maato 13:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:12">Mar 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:10">Luqa 8:10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:40">Yoha 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 28:26-27">Hawa 28:26-27</ref>.</char></note> yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 6:11" />Taani, “Abeeti Godaw, hessi hananay awude gakanaasee?” yaagas.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 6:11">I zaaridi, “Katamati laaletana gakanaw, keethati kaysa gidana gakanaw, biittay polo dogetana gakanaw; <verse eid="ISA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 6:12" />asaa haaho bessi yeddana gakanawunne biittay asi bayna mela biitta gidana gakanaasa. <verse eid="ISA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 6:13" />Tammu asaape issi asi biitta bolla attiko, ika dhayana. Qanxin attida wolanne caca duruma mela gidana; he durumay geeshsha koche gidana” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 6:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ISA 7" />
  <para style="s1">Amanu7eela Malla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 7:1" />Ooziyana na7ay Iyo7atama na7ay Akaazi, Yihudan kawotida wode Araame kawoy Razininne Isra7eele kawoy Ramala na7ay Faaquhey Yerusalaame olanaw yidosona; shin xoonanaw danda7ibookona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:5">2 Kawo 16:5</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 28:5-6">2 Taari 28:5-6</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 7:2" />Araame biittay Efreema biittara issife olas caaqidaysa Yihuda kawoy si7ida wode, woran de7iya mithaa carkoy qaatheysada, Akaaza wozanaynne asaa wozanay dagaman qaaxis.<verse eid="ISA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 7:3" />Goday Isayaasako, “Neeranne ne na7aa Sheer-Yasuubara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Sheer-Yasuuba: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha sunthaa birshethay “Guuthati simmana” guussu (</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 10:20-22">Isa 10:20-22</ref></char>).</note> Akaazara gahetanaw biite; hinte iya ma7o meecciya goshshaako efiya ogiya matan qommo baggan de7iya haatha olaa wursethan hinte iya demmana. <verse eid="ISA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 7:4" />Iyaw haysada yaagada oda; ‘Naageta; wopu ga; yayyofa. Ha nam7u kawoti tamape attidi cuyaa duruma mela gidiya gisho, Araame kawa Razinanne Ramala na7aa hanquwas yayyofa; ne wozanay dagammofo.’ <verse eid="ISA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 7:5" />Araame biittay, Efreema asaaranne Ramala na7aara ne bolla iitabaa maqetidosona.” <verse eid="ISA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 7:6" />Enti “Ane Yihuda olidi oykoos; iya mentherethidi nu giddon shaaki ekidi, Xabeela na7aa kawothana yaagosona” yaaga.<verse eid="ISA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 7:7" />Gidoshin, Ubbaa Haariya Goday, “Ha enta maqoy minnenna; enta zoretay poletenna. <verse eid="ISA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 7:8" />Damasqoy Araame huuphe; kawoy Razini Damasqo huuphe. Usupun tammanne ichashu laytha giddon Efreemi laaletidi kawotethi gidonna attana. <verse eid="ISA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 7:9" />Efreema huuphey Samaariya; Ramala na7ay, Faaquhey Samaariya huuphe. Hinte, hinte ammanuwan minnonna ixiko, eqanaw danda7eketa” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 7:10" />Qassika Goday Akaazako, <verse eid="ISA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 7:11" />“Bolla saluwape woyko garsa sa7aape Goday, ne Xoossay new issi malla immana mela oycha” yaagis. <verse eid="ISA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 7:12" />Shin Akaazi, “Oychike; oychada Godaa paacike” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 7:13" />Yaatin, Isayaasi, “Hinteno, Dawita soo asaw, si7ite! Hinte asa danda7a paaceysi ay guuxin, qassi ta Xoossa danda7a paacetii? <verse eid="ISA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 7:14" />Hessa gisho, Goday ba huuphen hintew malla immana; geela7iya qanthatada adde na7a yelana; iya sunthaaka Amanu7eela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Amanu7eela: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha sunthaa birshethay “Xoossay nuura de7ees” guussu.</char></note> gada xeegana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:23">Maato 1:23</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 7:15" />I, iitaa ixonne lo77o dooro eriya wode meqa maathinne oysi maana. <verse eid="ISA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 7:16" />Shin na7ay iita ixonne lo77uwa dooro eranaape sinthe, neeni yayiya nam7u kawota biittati baysatana. <verse eid="ISA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 7:17" />Efreemi Yihudape shaaketoosape doomin haniboonna meto wode Goday ne bolla, ne asaa bollanne ne aawa soo asaa bolla ehana; I ehanayka Asoore kawa” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 7:18" />He gallas Goday, haaho shaafa gaxan de7iya Gibxe udunxetanne Asoore mathata suyqidi xeegana. <verse eid="ISA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 7:19" />Yaatin, enti ubbay yidi, mela biitta zangaaran, shucha gongolon, agunthi de7iya buureninne haatha ollatan uttana.<verse eid="ISA 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 7:20" />He gallas Goday Efraxiisa shaafa hefintha baggafe garxida shiggiriyan, Asoore kawan, hinte huuphiya buluusana; hinte ikisiyanne hinte buuchaa meedana.<verse eid="ISA 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 7:21" />He gallas issi asas issi miizinne nam7u deesha xalaali attana. <verse eid="ISA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 7:22" />Gidoshin, enta maathay daro gidiya gisho I meqa maathi ustana; he biittan attida asa ubbay meqa maathinne eessi maana.<verse eid="ISA 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 7:23" />He gallas issi mukulu biran washetiya mukulu woyne tohoti de7iya bessa ubban kinchoteynne agunthi dolana. <verse eid="ISA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 7:24" />Biitta ubban kinchoteynne agunthi kumida gisho, asay yaa biya wode donge oykidi baana. <verse eid="ISA 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 7:25" />Kase konten oothida zumatan ha77i kinchoteynne agunthi kumida gisho yayyidi, issi asika yaa beenna. Shin meheynne dorsi heemetiya bessi gidana.<verse eid="ISA 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ISA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Asoore Kawa Yuussaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 8:1" />Goday taako, “Gita saleeda ekada, ‘Di7anaw ellesa! Bonqanaw dirga!’ yaagada nabbabetiya pidalen xaafa. <verse eid="ISA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 8:2" />Kahiniya Urayanne Baraka na7aa Zakariyasa ammanetiya marka oothada taani xeegana” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 8:3" />Hessafe guye, taani nabe gidida ta machera aqas; iya qanthatada adde na7a yelasu. Goday taako, “Iya suntha, ‘Mahaar-Shalal-Hash-Baaz’ yaagada xeega. <verse eid="ISA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 8:4" />Na7ay, ‘Abbo, immo’ gidi xeessi eranaape sinthe Asoore kawoy, Damasqo duretethaanne Samaariya shaluwa ekidi baana” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 8:5" />Qassika Goday taako haysada yaagis. <verse eid="ISA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 8:6" />“Ha asay loddara goggiya Salihoome haatha ixidi, Razinanne Ramala na7aa ufaytidi ekidosona. <verse eid="ISA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 8:7" />Hessa gisho, Goday minonne daro gidida Efraxiisa haatha, Asoore kawa, iya olanchotara ehana hanees. I haathi kixidi kumeysada gaxaa ubbaa ma7idi goggana. <verse eid="ISA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 8:8" />Di77ishe Yihuda gelana; kixay qoodhe gakanaw kumidi yaara kanthana.” Abeeti Amanu7eela, iya qefiya micethay ne biitta ubbaa ma7is.<verse eid="ISA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 8:9" />Hinteno kawotethato, issife olas shiiqite, shin hinte dhayana. Haaho biittan de7iya asato, si7ite; olas giigite; shin hinte liiqana! Ee, olas giigite; hinte wurana. <verse eid="ISA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 8:10" />Xoossay nuura de7iya gisho, olas maqetite, shin hinte maqoy kanthenna; halchite, shin hinte halchoy halana.<verse eid="ISA 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Yayya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 8:11" />“Goday ba mino kushiya ta bolla wothidi, ta ha asaa ogiyan boonna mela taw minthidi odis. <verse eid="ISA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 8:12" />Ha asaa maqo ubbaa maqo goopite; enti yayyiyaba Yayyofite; dagammopite. <verse eid="ISA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 8:13" />Hinte geeshshi gaanaw bessey Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa; iyaw yayyanawunne dagammanaw bessees. <verse eid="ISA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 8:14" />I, geeshsha bessi gidana; shin Yihudasinne Isra7eeles I, dhube shuchinne kundisiya zaalla gidana. Yerusalaamen de7iya asaas I gitenne xihe gidana. <verse eid="ISA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 8:15" />Entafe daroti dhubetana; kundidi me77ana; xihen oyketidi di7etana” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 8:16" />Ta odeysa naaga; ta tamaareta giddon higgiya attama. <verse eid="ISA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 8:17" />Taani ba som7uwa Yayqooba zerethafe genthiya Godaa naagana; iyan ammanetana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:13">Ibra 2:13</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 8:18" />Tananne taw Goday immida nayta be7ite. Nuuni Xiyoone deriyan de7iya Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaape Isra7eele asaas mallanne malaata.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:13">Ibra 2:13</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 8:19" />“Suyqishenne kalkashishe odiya marotanne moytilleta oychite” yaagidi hintena zoriya asay de7oosona. De7on de7eysatas hayqidaysata oycheysafe asay banta Xoossaa oychanaw bessennee? <verse eid="ISA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 8:20" />Higgiyanne Godaa marka si7ite! He asati ha qaalada haasayonna ixiko entaw sa7i wontenna.<verse eid="ISA 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 8:21" />Asay waayetishenne koshatishe biitta bolla toylatana. Enti koshatida wode yilotidi, pude salo xeellidi banta kawanne banta Xoossaa baaddana. <verse eid="ISA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 8:22" />Sa7aa duge xeelliya wode waaye, dhumanne yashshiya caagana be7ana; enti sakana dhuman holetana.<verse eid="ISA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ISA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Na7i Yeletis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 9:1" />Gidoshin, waayetidaysatas hizape guye dhumenna. Beni wode Goday Zabloona biittanne Niftaaleme biitta kawushis. Shin sinthafe Medetiraane Abbaa ogiyan de7iya biittanne Yordaanose shaafape hefinthan de7iya Ayhude gidonna asay de7iya Galila biitta I bonchana.<verse eid="ISA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 9:2" />Dhuman hemetiya asay wolqaama poo7o be7is; qassi hayqo dhuman de7eysatas poo7oy poo7is.<verse eid="ISA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 9:3" />Neeni kawotethaa darsadasa; enta ufaysaa gujadasa. Asi kathi shiishiya wode ufayteysada woyko di7uwa shaakidi ekiya wode ufayteysada ne sinthan ufaytana. <verse eid="ISA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 9:4" />Neeni Midiyaame biitta xoonidaysada enta deexo qambara, enta gannas giigida xam7anne enta un7etheyisata gumba menthadasa. <verse eid="ISA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 9:5" />Olanchota caammaynne suuthan munuqetida ma7o ubbay taman xuugetana; tamas oysetho gidana. <verse eid="ISA 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 9:6" />Nuus na7i yeletis! Adde na7i nuus imetis! Kawotetha maati iya hashiyan gidana; iya sunthay, “Malaalisiya Zorancho, Wolqaama Xoossa, Merinaa Aawa, Sarotethaa Halaqaa” geetetana. <verse eid="ISA 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 9:7" />Iya kawotethaa dalgatethaasinne iya sarotethaas zawi baawa. Hachife doomidi, merinaa gakanaw suure pirdaaninne xillotethan minthanawunne essanaw Dawita araataninne iya kawotethan I kawotana. Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa qanaatey haysa oothana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:32-33">Luqa 1:32-33</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Bolla Godaa Hanquwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 9:8" />Goday Yayqooba zeretha bolla pirda qaala kiittin, Isra7eele kawotethaa bolla wodhis. <verse eid="ISA 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 9:9" />Efreema asayinne Samaare katamaa asay haysa oothiday Godaa gideysa erishe, otoroninne ceeqon, <verse eid="ISA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 9:10" />“Xuubepe keexetida keethati laaletidosona; shin nu zaaridi masetida shuchan keexana; boobba mithati qanxetidosona; shin nu enta bessan zigata laammana” yaagidosona.<verse eid="ISA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 9:11" />Shin, Xoossay Rasoona morketa minthana; enta bolla ehana; entara eqetiya morketa enta bolla denthethis. <verse eid="ISA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 9:12" />Dolohape Araameta, wulohape Filisxeemeta denthin, enti banta doona dooyidi, Isra7eele mittidosona. He ubban Godaa hanqoy simmibeenna; iya kushey dendida bessan de7ees.<verse eid="ISA 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 9:13" />Gidoshin, asay bantana shocidaysako simmibokona; Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa koybookona. <verse eid="ISA 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 9:14" />Hessa gisho, issi gallas Goday Isra7eelepe huuphenne goynaa, zamba daashshanne maqa qanxana. <verse eid="ISA 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 9:15" />Cimatinne bonchetidaysati huuphe; wordo tamaarsiya nabeti goyna. <verse eid="ISA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 9:16" />Ha asaa kaaletheysati balethoosona; enta kaalleysatika baloosona. <verse eid="ISA 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 9:17" />Hessa gisho, Goday enta na7atethatan ufaytenna; yi7o naytasinne am7etas qadhetenna. Asi ubbay iitanne Xoosse eronnaysa gidana; ubbay ba doonan iitabaa odetees. He ubban Godaa hanqoy simmibeenna; iya kushey dendida bessan de7ees.<verse eid="ISA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 9:18" />Tami kinchotenne agunthi meysada iitatethi xuuggees; siketida wori xuugetin, cuyay tuussada keyeysada keyees. <verse eid="ISA 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 9:19" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa hanquwan biittay xuugetana; asika tama oysethiyaba gidana; oonika ba ishaa ashshanaw qopenna. <verse eid="ISA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 9:20" />Enti ushacha baggara bonqana, shin koshatana; enti haddirsa baggara maana, shin kallokona; enti banta yelida nayta maana. <verse eid="ISA 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 9:21" />Minaasey Efreema, Efreemika Minaase maana; enti issife gididi Yihuda biitta morkana. He ubban Godaa hanqoy simmibeenna; iya kushey dendida bessan de7ees.<verse eid="ISA 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ISA 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 10:1" />Iita higgenne un7ethiya awaajo kesseyisata ayye! <verse eid="ISA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 10:2" />Hessan enti manqota, am7etanne yi7ota pirdaa geellayosona; am7etanne yi7ota aquwa bonqoosona. <verse eid="ISA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 10:3" />I, haaho biittafe yaa metuwan seeriya wode hinte waananee? Maado demmanaw oodeko baqatanee? Hinte shaluwa awun qottanee? <verse eid="ISA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 10:4" />Hinte di7etida asaara gooshetana; hayqida asaa giddon zin7ana. He ubban Godaa hanqoy simmibeenna; iya kushey dendida bessan de7ees.<verse eid="ISA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asoorey Pirdetana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 10:5" />Goday haysada yaagees; “Ta yiluwas pirconne ta hanquwas xam7a gidida Asoore biitta ayye!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:24-27">Isa 14:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 1:1-3">Naho 1:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:13-15">Sofo 2:13-15</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 10:6" />Enta shaluwa di77anaadanne bonqanaada; oge urqada enta yedhanaada Xoosse eronna kawotethaa bolla taani Asoore kiittana; tana hanqethida asaa bolla iya yeddana. <verse eid="ISA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 10:7" />Shin Asoore kawoy haysa halchibeenna; iya wozanay haysa qopibeenna. I qopiday daro kawotethata dhaysanaasa. <verse eid="ISA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 10:8" />Hessa gisho, I yaagidi ceeqetees; ‘Ta toora moconati ubbay kawota gidokonaayee?’ <verse eid="ISA 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 10:9" />Kalinoy Karkamisha katamaa mela gidenneyee? Hamaati Arfada katamaa mela gidenneyee? Samaarey Damasqo katamaa mela gidenneyee? <verse eid="ISA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 10:10" />Yerusalaameninne Samaaren de7iya eeqatape dariya eeqata goyinniya kawotethata seeranaw taani ta kushiya yeddas. <verse eid="ISA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 10:11" />Taani Samaare katamaa bollanne iya eeqa misileta bolla oothidaysada Yerusalaame katamaa bollanne iya eeqa misileta bolla oothikinaayee?” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 10:12" />Goday Xiyoone deriya bollanne Yerusalaame bolla ba oosuwa ubbaa polidaape guye, Asoore kawa iya otoruwasinne ceequwas iya seerana.<verse eid="ISA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 10:13" />Asoore kawoy haysada yaagees: “Ta kushe minotethan, ta cincatethaaninne ta akeekan haysa oothas. Taani kawotethata giddon de7iya zawata shoddas; enta shaluwa bonqas; ta wolqan kawotethata araatape wodhisas. <verse eid="ISA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 10:14" />Asi kafo keethan kushe yeddeysada taani kawotethaa shaluwan ta kushiya yeddas. Qassi dogetida phuuphuleta shiisheysada taani biitta ubbaa shiishas. Ba qefiya qaathiday woyko doona phuqiday woyko waassiday issoyka baawa” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 10:15" />Kalti baara qanxiya addiya bolla dendanaw danda7ii? Woyko magaazey banan go7etiya addiya bolla otoranaw danda7ii? Kushey denthonna xam7i bana baw denthii? Guufey oykiya asi bayna baw hemetii? <verse eid="ISA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 10:16" />Hessa gisho, Goday, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Xoossay, iya mino olanchota bolla gilqisiya harge yeddana. Iya bonchuwa laxo tami maana. <verse eid="ISA 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 10:17" />Isra7eele Poo7oy tama gidana; enta Geeshshay laco gidana. Iya agunthanne iya kinchotiya issi gallas xuuggananne maana. <verse eid="ISA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 10:18" />Hargey ase gilqiseysada Goday ba wora mitha bonchuwanne ba aradda biitta bonchuwa dhaysana. <verse eid="ISA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 10:19" />Woran attiya mithay daro guuthi gidiya gisho, hari attoshin guutha na7ika taybidi wursana.<verse eid="ISA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Attida Guuthati Simmana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 10:20" />He wode Isra7eelepenne Yihudape attida guuthati bantana shocidaysan gidonashin, tuma Godan, Isra7eele Geeshshan zempana. <verse eid="ISA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 10:21" />Attida Yihuda asay Wolqaama Xoossaako simmana. <verse eid="ISA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 10:22" />Neno Isra7eele, neeni abba gaxan de7iya shafiya mela darikoka, attida guuthata xalaali simmana. Xillotethi kumida dhayoy iya asaas awaajetis. <verse eid="ISA 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 10:23" />Ee, Goday, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Xoossay sa7a ubbaa bolla ehanaw qopida dhayuwa ehana.<verse eid="ISA 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 10:24" />Hessa gisho, Goday, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Xoossay haysada yaagees: “Xiyoonen de7iya ta asaw, Gibxeti oothidaysada Asooreti hintena xam7an shociya wodenne banta gumba hinte bolla denthiya wode yayyofite. <verse eid="ISA 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 10:25" />Guutha wodepe guye, taani hinte bolla hanqetidaysa aggana; hessafe guye, ta hanqoy enta dhaysanaw dendana” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 10:26" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday Oreeba shuchaa matan Midiyaameta shocidaysada enta lisson shocana. I Gibxen oothidaysada ba xam7a abba bolla denthana. <verse eid="ISA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 10:27" />He gallas, iya toohoy hinte hashiyape wodhana; iya qambaray hinte morgefe kichana. Hinte ordida gisho qambaray meqana.<verse eid="ISA 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 10:28" />Morkiya wotaadarati Gaye katamaa gelidosona; Migroonara kanthidosona; banta ola miishiya Mikmaasa wothidosona. <verse eid="ISA 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 10:29" />Enti ogiyara kanthi aadhidi, Geeban aqidosona. Raman de7iya asay kokoridosona; Gib7an, kawa Saa7ola kataman de7iya asay baqatidosona. <verse eid="ISA 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 10:30" />Galima asaw, waaso goochite! Laysha asaw, si7ite! Anatoota asaw, oysha zaarite! <verse eid="ISA 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 10:31" />Madimana asay baqatidosona; Gebima asay banta shempuwas qosetidosona. <verse eid="ISA 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 10:32" />Morkiya wotaadarati hachi Nooban de7oosona; enti Xiyoone zuma bolla eqidi, banta kushiya qaathidi, Yerusalaame katamaa babisoosona.<verse eid="ISA 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 10:33" />Heko, Goday, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Xoossay, tasheta gita wolqan shaqana; aduqida mithati qanxetana; dhoqa gidaysati kawuyana. <verse eid="ISA 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 10:34" />Goday siketida wora kallotana gakanaw qanxana; Libaanosey Wolqaamaa sinthan kundana.<verse eid="ISA 10:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ISA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Isseyepe Keyda Aaca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 11:1" />Isseye durumay aacana; iya xaphuwape ayfiya tashey keyana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:5">Qon 5:5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:6">22:6</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 11:2" />Godaa Ayyaanay iya bolla shempana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:2">cincatethaanne akeeka Ayyaanay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:2">zoriyanne wolqaa Ayyaanay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:2">eratethaanne Godaas yayiya Ayyaanay, iya bolla shempana.<verse eid="ISA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 11:3" />Godaas yayyidi ufaytees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:3">ba ayfey be7idaban coo pirdenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:3">woyko ba haythay si7idaban coo kuuyenna.<verse eid="ISA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 11:4" />Shin I, manqotas xillotethan pirdana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:4">sa7an de7iya metootanchotas suuretethan kuuyana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:4">I ba inxarsaa xam7an sa7aa shocana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:4">ba doona shempuwan iitata wodhana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 2:8">2 Tase 2:8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 11:5" />Xillotethi iya xeessa danco gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:5">ammanetethi iya miyaas saqe gidana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:14">Efe 6:14</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 11:6" />Suudhumey dorsa marara issife daana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:6">maahey deesha marara issife zin7ana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:6">Mari gaammo butalera issife hemetana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:6">guutha na7i enta heemmana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:25">Isa 65:25</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 11:7" />Miizinne babanthi issife heemetana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:7">enta marati issife zin7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:7">gaammoy boorada kale maana.<verse eid="ISA 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 11:8" />Dhammiya na7i shoosha ollan kaa7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:8">dhanthi duuxida na7i wodhiya shoosha ollan ba kushiya yeddana.<verse eid="ISA 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 11:9" />Ta geeshsha zumaa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:9">oonika qohetenna woyko dhayenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:9">Abbi haathan kumeysada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:9">sa7i Godaa eron kumana.<verse eid="ISA 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 11:10" />He wode Isseye xaphoy asaas malla gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:10">kawotetha ubbay iya koyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:10">I de7iya bessay bonchetana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:12">Roome 15:12</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 11:11" />He gallas Goday attida ba asaa, Asoorepe, Gibxefe, Phatroosape, Tophefe, Elaamape, Sana7oorepe, Hamaatapenne yuushoy abban teqetida biittafe nam7antho ehanaw ba kushiya zaaridi yeddana. <verse eid="ISA 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 11:12" />I kawotethatas malla dhoqu oothidi denthana; Isra7eelepe laaletidaysata issife gathana; Yihudape sa7aa oyddu baggan zeretidaysata shiishana.<verse eid="ISA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 11:13" />Hessafe guye, Efreema qanaatey iyape kichana; Yihuda morketethay iyape qanxetana. Efreemi Yihuda qanaatenna; Yihudi Efreema morkenna. <verse eid="ISA 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 11:14" />Enti wuloha baggan de7iya Filisxeeme biitta bolla gupi wodhana; enti doloha baggan de7iya asaa bonqana. Enti Edoome bollanne Moo7abe bolla banta kushiya wothana; Amooneti entaw haaretana. <verse eid="ISA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 11:15" />Goday Gibxe matan de7iya Zo7o Abbaa melisana; ba melsiya carkuwara ba kushiya Efraxiisa shaafa bolla qaathana. Yaatidi asay mela bessaara pinnana mela laapun guutha shaafa kessidi shaakana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:12">Qon 16:12</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 11:16" />Isra7eele asay Gibxe biittafe keyiya wode ogey keydaysada, attida iya asay, Asoore biittafe simmiya ogey keyana.<verse eid="ISA 11:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ISA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Galata Mazmure</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 12:1" />He wode hinte haysada yaagidi yexana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:1">“Godaw, neeni ta bolla hanqetadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:1">shin ha77i ne hanquwafe simmadasa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:1">Tana minthethadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:1">hessa gisho, taani nena galatayis.<verse eid="ISA 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 12:2" />Xoossay ta atotetha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:2">taani iyan ammanetayis, yayike.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:2">Goday Xoossay, ta wolqaanne yethaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:2">I ta atotetha”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:2">Kessa 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:14">Maz 118:14</ref>.</char></note> yaagana.<verse eid="ISA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 12:3" />Atotetha pultuwafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:3">hinte haathe ufaysan duuqana.<verse eid="ISA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 12:4" />He gallas hinte yaagidi yexana:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:4">“Godaa galatite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:4">Iya sunthaa xeegite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:4">Iya oosota kawotethata ubbaas odite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:4">I gita gideysa awaajite.<verse eid="ISA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 12:5" />Goday gita ooso oothida gisho, iyaw yexite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:5">haysi sa7a ubban ereto.<verse eid="ISA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 12:6" />Isra7eele Geeshshay hinte giddon gita gidiya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:6">Xiyoone asaw, ililite, ufaysan yexite!” yaagana.<verse eid="ISA 12:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ISA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Xoossay Babiloone Seerana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 13:1" />Amoxe na7ay, Isayaasi Goday Babilooneba qoncisin be7idaysi haysa.<verse eid="ISA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 13:2" />Aykoy bayna deriya bolla malla essidi, hinte qaala dhoqu oothidi waassite; enti halaqata pengiyara gelana mela wuttite. <verse eid="ISA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 13:3" />Taani hanqetidaysata seerana mela ta geeshshata kiittas; ta xoonoy ufaysiya ta wolqaamata xeegas.<verse eid="ISA 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 13:4" />Daro asay wocameysada deriya huuphiyan de7iya wocamaa si7ite! Qassi kawotethati issife shiiqidi palamiya palama si7ite! Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday olanchota olas giigisis. <verse eid="ISA 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 13:5" />Godaynne iya hanqo ola miishey biitta ubbaa dhaysanaw haaho biittafe, salo gaxape yoosona.<verse eid="ISA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 13:6" />Godaa gallasay matida gisho yeekite! He gallasay Ubbaafe Wolqaama Xoossaa matape dhaysanaw yaana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:15">Iyyu 1:15</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 13:7" />Hessa gisho, yashshan enta kushey doccana; asa ubbaa wozanay til7ana. <verse eid="ISA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 13:8" />Enti dagammana; iqethinne un7etethi enta oykana. Yelo keyida maccasada enti inxaxana. Enti dagammidi issoy issuwa xeellana; enta som7oy bido gidis. <verse eid="ISA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 13:9" />Heko biitta baysa kessanawunne iyan de7iya nagaranchota dhaysanaw yiloninne suullida hanqon Godaa gallasay yaana. <verse eid="ISA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 13:10" />Salo xoolintotinne xoolinto koceti banta poo7uwa diggana; doliya away dhumana; ageenayka ba poo7uwa immenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 32:7">Hiz 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:29">Maato 24:29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-25">Mar 13:24-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25">Luqa 21:25</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12-13">Qon 6:12-13</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 13:11" />Goday, “Taani ha sa7aa iya iitatethaa gisho, iitataka enta nagara gisho seerana. Taani otoranchota otoruwa shaarana; iitata ceequwa kawushana. <verse eid="ISA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 13:12" />Attidaysati walahi bayna worqafe al7o gidana; asa na7i Ofira worqafe aadhidi boncho gidana. <verse eid="ISA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 13:13" />Hessa gisho, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa hanquwan, iya hanquwa suulaa gallas, taani salota kokorsana; sa7aaka iya bessaafe qaathana” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 13:14" />Shankafe baqatiya gaarada woyko heemmiya asi bayna dorsa wudeda asi ubbay ba asaako simmana; ubbay ba biitta baqatana. <verse eid="ISA 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 13:15" />Bentida oonika cadetana; oyketida oonika mashshan hayqana. <verse eid="ISA 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 13:16" />Enta guutha nayti enta sinthan busetana; enta keethay bonqetana; enta macheta hara asi iissana.<verse eid="ISA 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 13:17" />Bira koyonnanne worqan ufaytonna Meedona asaa taani enta bolla denthana. <verse eid="ISA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 13:18" />Enta dongey na7atethata wodhana; yooga naytaka maarokona; enta ayfey naytas qadhetenna. <verse eid="ISA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 13:19" />Kawotethatas boncho, ba asaas alleeqo gidida Babiloone biitta, Goday Sodoomedanne Gamoorada shiri yeggana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Medhe 19:24</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 13:20" />He biittan asi uttenna; woyko yeletaape yeletaa gakanaw yan asi deenna. Arabe asay yan banta dunkaaniya tolokona; dorse heemmeysatika yan banta wudiya heemmokona. <verse eid="ISA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 13:21" />Shin bazzo do7ati yan aqana; workanati enta keethaa kumana; guttoti yan daana; yanchoti yan keexana; bazzo deeshati yan gupana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:14">Isa 34:14</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:14">Sofo 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:2">Qon 18:2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 13:22" />Enta keethatan godarey waassana; enta kawo gadhon workanati boccana. Iya wodey matis; iya gallasayka gam7enna.<verse eid="ISA 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ISA 14" />
  <para style="s1">Di7ope Simo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 14:1" />Goday Yayqoobas qadhetana; Isra7eele zaaridi doorana; enta, enta buzo biittan wothana. Betanchoti entara issifana, Yayqooba soo asaara oyketana. <verse eid="ISA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 14:2" />Kawotethati enta, enta biitta ehana. Isra7eele asay entana maccanne adde aylle oothidi Godaa biittan haarana. Enti bantana di7idaysata di7ana; bantana haaridaysata haarana.<verse eid="ISA 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 14:3" />Goday hintena, hinte un7aafe, metuwapenne hinte haaretida iita aylletethaafe shempisiya wode, <verse eid="ISA 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 14:4" />hinte Babiloone kawa bolla haysada yaagidi qelqisana. Un7etheysi waanidi aggidee? Iya hanquwa suulay waanidi attidee? <verse eid="ISA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 14:5" />Goday kawotethata xam7aanne haareyisata gumba menthis. <verse eid="ISA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 14:6" />Enti asaa zawi bayna hanquwan shocidosona; bantana xoonidaysata qanxonna un7ethishe de7idosona. <verse eid="ISA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 14:7" />Shin biitta ubbay shempidi de7is; ufaysan yexis. <verse eid="ISA 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 14:8" />Hari attoshin, Libaanose zigatinne xiiddati kawa kundethan ufaytidi, “Neeni kawuyada kundidaape guye, nuna qanxanaw yey baawa” yaagosona. <verse eid="ISA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 14:9" />Neeni yaa wode, Si7ooley nena mokanaw giigis; I kase biitta kaalethida asaa moytilleta, nena sarothana mela denthethees; qassi kase kawo gidida ubbaa enta araatape denthidi essees. <verse eid="ISA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 14:10" />Enti ubbay haysada yaagana. “Heko neka nuuda wolqa dhayadasa; nu mela gidadasa.” <verse eid="ISA 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 14:11" />Kase diithi diixin sabetiya ne bonchoy ha77i Si7oole gelis. Ollathi neeni zin7iya hiixa; guxuney neeni ma7iya afila gidana yaagana.<verse eid="ISA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 14:12" />Neno wonta na7aw, guura bakalaw, salope waana kundadii? Neno kawotethata kawushidayso waana qanxetada sa7an wodhadii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:10">Qon 8:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 9:1">9:1</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 14:13" />Neeni ne wozanan, “Taani salo keyana; ta kawotethaa araata Xoossaa xoolintotape bollara wothana; taani pudeha bagga gaxan shiiqo deriya huuphen uttana<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:23">Maato 11:23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:15">Luqa 10:15</ref>.</char></note>. <verse eid="ISA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 14:14" />Taani shaarati de7iya dhoqa bessaafe bolla aadhana; taani, tana Ubbaafe Dhoqa Xoossaa daanisana” yaagadasa. <verse eid="ISA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 14:15" />Shin neeni Si7oolen, hirki ciimmo ollan duge yegetadasa.<verse eid="ISA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 14:16" />Nena be7idaysati, “Biitta qaathidaysi, kawotethata kokorsidaysi, <verse eid="ISA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 14:17" />sa7aa biitta bazzo kessidaysi, sa7an de7iya katamata shiri yeggidaysi, ba qasho asata yeddonna ixidaysi haysee?” yaagidi tishshi oothidi xeellana.<verse eid="ISA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 14:18" />Kawotethata kawoti ubbay ba duufon duufon bonchon zin7ana. <verse eid="ISA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 14:19" />Shin neeni ixetida tasheda ne duufuwape gaxa holettadasa. Ne ahay mashshan hayqida ahaninne ollan de7iya shuchatako duge wodhidaysata ahan kametis. Neeni tohon yedhetida aha mela gidadasa. <verse eid="ISA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 14:20" />Neeni ne biitta dhaysida gishonne ne asaa wodhida gisho entara moogetaka. Iitaa sunthay kochay merinaw xeegetofo. <verse eid="ISA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 14:21" />Enti dendidi biitta laattonna; sa7a ubbaa katama xalaala oothonna mela enta aawata nagaraa gisho, iya nayta wodhanaw giigisite. <verse eid="ISA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 14:22" />Taani “Enta bolla dendana; enta sunthaa, enta kochaanne enta yeletaa Babiloonepe dhaysana. <verse eid="ISA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 14:23" />Taani Babiloone quxarey de7iya bessinne haathi eelliya bessi oothana; taani gado piton iya pittana” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="ISA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asoorey Dhayana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 14:24" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday haysada yaagidi caaqis: “Taani halchidaysada hanana; taani qopidaysada poletana. <verse eid="ISA 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 14:25" />Taani Asoore asaa ta biittan mentherethana; ta deriya bolla iya yedhana. Iya qambaray enta bollafe, iya toohoy enta hashiyape kichana” yaagis. <verse eid="ISA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 14:26" />Sa7a ubbaas qofetida qofay haysa; kawotethata ubbaa bolla micetida kusheyka haysa. <verse eid="ISA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 14:27" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday haysa qopida gisho iya digganaw danda7ey oonee? Iya kushey micetis; hessa guye zaaranaw danda7ey oonee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:5-34">Isa 10:5-34</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 1:1-3">Nahi 1:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:13-15">Sofo 2:13-15</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filisxeemey Dhayana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 14:28" />Kawoy Akaazi hayqida laythi odetida qaalay haysa:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:20">2 Kawo 16:20</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 28:27">2 Taari 28:27</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 14:29" />Hinteno Filisxeeme asaw, hintena shocida xam7ay me77ida gisho ufaytofite. He shoosha kochaafe hasoy keyana; iya kochay qassi xongetiya shooshi gidana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 47:1-7">Ermi 47:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:15-17">Hiz 25:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Iyyu 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:6-8">Amo 1:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:4-7">Sofo 2:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:5-7">Zaka 9:5-7</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 14:30" />Manqofe manqoti ta qooruwan heemetana; metootanchoti wopu gidi zin7ana. Shin taani ne kochaa koshan wursana; neepe attida guuthata wodhana.<verse eid="ISA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 14:31" />Neno pengiyaw, yeeka! Neno katamaw, waassa! Hinteno Filisxeeme asaw, hinte ubbay hirgan til7ite! Pudeha baggafe cuyi keyidi yees; he cugaape duuxidi guye attey baawa. <verse eid="ISA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 14:32" />He kawotethay kiitida asatas woygidi zaaranee? Goday Xiyoone keexin, qohetida asay I giddon qosetidi attiya bessi demmis.<verse eid="ISA 14:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ISA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Moo7abey Dhayana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 15:1" />Moo7abe biittaba Goday odida qaalay haysa:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:1—16:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:10-12">Isa 25:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:1-47">Ermi 48:1-47</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:8-11">Hiz 25:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 2:1-3">Amo 2:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:8-11">Sofo 2:8-11</ref>.</char></note> Moo7aben de7iya Era katamaynne Qiira katamay issi qamma laaletidi dhayidosona. <verse eid="ISA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 15:2" />Diboonan de7iya asay banta eeqa keethan yeekanaw dhoqa bessi keyidosona. Moo7abe asay Nebosinne Medebaas yeekees. Huuphe ubbay buluusetis; buuchi ubbay meedetis. <verse eid="ISA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 15:3" />Oge bolla kayo ma7o ma7oosona; pooqe bollanne dabaaba ubban yeekoosonanne afuthi dharcoosona. <verse eid="ISA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 15:4" />Haseboona asaynne Elaala asay waassoosona; enta waasoy Yahaaxa gakanaw si7etees. Hessa gisho, olas dancida Moo7abe wotaadareti banta qaala dhoqu oothidi waassidosona; enta shempoy kokoris. <verse eid="ISA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 15:5" />Taani Moo7abes wozanape yeekas; iyan de7iya asay Zo7aarenne Egilaat-Shelisha katamaa baqatis. Enti Luhita ogiyan yeekishe boosona; baggati qassi Horonayma biya ogiyan, banta dhayuwa gisho waaso goochidosona. <verse eid="ISA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 15:6" />Namirima haathati melidosona; maatay miccis; aacay shullis; cil7obay aybika baawa. <verse eid="ISA 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 15:7" />Hessa gisho, enti banta shiishida shaluwanne minja tooki ekidi, Ahaya mithay de7iya zangaarape hefinthi efoosona. <verse eid="ISA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 15:8" />Moo7abe heera ubbay waaso xalaala gidis; enta waasoy Eglaamanne Bi7eer-Elime gakanaw si7etees. <verse eid="ISA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 15:9" />Dimoona haathati suuthi gididosona; shin, ha77ika taani Dimoona katamaa bolla kaseysafe aadhiya meto ehana. Moo7abepe kessi ekidi baqateyisata bollanne he biittan attidaysata bolla gaammo yeddada wursana.<verse eid="ISA 15:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ISA 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 16:1" />Moo7abe asaw, bazzo biya ogiyan de7iya Seelape urge dorsata imota oothidi, Yerusalaamen de7iya biitta haareysas yeddite. <verse eid="ISA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 16:2" />Moo7abe maccasay banta keethafe goodetida kafotada Arnoona shaafa pinniya bessan laaletana. <verse eid="ISA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 16:3" />Moo7abe asay Yihuda asaako, “Nuna zorite; nuna nu morketape ashshite; seeta gallasan mitha kuyada hinte kuyaa nu bolla kuyayte. Goodeteyisata qosite; qosetidaysata aathidi immopite. <verse eid="ISA 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 16:4" />Moo7abepe goodeteysati hinte giddon de7o; enta dhaysanaw koyeysatape qosetidi attiya besse gidite. Enta un7etheysati wuridosona; enta dhayoy attis; otoranchoti biittafe dhayidosona. <verse eid="ISA 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 16:5" />Hessafe guye, siiqon issi kawotetha araatay eqana; he araatan, Dawita kochaafe issi ammanetiya kawoy uttana. I suuretetha koyana; xillotethaa oothanaw ellesana” yaagana.<verse eid="ISA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 16:6" />Yihuda asay, “Moo7abe asay ay mela otoriyako nu enta otoruwa si7ida; enta ceequwanne enta cashshaa si7ida; shin enta otoroy hada” yaagana.<verse eid="ISA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 16:7" />Hessa gisho, Moo7abey baw yeeko; asi ubbayka Moo7abes yeeko. Qir-Hereesan hinte de7iya wode mida lo77o kathaa hassayishe yeekite. <verse eid="ISA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 16:8" />Haseboona goshshaynne Sebama woyne gadey dhayis. Kawotethata halaqati yedherethida tasheti mela biitta kanthidi Ya7izeera gakidosona; enta aacay daayidi, abba pinnis. <verse eid="ISA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 16:9" />Taani Ya7izeera katamaas yeekidaysada Sebama katamaa woynetas yeekayis. Haseboona katamaasine El7aala katamaas, taani ta afuthaa gussayis. Hinte mithaa ayfiyanne hinte bootida kathaa bolla oli dendis. <verse eid="ISA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 16:10" />Goshsha gadiyape ufaysinne hashshu guussi eketis. Woyne gadiyan mazmurey yexetenna. Ufaysan woyne gum7iya bessan gum7iya asi baawa; taani gum7eyisata ililsaa dhaysas. <verse eid="ISA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 16:11" />Hessa gisho, ta wozanay Moo7abes, ta garsa asatethayka Qir-Hereesas yeekees. <verse eid="ISA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 16:12" />Moo7abey ba zumaa bolla keykoka, bana coo daabursees; I woossanaw ba eeqa keethi gelikoka bana aykoka maaddenna.<verse eid="ISA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 16:13" />Goday kasetidi Moo7abeba odida qaalay haysa. <verse eid="ISA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 16:14" />Shin ha77i Goday, “Une oosancho wodey guutha gideysa mela Moo7abe bonchoynne iya darotethay heedzu laytha giddon wurana. Iyan attiya asay pathonaysatanne wolqi baynayisata gidana” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ISA 17" />
  <para style="s1">Damasqoy Dhayana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 17:1" />Damasqoba Goday haysada yaagees: “Heko, hizape guye Damasqoy katama gidonnoshin, laaletha doore gidana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:23-27">Ermi 49:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:3-5">Amo 1:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:1">Zaka 9:1</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 17:2" />Aroora katamati asi bayna baysa biitta gidana; yan mehey heemetana; enta yashshiyabay deenna. <verse eid="ISA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 17:3" />Efreemape Miixati, Damasqofe kawotethay dhayana; Soorepe attida guuthati Isra7eele asaa bonchuwa mela gidana” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="ISA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 17:4" />“He wode Isra7eele bonchoy qaaretana; iya ordetethay gilqana. <verse eid="ISA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 17:5" />Isra7eeley, kathi caki ekidi keyida goshsha gade mela gidana; woyko kathi caki simmin kallotida Raafayme zangaara mela gidana. <verse eid="ISA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 17:6" />Shamaho qoqofi simmin, xeeran nam7u woyko heedzu ayfeti atteysada woyko issi yangiya bolla oyddu woyko ichashu ayfeti atteysada Isra7eelepe guuthati attana” yaagees Goday Isra7eele Xoossay.<verse eid="ISA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 17:7" />He gallas asay bantana medhidaysako, banta ayfiyaka Isra7eele Geeshshaako zaarana. <verse eid="ISA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 17:8" />Enti banta kushen giigisida yarsho bessaako xeellokona; Asheera eeqa misiliyas gidin, ixaane cuyisanaw enti banta kushen medhida yarsho bessa bonchokona.<verse eid="ISA 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 17:9" />He wode Isra7eele asaa gaason Hiwenne Amoore katamati laaletidaysada enta mino katamati laaletana; baysa gidana. <verse eid="ISA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 17:10" />Hinte hintena ashshiya Xoossaa dogideta; hinte qoseti attiya zaalla qopibeketa. Hessa gisho, neeni lo77o mithaanne kare biittafe yida lo77o atakiltiya tokikoka, <verse eid="ISA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 17:11" />he gallas enti diccidi gakana mela oothikoka, qassi neeni zerida wontethe enti ciiyakoka neeni ayfe demmaka. Iya bessan paxonna hargenne meto cakana.<verse eid="ISA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 17:12" />Heko, abba beetada guummiya daro asaa, qassi wolqaama haathada waassiya kawotethata ayye! <verse eid="ISA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 17:13" />Kawotethati daro haathada guummoosona; shin Goday enta seerana. Enti zumaa huuphen de7iya buure carkoy dentheysadanne gotey baana dentheysada enta denthidi haaho bessi laallana. <verse eid="ISA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 17:14" />Sa7i qammiya wode enti dagammana; sa7i wontanaape sinthe enti dhayana. Nuna wolqan ekeysatanne bonqeyisata qaaday haysa.<verse eid="ISA 17:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ISA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Tophe Bolla Odetida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 18:1" />Tophe shaafatape hefinthan giiriya qefeti de7iya biitta ayye! <verse eid="ISA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 18:2" />He biittay, kiitetiya asata mayre wogolon wothidi Nayle Shaafa bollara kiittees. Hinteno, eeson kiiteteysato, adusenne liiqo asaako, mataninne haahon yashshiya asaako, wolqaamanne xooniya kawotethaako, shaafan enta zaway shaaketida biittako biite.<verse eid="ISA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 18:3" />Hinteno, sa7an de7iya ubbato, hinteno, biittan de7eysato, zumaa bolla malli eqiya wode hinte be7ana; moyzey punetiya wode hinte si7ana. <verse eid="ISA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 18:4" />Goday taako, “Seeta gallas si77i gidi poo7iya awada, qassi kathi cakiya ageenan, hombiya qamman bentiya aka mela taani si77i gada, ta de7iya bessaafe duge xeellana” yaagis. <verse eid="ISA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 18:5" />Kathaa cakiya wodiyape kase, ciishshay qoletidi simmin, woyne teeriya wode oco baacan xeera qanxeysada I he biitta asaa dhaysana. <verse eid="ISA 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 18:6" />Enti ubbay deriya huuphiyan de7iya, miyaba wochiya kafotasinne do7atas attana. Kafoti balgon, do7ati bonen enta midi shaacana.<verse eid="ISA 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 18:7" />He wode adussenne liiqo asaape, mataninne haahon yashshiya asaape, wolqaamanne xooniya kawotethaafe, zaway shaafan shaaketida biittafe, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaas imoti Xiyoone Zumaa, iya sunthay de7iya bessaa yaana.<verse eid="ISA 18:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ISA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Gibxes Odetida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 19:1" />Gibxe bolla Goday haysada yaagidi odis:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 46:2-26">Ermi 46:2-26</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 29:1-32:32">Hiz 29:1—32:32</ref>.</char></note> “Heko, Goday eesotiya shaara toggidi, Gibxe yees. Gibxe eeqati iya sinthan kokorana; Gibxe asaa wozanay yashshan til7ana. <verse eid="ISA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 19:2" />Gibxe asaa issuwa issuwa bolla denthana. Ishay ishaa bolla, shooroy shooruwa bolla, katamay katamaa bolla, kawotethay kawotethaa bolla dendana. <verse eid="ISA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 19:3" />Gibxe asay eesho dhayana; taani enta halchuwa hada oothana. Enti banta eeqata, moytillera odeteyisata, bitanchotanne marota zore oychana. <verse eid="ISA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 19:4" />Taani wozana mino gidida Gibxe kawa kushen aathada immana; I enta haarana” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="ISA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 19:5" />Nayle Shaafa guuxi guuxi baana; haathayka melana. <verse eid="ISA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 19:6" />Dhaway xinqana; Gibxe haathati guuxananne melana; mayreynne maqay shullana; <verse eid="ISA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 19:7" />Nayle Shaafa gaxan de7iya cil7obay melana; iya heeran zeretida katha ubbay melananne dhayana. <verse eid="ISA 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 19:8" />Molo oykeysati kayotana; Nayle shaafan gitenne molo manxaqo yeggiya ubbay yeekananne doccana. <verse eid="ISA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 19:9" />Paadetida talbafe liino ma7o ootheysati, bootha ma7o daddiya dorzeti ufaysi qanxana. <verse eid="ISA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 19:10" />Piiqeysatinne une oothiya ubbay kayotana.<verse eid="ISA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 19:11" />Xo7aane haareysati eeya; Gibxe kawa zoriya cincati pathonna zore zoroosona. Yaatin, hinte Gibxe kawako, “Nuuni cincata nayta; nuuni beni kawota nayta” gaanaw waanidi danda7eetii? <verse eid="ISA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 19:12" />Yaatin, ne cinca asati ha77i awun de7oona? Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday Gibxe bolla oothanaw halchidaba ane enti new odonne nena erisonna. <verse eid="ISA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 19:13" />Xo7aane haareysati eeyidosona; Mempisa haareysati cimetidosona. Gibxe zoriya gita asati iya balethidosona. <verse eid="ISA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 19:14" />Goday enta giddon eeyisiya ayyaana yeddis; enti mathotida asi ba cooshshan gondoreteysada Gibxey ba ooso ubban gondoretana mela oothidosona. <verse eid="ISA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 19:15" />Zamboy woyko boozi, zamba tashey woyko mayrey Gibxen oothanabay aybika baawa.<verse eid="ISA 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 19:16" />He gallas Gibxe asay maccasa mela gidana. Enti Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday enta bolla qaathiya iya kushiya be7idi yashshan kokorana. <verse eid="ISA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 19:17" />Yihudi Gibxe yashisana; Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday enta bolla oothanaw qopida qofaa gisho Yihudaba si7iya ubbay yayyana.<verse eid="ISA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 19:18" />He gallas Gibxe biittan de7iya ichashu katamati Kanaane qaalan odeteysatanne Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaas ammanetanaw caaqeyisata gidana. He katamatape issoy, “Awa Katama” geetetidi xeegetana.<verse eid="ISA 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 19:19" />He wode Gibxe biittas gidduwan, Godaas yarsho bessay giigana; qassi Gibxe biitta zawan Godaas tuussi eqana. <verse eid="ISA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 19:20" />Hessi Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaas Gibxe biittan mallanne marka gidana. Enti bantana un7etheyisata gisho Godaako waassiya wode entaw ashsheysa kiittidi enta ashshana. <verse eid="ISA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 19:21" />He wode Goday Gibxe biittan eretidaysa gidana; Gibxe asay he gallas Godaa erana. Yarshonne katha yarsho eki yidi iya goyinnana. Enti Godaas qangananne banta qangetha gathana. <verse eid="ISA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 19:22" />Goday Gibxe biitta shocana; iyo zaaridi pathana. Enti Godaako simmana; I enta woosa si7idi pathana.<verse eid="ISA 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 19:23" />He gallas Gibxefe Asoore gakanaw dalga ogey keyana; Asoore asay Gibxe, Gibxe asay Asoore simeretana; Gibxe asay Asoore asaara issife goyinnana. <verse eid="ISA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 19:24" />He gallas Isra7eeley Gibxeranne Asoorera heedzantho biitta gididi, sa7aas anjo gidana. <verse eid="ISA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 19:25" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday enta haysada yaagidi anjana: “Ta ase gidida Gibxey anjeto; ta kushe ooso gidida Assory anjeto; ta laata gidida Isra7eeley anjeto” yaagana.<verse eid="ISA 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ISA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Gibxenne Tophe Bolla Odetida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 20:1" />Asoore kawoy Sargooni kiitida toora moconati yidi, Filisxeeme katamaa gidida Ashdooda olidi oykida laythi, <verse eid="ISA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 20:2" />Goday Amoxe na7aa Isayaasa haysada yaagis: “Ne kayo ma7uwa qaara; ne tohuwape caamma kessa” yaagis. Isayaasi Goday gidaysada oothidi kallonne mela tohon hemetis.<verse eid="ISA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 20:3" />Yaatin Goday haysada yaagis: “Ta aylley Isayaasi Gibxenne Tophe bolla gakana metuwas malla gidana mela heedzu laythi kallonne mela tohon hemetis. <verse eid="ISA 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 20:4" />Hessa gisho, Asoore kawoy, Gibxetas yeella gidana mela Gibxefenne Tophefe di7etida na7atethatanne cimata kallonne mela toho laaggidi efana. <verse eid="ISA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 20:5" />Tophen ammaneteysatinne Gibxen ceeqeteysati yayyana; yeellatana. <verse eid="ISA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 20:6" />He gallas Abbaa gaxan de7iya asay haysada yaagana: ‘Nuna Asoore kawuwape ashshana gidi ufaysi oothidi entako baqatida asaa bolla haysi gakiko, yaatin, nuuni waanidi kessi ekanee?’ yaagana” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 20:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ISA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Babiloone Bolla Odetida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 21:1" />Abbaa matan de7iya bazzuwas odetida qaala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 21:1">Nagebe gotey mentherethishe yeysada olanchoy bazzofe, dhayo biittafe yees.<verse eid="ISA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 21:2" />Taani issi yashshiya qoncethi be7as; aathid immeysi aathidi immees; di77eysi di77ees. Elama keya! Meedona katamaa oyka! Babilooney gathida waayiya taani diggana.<verse eid="ISA 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 21:3" />Hessa gisho ta asatethay saketis; maccasi eqeteysada taani un7etas. Taani si7iyabay tana kokorsis; taani be7iyabay tana daganthis. <verse eid="ISA 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 21:4" />Tana biicoyees; yashshan kokoras; taani ufaysi wothida omarsay un7an laametis.<verse eid="ISA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 21:5" />Gibira giigisidosona; uttiya soo giigisidosona; maanawunne uyanaw uttidosona. Hinteno halaqato, dendite! Hinte gondalliya quchite!<verse eid="ISA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 21:6" />Goday taako haysada yaagis: “Bada haniyaba wochidi new odiya asi wotha. <verse eid="ISA 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 21:7" />Parati gaare goochiya wode, harenne gimale toggeyisata be7iya wode, loythidi xeello; akeekidi be7o” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 21:8" />Wocheysi, “Godaw, gallasinne qamma paci bayna ta shakuwa bolla uttada naagayis. <verse eid="ISA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 21:9" />Heko, nam7a nam7a gididi para gaare toggida asati yoosona” yaagis. I qassika, “Babilooney kundis; iya xoossata misileti sa7an kundidi gaacetidosona” yaagidi waassis. <verse eid="ISA 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 21:10" />Hinteno, wudumman gaacetida ta asaw, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaape, Isra7eele Xoossaafe si7idaba taani hintew odayis.<verse eid="ISA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edoome Bolla Odetida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 21:11" />Edoomeba Goday haysada yaagis: “Issi asi Sayrepe tana xeegidi, naageyso, sa7i wontanaw ay mali attidee? Naageyso, sa7i geeyanaw ay mali attidee?” yaagees. <verse eid="ISA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 21:12" />Naageysi zaaridi, “Sa7i wontana hanees; shin zaari qammana. Hinte oychanaw koyko oychite; simmi yidi oychite” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Arabe Bolla Odetida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 21:13" />Arabe ba Goday haysada yaagees: “Hinteno Daadana zal7anchoto, hinte, hinte caana gimaletara Arabe mela biittan aqana. <verse eid="ISA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 21:14" />Hinteno, Teeman biittan de7iya asaw, saamotidaysatas haathe ehite; koshatidaysatas kathi immite. <verse eid="ISA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 21:15" />Enti mashshafe, shohope shodetida mashshafe, dafetida dongefenne mino olape baqatoosona” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 21:16" />Goday taako haysada yaagis: “Une oosancho wodey wureysada, issi laytha giddon Qedaare boncho ubbay wurana. <verse eid="ISA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 21:17" />Qedaaren de7iya dongen dukiya wolqaama olanchotape guuthati attana; Goday Isra7eele Xoossay hessa odis” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 21:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ISA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalaames Odetida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 22:1" />“Qoncetha Zangaara” geetetiya bessaba Goday odida qaala. Hintena ubbaa aybi un7ethin pooqe keetha bolla keydetii? <verse eid="ISA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 22:2" />Neno waasoy, dirgoyinne wocami kumida katamaw, ne giddon hayqida asati mashshan woyko olan hayqibookona. <verse eid="ISA 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 22:3" />Hinte halaqati ubbay issife baqatidosona; enti dongey bayna coo di7etidosona. Enti haakidi baqatikoka betida ubbay oyketidosona. <verse eid="ISA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 22:4" />Hessa gisho, “Tana aggaagite; ta asaas misha yeeho afuxada yeekana; ta asaa dhayuwas tana minthethopite” yaagas. <verse eid="ISA 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 22:5" />Goday, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Xoossay Qoncetha Zangaaran dagama, yedhetethinne un7a gallas oothis; qassi gimbeti woddiya gallasinne deretako maaddees waassiya gallas oothis.<verse eid="ISA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 22:6" />Elaami ba para gaaretaranne para asatara ba dongiya oykidi yis; Qiira wotaadareti banta gondalleta giigisidosona. <verse eid="ISA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 22:7" />Hinte lo77o zangaarati para gaaretan kumidosona; para asati Yerusalaame pengiya sinthan eqidosona. <verse eid="ISA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 22:8" />I Yihuda miixata qaaris. He gallas Wora Keethan de7iya kawa olaa miisheta be7ideta. <verse eid="ISA 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 22:9" />Dawita Katama giddon laaletha dooriya be7ideta; garsa baggan de7iya ollan haathe kunthideta. <verse eid="ISA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 22:10" />Yerusalaamen de7iya keethata taybideta; dirsaa zaaridi gimbanaw keethata laallideta. <verse eid="ISA 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 22:11" />Kase gal7a zeeruwan de7iya haatha zaaridi, nam7u gimbetape gidduwan olla giigisideta. Shin hinte hessa medhida Xoossaa akeekibeketa; woyko daro wodepe sinthe hessa halchidaysa hassaybeketa.<verse eid="ISA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 22:12" />He gallas Goday, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Xoossay, hintena yeehosinne zelelsas, huuphe buluusanawunne kayo ma7o ma7anaw xeegis. <verse eid="ISA 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 22:13" />Shin hinte hessa aggidi ufaytetanne yexeeta; boorunne dorse shukeeta; ashuwa meeta; woyne uyeeta. Nuuni “Wonto hayqanaw de7iya gisho, hachi maananne uyana” yaageeta.<verse eid="ISA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 22:14" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday haysa taw qoncisis; “Hinte hayqana gakanaw ha nagaray hintew atto geetetenna. Taani Goday, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Xoossay haysa odayis” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 22:15" />Goday, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Xoossay, “Bada kawo gadhon shuumetida Saminasako haysada yaaga; <verse eid="ISA 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 22:16" />Neeni haysan ay oothay? Neeni haysan, zaalla woocada duufo giigisana mela, dhoqa bessan new duufo bookana melanne zaalla woocada new shempo bessi oothana mela oona oychadii? <verse eid="ISA 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 22:17" />Neno mino addiyaw, nena Goday minthidi oykana; cuucummidi wora holana. <verse eid="ISA 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 22:18" />Kooseda nena yuushshidi dalga biittan holana. Neno ne godaa keethaas yeella gidida addiyaw neeni yan hayqana; ne boncho para gaareti yan attana. <verse eid="ISA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 22:19" />Taani nena ne oosuwape kessana; ne shuumatethaafe shaarana. <verse eid="ISA 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 22:20" />He gallas taani Kalqe na7aa, ta aylliya Eliyaqeeme xeegana. <verse eid="ISA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 22:21" />Taani ne ma7uwa iya mayzana; ne dancuwa iya dancisana; ne shuumatetha iyaw immana. I, Yerusalaameninne Yihudan de7iya asaas aawa gidana. <verse eid="ISA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 22:22" />Taani Dawita keethaa qulpiya iyaw immana; I dooyin oonika gordenna; I gordin oonika dooyenna. <verse eid="ISA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 22:23" />Taani iya ammanthiya bessan dhisheda tolana; I ba aawa keethas boncho araata gidana. <verse eid="ISA 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 22:24" />Qandafe oto gakanaw de7iya soo miisheta, kocan kaqeysada, iya aawa keethaa bonchuwa, naytanne, nayta nayta ubbaa iya bolla kaqana” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 22:25" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday haysada yaagees: “He gallas ammanthiya bessan dhishida toley kichana; qanxettananne kundana. Iya bolla kaqetida tooho ubbay duuxidi wodhana” yaagees. Goday haysa odis.<verse eid="ISA 22:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ISA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Xiroosas Odetida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 23:1" />Xiroosa katamaas odetida Godaa qaalay haysa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 23:1">Xiroosa kataman keethi woyko shempiya soy bayna gisho hinteno Tarsesa markabiya laaggeysato yeekite! Qophiroosa biittafe ha worey hinteko yis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:19">Hiz 26:1—28:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Iyyu 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Amo 1:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:1-4">Zaka 9:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:21-22">Maato 11:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:13-14">Luqa 10:13-14</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 23:2" />Hinteno, abba matan de7iya asaw, hinteno abba bollara hemetiya duretida, Sidoona zal7anchoto, si77i giite! <verse eid="ISA 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 23:3" />Hintew yaa kathay, Nayle shaafape caketida Shihoora biitta kathi; hinte kawotethatas zal7e bessi.<verse eid="ISA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 23:4" />Neno Sidoona katamaw, abba matan de7iya miixaw, abbay, “Taani iqetabike; yelabike; addenne macca na7a dichabike” yaagidi odida gisho yeellata. <verse eid="ISA 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 23:5" />He worey Gibxe biitta gakiya wode enti Xiroosaba si7idi dagammana.<verse eid="ISA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 23:6" />Hinteno abba matan de7iya asaw, zeleelishe Tarsesa pinnite. <verse eid="ISA 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 23:7" />Beni wode keexetida katamay, iya tohoy iya haaho biitta efidaynne hinte iyan ufaytiya Xiroosa katamay haysee? <verse eid="ISA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 23:8" />Kallacha wosisiya katamaa, iya zal7anchoti halaqata gididanne iya giddon bayzeysatinne laammeysati bonchetidaysata gidida Xiroosa katamaa bolla haysa halchiday oonee? <verse eid="ISA 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 23:9" />Otoranchota boncho ubbaa guuthanawunne biitta bolla bonchetida ubbaa kawushanaw Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday haysa halchis.<verse eid="ISA 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 23:10" />Hinteno, Tarsesa asaw, hintena teqiyabay bayna gisho, Nayle shaafada biitta bolla kumidi goggite. <verse eid="ISA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 23:11" />Goday abba bolla ba kushiya miccis; iya kawotethaa qaathis. Kanaane miixa laallana mela Goday kiittis. <verse eid="ISA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 23:12" />Gujidika, “Hinteno, un7etida Sidoona asaw, hinte ufaysan yexiya wodey wuris. Dendidi Qophiroosa pinnite; yanka hinte saro demmeketa” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 23:13" />Babiloone biitta be7ite; he biittay ha77i pathonnaba gidis. Asoore asay he biittan do7i aqanaada oothis. Enti yan de7iya wogga keethata laallidi bantaw miixa gimbidosona; biitta baysa oothidosona.<verse eid="ISA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 23:14" />Hinteno, Tarsesa markabeto, hinte miixay laaletida gisho, zeleelite.<verse eid="ISA 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 23:15" />Xiroosa katamay issi kawos de7o laythi gidiya laapun tammu laythi dogetidi daana wodey yaana. Laapun tammu laythi wuriya wode layma maccasas yexetiya yetha mela Xiroosa katamaas yexetana. <verse eid="ISA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 23:16" />Enti, “Neno dogetida layma katamaw, ne diitha ekada katamaara yuuya. Nena asay hassayana mela mal7o qaalan daro yethi yexa” yaagana.<verse eid="ISA 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 23:17" />Laapun tammu laythay poletiya wode, Goday Xiroosa xomoosana. Shin hessafe guye, I beni ba laymatetha oosuwako simmana; sa7an de7iya kawotethata ubbaara laymatana. <verse eid="ISA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 23:18" />Gidoshin, iya zal7iya wodheynne iya damoozey Godaas dummatidaysa gidana; iya zal7iya wodheynne kathinne lo77o ma7o shammanaw, Godaas oothiya asaas imetanaape attishin, miishe keethan woyko minja keethan uttenna.<verse eid="ISA 23:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ISA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Biitta Ubbay Seeretana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 24:1" />Heko, Goday biitta laallananne baysa kessana; I, biitta dhaysidi iyan de7iya asaa laallana. <verse eid="ISA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 24:2" />Asi ubbay issino gidana; kahiney asaara issino gidana; aylley godaara issino gidana; gadhindiya godatera issino gidana; shammeysi bayzeysara issino gidana; tal7e immeysi tal7e ekeysara issino gidana; aco acheysi aco ciggeysara issino gidana. <verse eid="ISA 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 24:3" />Biitta ubbay bonqetidi baysa gidana; Goday ha qaala odis.<verse eid="ISA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 24:4" />Biittay melana, iya aacay shullana; alamey argaacana, daaburana; biittan de7iya wolqaama asay daaburana. <verse eid="ISA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 24:5" />Biittay banan de7iya asaa gaason tunis. Enti higgiyas kiitetibookona; wogaa naagibookona; merinaa caaquwa menthidosona. <verse eid="ISA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 24:6" />Hessa gisho, baadethay biitta mees; asay banta nagaraa gaason pirdetanaw bessees. Sa7an de7iya asay xuugetidosona; guutha asi attis. <verse eid="ISA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 24:7" />Woyney xaphora melis, mal7anto woyney wuris; kase ufaytiya ubbay azzanis. <verse eid="ISA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 24:8" />Karaabo baqoy attis; yetha waasoy si77i gis; ufaysiya diitha dursay eqis. <verse eid="ISA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 24:9" />Hizape yexishe woyne ushsha uyokona; ushshayka entaw camo gidana. <verse eid="ISA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 24:10" />Laaletida katamay baysa gidana; oonika gelonnaada keetha ubbay gordetis. <verse eid="ISA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 24:11" />Woyne ushshi dhayida gisho asay dabaaban waassees; ufaysi azzanon laametis; ufaysiyabay sa7ape dhayis. <verse eid="ISA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 24:12" />Katamay laaletis; katamaa pengeti meqeretidosona. <verse eid="ISA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 24:13" />Shamaho teera qoqofeysada, woyne maxi simmin, poshiley atteysada, biitta bolla de7iya kawotethata bolla hessada hanana.<verse eid="ISA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 24:14" />Enti banta qaala dhoqu oothidi, ufaysan yexoosona; wuloha baggara de7iya ubbay Godaa gitatetha odana. <verse eid="ISA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 24:15" />Hessa gisho, doloha baggara de7eysati, Godaas boncho immana; yuushoy abban teqetida biittati Godaas, Isra7eele Xoossaas boncho immana. <verse eid="ISA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 24:16" />Nuuni, “Xilluwas bonchoy gido” giya mazmure biitta gaxape si7ida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 24:16">Shin, “Taani gilqas! Taani laafas! Tana ayye! Aathi immeysi aathidi immees; kaddeysati gujidi aathidi immoosona” yaagas. <verse eid="ISA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 24:17" />Hinteno, sa7an de7iya asaw, dagami aafoynne xihey hintena naagees. <verse eid="ISA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 24:18" />Daganthiya girsaafe baqateysi ollan kundana; ollafe keyeysa xihey oykana; salo maskooteti dooyetidosona; biitta baasoti qaaxidosona. <verse eid="ISA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 24:19" />Biitti za77is; biitti shaaketis; biitti qaaxis. <verse eid="ISA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 24:20" />Biitti matho asada gandigarees; carkoy sugiya gaabbada yuuyees. Geellata balay daro deexida gisho zaari dendonna mela kundisis.<verse eid="ISA 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 24:21" />He gallas Goday salo wolqata salon, sa7aa kawota sa7an pirdana. <verse eid="ISA 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 24:22" />Ollan de7iya qasho asada enta issife shiishana; qasho keethan enti gordetidi uttana. Daro gallasape guye enti seeretana. <verse eid="ISA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 24:23" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday Xiyoone zumaaninne Yerusalaamen kawotana; Yerusalaame cimata sinthan ba bonchuwa qoncisana. He wode ageenay dhumana, away yeellatana.<verse eid="ISA 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ISA 25" />
  <para style="s1">Xoossay Galateto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 25:1" />Abeeti Godaw, neeni ta Xoossaa. Taani nena dhoqu dhoqu oothana; ne sunthaa galatana. Neeni ne polo ammanetethan benipe qofetidi de7iya malaalsiya oosota oothadasa. <verse eid="ISA 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 25:2" />Neeni katamaa laaletha doore oothadasa; mino gimbe dirsay de7iya katamaa laalladasa. Allagata kawo keethay zaaridi katama gidonna mela oothadasa; zaaridi polo keexetenna. <verse eid="ISA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 25:3" />Hessa gisho, mino asati nena bonchana; wozana mino kawotethata katamati new yayyana. <verse eid="ISA 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 25:4" />Neeni manqoy baqatidi attiya bessi, metootanchoy qosetiya bessi, uushope attiya geshenne awa seelape attiya kuya gidadasa. Wozana mino asaa hanqoy gimbera dom7ethiya uusho melanne <verse eid="ISA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 25:5" />mela biittan honge mela. Shaara kuyay awa seela irxisiya mela neeni allagata yethaa si77i oothadasa; yaatin wozana mino asaa waasoy si77i gis.<verse eid="ISA 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 25:6" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday asa ubbaas ha zumaa bolla gita gibira giigisana. He gibira bolla modho ashuwa, lo77o kathinne caalida woyne ushsha giigisis. <verse eid="ISA 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 25:7" />I ha zumaa bolla asa ubbaa kammida magarajuwanne kawotetha ubbaa bolla micetida kamaa dhaysana. <verse eid="ISA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 25:8" />I merinaw hayqo mittana; Ubbaa Haariya Goday ayfe ubbaafe afuthaa quchana; ba asaa kawusha biitta ubbaafe diggana. Goday haysa odis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:14">Isa 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:54">1 Qoro 15:54</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:17">Qon 7:17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:4">21:4</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 25:9" />He gallas enti, “Tuma haysi nu Xoossaa; nuuni iyan ammanetida gisho I nuna ashshis. Nu Goday haysa; nuuni iyan ammanetida; ane iya atotethan ufaytoos; hashshu goos” yaagana.<verse eid="ISA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 25:10" />Godaa kushey ashshanaw ha zumaa bolla shempana. Shin utulli urqara ollan yedheteysada Moo7abey yedhetana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 15:1-16:14">Isa 15:1—16:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:1-47">Ermi 48:1-47</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 2:1-3">Amo 2:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:8-11">Sofo 2:8-11</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 25:11" />Haathe wadheysi ba kushiya yeddeysada enti banta kushiya yeddana. Shin Goday iya gene kushe oosuwan cimetonna, iya otoruwa kawushana. <verse eid="ISA 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 25:12" />Enti dhoqisidi gimbida mino dirsa gimbiya I wodisananne kawushana; I duge sa7an, ubba hirki baanan holana.<verse eid="ISA 25:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ISA 26" />
  <para style="s1">Xoono Mazmure</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 26:1" />He gallas Yihuda biittan ha mazmurey yexetana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:1">Nuus mino katami de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:1">Xoossay atotetha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:1">iya yuushuwan gimbenne miixa oothis.<verse eid="ISA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 26:2" />Ba ammanuwa naagiya xillo derey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:2">gelana mela kareta dooyite.<verse eid="ISA 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 26:3" />I nenan ammanetida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:3">ba wozanaa nenan wothida uraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:3">neeni polo sarotethan naagasa.<verse eid="ISA 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 26:4" />Goday merinaa zaalla gidiya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:4">Godan merinaw ammaneta.<verse eid="ISA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 26:5" />Dhoqan de7eyisata ziqi oothis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:5">dhoqu gida katamaa kawushis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:5">Iya sa7an duge yeggis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:5">biitta baanan holis.<verse eid="ISA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 26:6" />Manqoti iya yedhana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:6">un7etidaysati iya bollara hemetana.<verse eid="ISA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 26:7" />Xillota ogey suure;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:7">Abeeti Xilluwaw, neeni xillota ogiya giigisaasa.<verse eid="ISA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 26:8" />Abeeti Godaw, nuuni ne higgiya naaganaw amottoos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:8">ne sunthaa bonchoynne ne teemay nu wozanaa amo.<verse eid="ISA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 26:9" />Qamma taani nena laamotas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:9">wonta ta ayyaanay nena minthidi koyees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:9">Ne biitta pirdanaw yaa wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:9">sa7an de7iya asay xillotethi tamaarees.<verse eid="ISA 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 26:10" />Iita asas keehatethi oosetikoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:10">I xillotethi tamaarenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:10">Suure biittan iitabaa oothees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:10">Godaa gitatetha erenna.<verse eid="ISA 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 26:11" />Abeeti Godaw, ne kushey dhoqu gis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:11">shin enti be7okona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:11">Ne asaas neeni mishetiya misha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:11">be7idi yeellato.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:11">Neeni ne morketas giigisida tamay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:11">enta midi dhayso.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:27">Ibra 10:27</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 26:12" />Abeeti Godaw, nuus sarotethi immadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:12">nu ooso ubbaa ne oothadasa.<verse eid="ISA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 26:13" />Abeeti Godaw, nu Xoossaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:13">hara godati nuna haaridosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:13">shin nuuni ne sunthaa xalaala bonchoos.<verse eid="ISA 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 26:14" />Enti hayqidosona; simmidi de7on dookona.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:14">Ne seerin dhayida gisho, zaaridi dendokona.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:14">Enta qofisuwa ubbaa quchada dhaysadasa.<verse eid="ISA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 26:15" />Abeeti Godaw, neeni kawotethaa darsadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:15">kawotethaa darsada neeni bonchetadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:15">biitta zawa ubbaa dalgisadasa.<verse eid="ISA 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 26:16" />Abeeti Godaw, meto wode enti nena koydosona.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:16">Ne enta seerida wode nena kalkashidi woossidosona.<verse eid="ISA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 26:17" />Abeeti Godaw, qanthatida maccasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:17">yelo wodey gakin un7etada waasseysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:17">nuuni ne sinthan hessada hanida.<verse eid="ISA 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 26:18" />Nuuni qanthatida; iqetida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:18">shin carko yelida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:18">Nuuni sa7aas atotethi ehibooko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:18">biittan de7iya asaa yelibooko.<verse eid="ISA 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 26:19" />Hayqida ne asay paxana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:19">enta ahay dendana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:19">Hinteno, biitta garsan de7eysato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:19">dendidi ufaysa mazmure yexite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:19">Hinte akay wonta aka mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:19">biittiya hayqidaysata zaarada immana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Daane 12:2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 26:20" />Ta asaw, bidi hinte soo gelidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:20">kariya hinte bolla gordite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:20">Godaa hanqoy aadhana gakanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:20">guutha wodes hintena qosite.<verse eid="ISA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 26:21" />Biitta bolla de7iya asaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:21">enta nagaraa gisho seeranaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:21">Goday ba de7iya bessaafe keyidi yees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:21">Biittiya ba bolla gukida suuthaa qoncisana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:21">hayqidaysata zaarada genthuku.<verse eid="ISA 26:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ISA 27" />
  <para style="s1">Isra7eeley La77a Keyana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 27:1" />He gallas Goday ba mino, gitanne wolqaama mashshan Leewataane geetetiya xongetiyanne xaaxetiya shoosha seerana; abban de7iya do7aaka wodhana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 41:1">Iyyo 41:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 74:14">Maz 74:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:26">104:26</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 27:2" />He gallas haysada geetetana: “Lo77o woyne gadiyas yexite; <verse eid="ISA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 27:3" />Taani, Goday iya naagayis; taani qanxonna haathe ushshayis; oonika iya qohonnaada qamma gallas naagayis. <verse eid="ISA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 27:4" />Taani hanqetike; taara oletanaw agunthinne gom7orey ane dendo! Taani enta bolla keyada enta xuugga wursanashin. <verse eid="ISA 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 27:5" />Woyko qosetidi attanaw taako yo; taara sigeto; ee, taara sigeto” yaagetana.<verse eid="ISA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 27:6" />Yaana wodiyan Yayqoobi xapho yeddana; Isra7eeley aacananne ciiyana; iya ayfey biitta ubbaa kumana.<verse eid="ISA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 27:7" />Enta shocidaysata shocidaysada Goday Isra7eele asaa shocideyee? Woyko enta wodhidaysata wodhidaysada enti hayqidonaayee? <verse eid="ISA 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 27:8" />Goday ba asaa di7etana mela oothidi seeris; wolqaama doloha bagga gotiyan enta gooddidi kessis. <verse eid="ISA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 27:9" />Yayqooba naaqoy atto geetetanaynne iya nagaray polo qushetanay, yarsho shucha ubbaa I mentherethidi booqinte shuchada oothiya wodenne Asheera eeqa misiliya woyko ixaane cuyisiya bessaa laaliya wode.<verse eid="ISA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 27:10" />Diretida katamay baysatis; kase asi de7iya bessay ha77i bazzo mela dogetidi attis. Mehey heemetiya bessi gidida gisho, maatanne mitha haythaa midi marati yan allatoosona. <verse eid="ISA 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 27:11" />Mitha tasheti meliya wode meqeretoosona; maccasay mixidi eethanaw efoosona. Ha asay akeeki bayna asi gidiya gisho, enta medhidaysi entaw qadhetenna; enta maarenna.<verse eid="ISA 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 27:12" />He gallas Efraxiisa shaafape Gibxe shaafa gakanaw Goday kathaa qoxana. Hinte, Isra7eele asay issoy issoy shiiqana.<verse eid="ISA 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 27:13" />He gallas gita moyzey punetana; Asoore biittan dhaydaysatinne Gibxe biitta di7etidaysati yidi, Yerusalaamen geeshsha zumaa bolla Godaa goyinnana.<verse eid="ISA 27:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ISA 28" />
  <para style="s1">Efreema Ayye!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 28:1" />Efreeman mathoteysatas qofiso kallacha gididaysa, aradda zangaara huuphiyan uttidaysa, iya bonchuwas alleeqo gidida shullida ciishshanne mathoyiya ushshay entaw nashetethas gidida katamaa ayye! <verse eid="ISA 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 28:2" />Heko, Godaas wolqaamanne mino gidida issoy de7ees. Goday iya shacha uushoda, dhaysiya gotedanne kixida wolqaama haathada mino kushiyan duge sa7an holana. <verse eid="ISA 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 28:3" />He mathotiya Efreema asaa otoruwa kallachay tohon yedhethana. <verse eid="ISA 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 28:4" />Aradda zangaara huuphen de7iya shullida ciishshay, iya boncho alleeqoy wodey gakanaape sinthe teerida balase ayfe mela gidana. Issi asi he balasiya be7iya wode ba kushen oykida mela mi aggees.<verse eid="ISA 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 28:5" />He gallas Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday attida ba asaas boncho kallachanne alleeqo gidana. <verse eid="ISA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 28:6" />I daynnatas suure pirdiya ayyaana, katamaa pengiyafe ola zaareysatas wolqa gidana.<verse eid="ISA 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 28:7" />Enti woyne ushshan biicotoosona; mathoyiya ushshan gandigaroosona. Kahineynne nabey mathoyiya ushshan biicotees; enti woyne ushshan yarkoosona; mathoyiya ushshan gandigaroosona. Qoncethi be7ishe baletoosona; pirdishe dhubetoosona. <verse eid="ISA 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 28:8" />Enti miya gayta ubbay cooshsha xalaala gidiya gisho, iitiboonna bessi baawa.<verse eid="ISA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 28:9" />Enti haysada gaana: “I eratethaa oona tamaarsanee? Kiita ooddes qoncisanee? Buroo maathi paahetiya woyko dhanthi duuxida naytaseyee? <verse eid="ISA 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 28:10" />I, kiitta bolla kiitta, kiitta bolla kiitta; woga bolla woga, woga bolla woga; yan guutha han guutha” yaagana.<verse eid="ISA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 28:11" />Shin Goday allaga qaalaninne imatha doonan ha asaas odana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:21">1 Qoro 14:21</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 28:12" />I entako, “Haysi shempo bessi; daaburidaysa shempisite. Haysi shempi ekiya bessi” yaagis. Shin enti si7onna ixidosona. <verse eid="ISA 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 28:13" />Hessa gisho, enti bidi kundana mela, me77ana melanne xihen oyketidi baana mela Godaa qaalay entaw kiita bolla kiita, kiita bolla kiita; woga bolla woga, woga bolla woga; yan guutha han guutha gidana.<verse eid="ISA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 28:14" />Hinteno, Yerusalaamen de7iya asaa haariya qelqiseysato Godaa qaala si7ite. <verse eid="ISA 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 28:15" />Hinte, “Nuuni hayqora caaqida; Si7oolera giigida; nuuni wordo nuus qota oothida gishonne malte kate oothida gisho, gadoy nuna bochonna aadhana” yaagidi ceeqeteta.<verse eid="ISA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 28:16" />Hessa gisho, Ubbaa Haariya Goday, “Heko, taani al7onne dooretida baaso shuchaa Xiyoonen wothas; iyan ammaniya oonika yeellatenna.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Maz 118:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:33">Roome 9:33</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:11">10:11</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:6">1 Phex 2:6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 28:17" />Taani suure pirdaa wadha wodoro, xillotethaa tumbe oothana. Hinte, “Nuus qota gida wordo shachay shocana; hinte nuus kate gida bessaa di7oy dhaysana” yaagees. <verse eid="ISA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 28:18" />Hinte hayqora caaqida caaqoy laaletana; Si7oolera giigida giigoy minnenna. Gadoy yaa wode hinte iyan shocetana. <verse eid="ISA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 28:19" />He gadoy yaa wode hintena ekidi baana; wonta wonta, qamminne gallas yaara aadhana; he aadhiya wode ubban hintena aggenna.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 28:19">Ha kiita akeekoy hintew dagama xalaala immana. <verse eid="ISA 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 28:20" />Hinte qosetiya bessi hintew baawa; hinte zin7iya arsay hintew gidenna; hinte ma7iya afilay hintena gakenna. <verse eid="ISA 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 28:21" />Paraziima zuma bolla Goday oothidaysada ba oosuwa, ba imatha oosuwa, hessika ba ooratha oosuwa oothanaw dendana. Gaba7oona zangaaran oothidaysada hanqana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:10-12">Iyya 10:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 5:20">2 Same 5:20</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 14:11">1 Taari 14:11</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 28:22" />Goday, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Xoossay, biitta ubbaa bolla dhayo ehanaw awaajidaysa ta si7ida gisho hinte qashoy minnonna mela qelqiseysa aggite.<verse eid="ISA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 28:23" />Hinte haytha haa yeggidi, ta odeysa si7ite; ta odaa akeekite. <verse eid="ISA 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 28:24" />Kathi zeranaw goyiya goshshanchoy ubba wode goyishe de7iyee? Qassi ubba wode gaggahiya wodhishenne liiqisishe de7ii? <verse eid="ISA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 28:25" />Gadiya liiqisidi, kareetha sawanne okashe, banganne giste, banga iya do7uwan, iya bessan bessan zerees gidennee? <verse eid="ISA 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 28:26" />Ha hiilla iya Xoossay iya erisesinne tamaarsees. <verse eid="ISA 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 28:27" />Kareetha sawonne okashe shocu wodhan qoxenna; shin guutha xam7an shocetees. <verse eid="ISA 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 28:28" />Katha ayfey buketeesipe attishin, liiqenna; qassi kathaa bukiya para gaareti iya bollara laagetikoka kathay gaacetenna. <verse eid="ISA 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 28:29" />Ha cincatethaa ubbay ba zoriyaninne ba cincatethan malaalsiya Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaape yees.<verse eid="ISA 28:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="ISA 29" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalaame Ayye!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 29:1" />Dawiti de7ida Ar7eela katamaw nena ayye! Laytha bolla laythi guja; ne ba7aaleta zaara zaara boncha. <verse eid="ISA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 29:2" />Taani Ar7eela katamaa buroo un7ethana; I zeleelidi yeekana. He katamay suuthi kammida yarsho bessa mela gidana. <verse eid="ISA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 29:3" />Taani ne yuushuwa teqana; adussa gimbiyan nena dirana; ne bolla ola shako essana. <verse eid="ISA 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 29:4" />Neeni gelida ollan gidada odetana; garsa baanape ne girsay yaana. Ne girsay moytille girsada biitta giddofe keyana; baana giddofe ne kalkashana.<verse eid="ISA 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 29:5" />Shin ne morketi baana mela daro; wozana mino asata tayboy carkoy efiya puno mela. <verse eid="ISA 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 29:6" />Qoponna de7ishin, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday dadan, biitta qaaxon, gita girsan, goten, carkoninne tama lacon hintena wochana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:11-12">1 Kawo 19:11-12</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 29:7" />Ar7eela katamaa oliya daro kawotetha ubbay, he katamaanne iya miixa oliya ubbay, iya un7ethiya ubbay dhisko amuhodanne elmoda hanana. <verse eid="ISA 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 29:8" />Koshatida asi amuhon kathi midi, barkiya wode iya koshay aggonaysada woyko saamotida asi amuhon uyidi, barkiya wode saamuwa alonaysada, Xiyoone deriya oliya kawotethati ubbay hessada hanana.<verse eid="ISA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 29:9" />Malaaletite; dagammite; qilim7ite; qooqite. Mathotite, shin woyne ushshan gidopo. Gandigarite, shin mathoyiya ushshan gidopo. <verse eid="ISA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 29:10" />Goday dhisko ayyaana hinte bolla gussis. Nabeto, hinte ayfey goozetis; qoncethi be7eysato, hinte huuphey kametis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:8">Roome 11:8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 29:11" />Ha ubba qoncethay new attametida maxaafa mela gidis. Issi asi, “He7e, haysa nabbaba” yaagidi, issi nabbabo eriya asas immiya wode, I, “Maxaafay attametida gisho, ta nabbabanaw danda7ike” yaagana. <verse eid="ISA 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 29:12" />Maxaafa nabbabi eronna asako, “He7e, haysa nabbaba” yaagidi immiya wode, I, “Taani nabbaba erike” yaagana.<verse eid="ISA 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 29:13" />Goday yaagees: “Ha asay tana banta doonan bonchees; shin enta wozanay taape haahon de7ees. Enti asi medhida wogaa tamaarsishe tana coo goyinnoosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:8-9">Maato 15:8-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 7:6-7">Mar 7:6-7</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 29:14" />Hessa gisho, taani ha asaa bolla zaara zaara malaalsiyaba oothana. Cincata cincatethaa eeya kessana; eranchota eraa dogisana”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:19">2 Qoro 1:19</ref>.</char></note> yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 29:15" />Banta halchuwa Godaape qosanaw ciimmoyeyisata, banta oosuwa dhuman oothishe, “Nuna ooni be7ii? Nuna ooni erii?” yaageyisata ayye! <verse eid="ISA 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 29:16" />Hinte ubbaba shiri yeggeeta. Oto medheysi urqa mela gidi qopeeta! Medhetidaysi medhidaysa, “I tana medhibeenna” giyyee? Otoy bana medhidaysa, “I aykoka erenna” gaanaw danda7ii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:9">Isa 45:9</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 29:17" />Libaanose woray aradda gade gidanaw; qassi aradda gadey wora gidanaw guutha wodey attis gidennee?<verse eid="ISA 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 29:18" />He gallas tulleti maxaafaa qaala si7ana; dhuman de7iya qooqeta ayfey xeellana. <verse eid="ISA 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 29:19" />Ashketi Godan ufaytana; manqoti Isra7eele Geeshshan hashshu gaana. <verse eid="ISA 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 29:20" />Ulo iitati wurana; qelqiseysati tim7i gaana; iitabaa oothanaw wochiya ubbay dhayana. <verse eid="ISA 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 29:21" />Ase odan bala ootheysati, mootetidaysa pirda keethan xihen yeggeysatinne wordo markatethan xillo asa pirdaa geellayeysati dhayana.<verse eid="ISA 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 29:22" />Hessa gisho, Abrahaame wozida Goday Yayqooba kochaako haysada yaagees: “Yayqooba kochay hizape guye yeellatenna; iya som7oy yeellatidi sa7a xeellenna. <verse eid="ISA 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 29:23" />Shin enti ta kushe ooso gidida banta nayta banta giddon be7iya wode ta sunthaa geeshshana; enti Yayqooba Geeshshaa, geeshshatetha naagana; Isra7eele Xoossaa yashshatethan bonchana. <verse eid="ISA 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 29:24" />Ayyaanan baleysati akeeka demmana; zuuzumeysati timirte ekana” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 29:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="ISA 30" />
  <para style="s1">Ixas Giya Deriya Ayye!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 30:1" />Goday, “Geella nayta ayye! Taani halchaboona oothosona; ta Ayyaanan gidonashin banta shenen caaqidi nagara bolla nagara gujeyisata ayye! <verse eid="ISA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 30:2" />Tana zore oychonna Gibxe wodhoosona. Paarona miixa bantaw teqe, Gibxe bantaw shempiya kuya oothosona. <verse eid="ISA 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 30:3" />Shin Paarona miixay hintew yeella, Gibxe kuyay hintew kawushatethi gidana. <verse eid="ISA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 30:4" />Enta halaqati Xaanesan de7ikoka, enti kiittidaysati Haneesa katamaa gakikoka, <verse eid="ISA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 30:5" />yeellafe attishin, hara maaddeynne go77i bayna gisho iyan ammanetiya ubbay kawuyananne yeellatan” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 30:6" />Negeban de7iya do7ataba Goday odiday haysa: kiitetidaysati metoynne un7i de7iya biittara, adde gaammoynne macca gaammoy worara, iitanne xongetiya shooshati de7iya bazzuwara kanthidi baana. Haretanne gimaleta zokon banta duretetha caanidi enta aykoka maaddonna biitta baana. <verse eid="ISA 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 30:7" />Gibxey aykoka maaddenna; hessa gisho, taani iya, “Pathonna Ra7aaba” yaagada xeegana.<verse eid="ISA 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 30:8" />Ha77i bada sinthara yaana wodiyas merinaa malla gidana mela enta sinthan shuchaa woocada xaafa; mazgabenka xaafa. <verse eid="ISA 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 30:9" />Enti geellanne wordancho nayta; enti Goday odiyaba si7anaw koyonna nayta. <verse eid="ISA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 30:10" />Enti qoncethi be7eyisata, “Qoncethi be7opite” yaagosona. Nabeta, “Ufaysiyabaanne cimmiyaba oditepe attishin, suureba odopite. <verse eid="ISA 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 30:11" />Ogiyape kichite; horogape haakite; Isra7eele Geeshshara nuna som7on gathofite” yaagosona.<verse eid="ISA 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 30:12" />Hessa gisho, Isra7eele Geeshshay haysada yaagees: “Hinte ha qaala ixidi, geneninne cimon ammanetida gisho, <verse eid="ISA 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 30:13" />ha nagaray hintew za77idi woddiya, akeekona ellesidi kundiya adussa gimbe mela gidana. <verse eid="ISA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 30:14" />Iya meqoy urqafe medhida oto mela dipi gidi meqana. He mequwa giddofe tama kaashiya woyko haathe duuqiya kun7i bentenna” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 30:15" />Isra7eele Geeshshay, Ubbaa Haariya Goday, haysada yaagees. “Simoninne shempon hinte attana; si77i guussaninne ammanetethan hintew wolqa gidana; shin hinte ixideta. <verse eid="ISA 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 30:16" />Hinte, ‘Akay, nuuni para bolla uttidi baqatana’ yaagideta; hessa gisho, hinte baqatana. Qassi hinte, ‘Eesotiya para toggidi baana’ ” yaagideta; shin hintena yedetheysati hintefe aadho eesotana. <verse eid="ISA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 30:17" />Issi tooranchuwa be7idi hintefe mukulu asay baqatana; ichashu tooranchoti hintena ubbaa yedethana. Zumaa huuphen eqida bandira mithada woyko zuma bolla de7iya mallada hinte hanana gakanaw hintena yedethena.<verse eid="ISA 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 30:18" />Shin Goday hintew keehanaw naagees; Goday xillo pirdiya Xoossi gidiya gisho hintew qadhetanaw dendana. Iya ammanetidi naagiya ubbay anjetidaysata.<verse eid="ISA 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 30:19" />Hinteno, Yerusalaamen de7iya Xiyoone asaw, hizape guye yeekeketa. Xoossay qadhen kumida Xoossi gidiya gisho, hinte maade koyidi iyako waassiya wode hintew zaaro immana. <verse eid="ISA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 30:20" />Goday hintew meto kathinne un7a haathi immikoka, hinte astamaarey hizape bana qosenna. Shin hinte ayfey hinte astamaariya be7ana. <verse eid="ISA 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 30:21" />Hinte ushachi woyko haddirsi simmiya wode, guyera hintena, “Ogey haysa; iyara biite” giya qaala hinte si7ana. <verse eid="ISA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 30:22" />Biraninne worqan alleeqetida eeqa misileta hinte tunisana. Tuna curqada hinte enta, “Nuupe haakite” yaagidi wora holana.<verse eid="ISA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 30:23" />He wode I, hinte biittan zerida kathaas ira bukisana; biittafe doliya kathay daronne muruuta gidana. He gallas hinte mehey dalga denban heemetana. <verse eid="ISA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 30:24" />Goshsha booratinne hareti gillan punetida geeshsha harquwa maana. <verse eid="ISA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 30:25" />Asi wuriya wode miixati laaletiya gallas deretanne zumata bollafe pulto haathi goggana. <verse eid="ISA 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 30:26" />He gallas ageena poo7oy awa poo7oda hanana; awa poo7oy kaseysafe laapun kushe darana; laapun gallas poo7uwa mela gidana. He ubbay hananay Goday meqida ba asaa kooliya wodenne I dechin madunxida asaa pathiya wode.<verse eid="ISA 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 30:27" />Heko, Godaa sunthay suulliya hanquwara, dhumida cuyaa shaarara haaho bessaafe yaana. Iya doonan hanqoy kumis; iya inxarsan miya tami de7ees. <verse eid="ISA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 30:28" />Iya peenoy, qoodhe gakanaw kixidi, ubbaba pittidi efiya haatha kixa mela. I, kawotethata dhayo zarzaren harqana; asaa gapata bixaalidi oge balethana. <verse eid="ISA 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 30:29" />Geeshsha ba7aaley bonchetiya gallas yexeysada, hinte yexana. Godaa zumako, Isra7eele Zaallako biya wode suusul7e punnishe yexiya asay ufayteysada hinte ufaytana.<verse eid="ISA 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 30:30" />Goday ba yashshiya qaala sissana; ba suulliya hanquwan, tama lacuwan, gotiyan, uushuwaninne shachan ba qesiya qoncisana. <verse eid="ISA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 30:31" />Goday ba girsan Asoore daganthana; iya xam7ay enta shocana. <verse eid="ISA 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 30:32" />Goday enta ba seeriya xam7an enta shociya wode iya asay karaaboranne diithara yexana. Ba qesiya denthidi enta shocana. <verse eid="ISA 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 30:33" />Benipe doomidi Asoore kawoy xuussa Toofeta geetetiya bessi giigis. He bessay ollanne dalga; qassi daro mithi dooretidi de7iya bessi. Godaa peenoy diinne shaafada goggidi, he tama eethana.<verse eid="ISA 30:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="ISA 31" />
  <para style="s1">Gibxe Bolla Zempeyisata Ayye!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 31:1" />Maado demmanaw Gibxe wodheysatanne paran ammaneteyisata ayye! Para gaareta darotethaaninne para asata minotethan ammaneteyisata ayye! Enti Isra7eele Geeshshaa xeellokona woyko Godaape maado koyokona. <verse eid="ISA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 31:2" />Shin Goday cinca gidiya gisho gado yeddana; I odidaysa aggenna. Iita asaa bollanne iitabaa oothiya asaa maaddeyisata bolla dendana. <verse eid="ISA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 31:3" />Gibxeti asepe attishin, xoosse gidokona; enta paratika ashope attishin, ayyaana gidokona. Goday hanqon ba qesiya denthiya wode maaddeysi dhubetana; maadeteysi kundana; enti ubbay issife dhayana.<verse eid="ISA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 31:4" />Goday taako haysada yaagis: “Gaammoy woyko wodala gaammoy mehe oykidi daariya wode henthanchoti xeegetidi shiiqikoka, I enta waasuwas dagammenna; enta qaalas yayyenna. Hessadaka, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday Xiyoone zumanne iya zumata olanaw wodhana. <verse eid="ISA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 31:5" />Kafoy aaleysada Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday Yerusalaame gechana, ashshana, naagana; iya bollara aalidi heemmana.<verse eid="ISA 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 31:6" />“Hinteno Isra7eele asaw, hinte makallidi ixida, iyako simmite. <verse eid="ISA 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 31:7" />He gallas nagari kumida hinte kushiyan birapenne worqafe oothida eeqata wora holana. <verse eid="ISA 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 31:8" />Asoorey asaba gidonna mashshan kundana; asaba gidonna mashshi enta maana. Enti mashsha sinthafe baqatana; enta na7atethati wolqan asas oothana. <verse eid="ISA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 31:9" />Dagama gaason enta mino miixay laaletana; enta toora moconati dagammidi yeggi dhayana” yaagees, iya tamay Xiyoonen, iya coocey Yerusalaamen de7iya Goday.<verse eid="ISA 31:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="ISA 32" />
  <para style="s1">Xillotethi Kumida Kawotethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 32:1" />Heko, kawoy xillotethan kawotana; haareysati suuretethan haarana. <verse eid="ISA 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 32:2" />Issi issi asi ba huuphen carkofe geemmiya bessi, gotepe qosetidi attiya bessi gidana. Mela biittan goggiya haatha melanne saamo biittan gita zaalla kuya mela gidana. <verse eid="ISA 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 32:3" />Xeelliya asata ayfey qilim7enna; si7iya asata haythay hayzidi si7ana. <verse eid="ISA 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 32:4" />Eesotiya asaa wozanay erananne akeekana. Dedotiya asaa inxarsay biletana; geeshshidi odetana. <verse eid="ISA 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 32:5" />Hizape guye eeyi asi erancho geetetenna; iita asi bonchetenna. <verse eid="ISA 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 32:6" />Eeyay eeyatethi odetees; iya wozanay nagara qopees. Godaa bolla minoba odetees; iya bolla iitabaa maqetees: koshatidaysas kathi immenna; saamotidaysa haathe diggees. <verse eid="ISA 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 32:7" />Gene asa qofay iita; manqoti suureba odetikoka enta dhaysanaw wordon iita qofa qopees. <verse eid="ISA 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 32:8" />Lo77o asi lo77oba halchees; he lo77o halchuwan minnidi de7ees.<verse eid="ISA 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalaame Maccasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 32:9" />Hinteno qofi bayna de7iya maccasaw, dendite; ta odeysa si7ite; hinteno ammanetidi de7iya macca nayto, ta hintew odeysa si7ite. <verse eid="ISA 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 32:10" />Laythi kumonna hinte ammanetidi de7eysati kokorana; woyne iya wodiyan maxeketa; tokidabaape ayfe shiisheketa. <verse eid="ISA 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 32:11" />Hinteno injetin de7iya maccasaw kokorite. Hinteno ammanetidi de7iya macca nayto yayyite. Hinte ma7uwa qaaridi kayo ma7o hinte xeessan dancite. <verse eid="ISA 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 32:12" />Lo77o gaden ayfiya woyney dhayida gisho, azzanidi hinte tiraa qoxite. <verse eid="ISA 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 32:13" />Agunthinne kinchotey ta asaa gadiyan dolis. Asay ufaytidi de7ida keethatasinne katamaas yeekite. <verse eid="ISA 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 32:14" />Kawo keethaynne daro asay de7iya katamay baysatana; miixatinne gimbe shakoti merinaw laaletana; wora hareti ufaytiya bessinne dorsa wudey heemetiya bessi gidana.<verse eid="ISA 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 32:15" />Hessi hananay, Ayyaanay nu bolla gukana gakanaw, mela biittay araddana gakanawunne aradda biittay wora gidana gakanaasa. <verse eid="ISA 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 32:16" />Hessafe guye, mela biittan suure pirdi, aradda biittan xillotethi daana. <verse eid="ISA 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 32:17" />Xillotethi sarotethi ehana, wopatethinne ammanetethi merinaw biitta kumana. <verse eid="ISA 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 32:18" />Ta asay saroy kumida keethan, ammanthiya bessaaninne wopu gida son shempidi daana. <verse eid="ISA 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 32:19" />Shachi bukidi wora dhaysiyakoka, qassi katamay kumthi laaletiyakoka, <verse eid="ISA 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 32:20" />shaafata gaxan hinte kathaa zeridi, hinte mehiyasinne hinte haretas hentha bessi demmeysati hinte anjetana.<verse eid="ISA 32:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="ISA 33" />
  <para style="s1">Un7anne Maado Koshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 33:1" />Nena dhaysona de7ishin haraa dhayseyso, nena aathidi immonna de7ishin haraa aatha immeyso, nena ayye! Ne dhayso aggida wode nena dhaysana; ne aatha imo aggida wode nena aathidi immana.<verse eid="ISA 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 33:2" />Abeeti Godaw, nuna maara; nuuni nena ufaysan naagoos; wonta wonta nuus wolqa gida; meto wode nuna ashsha. <verse eid="ISA 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 33:3" />Ne girsaa deshuwan derey baqatees; neeni nuna maaddanaw dendiya wode kawotethati laaletoosona. <verse eid="ISA 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 33:4" />Gondoy shiiqeysada hinte di7oy shiiqana; booley dirgeysada asay iya bolla dirgana.<verse eid="ISA 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 33:5" />Goday bolla de7iya gisho, dhoqu dhoqu gis; Xiyoone suure pirdaaninne xillotethan kunthana. <verse eid="ISA 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 33:6" />I hinte wodiyas ammanthiya baaso gidana; hintew atotethi, cincatethinne eratethi gidana; Godaas yashshi ha ubba shaluwas qulpe gidana.<verse eid="ISA 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 33:7" />Heko, goobati oge bolla waassoosona; sigethanaw kiitetidaysati cametidi yeekosona. <verse eid="ISA 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 33:8" />Wogga ogeti kaysatidosona; ogiyara kanthiya asi baawa. Caaqoy laaletis; katamati kadhetidosona; boncho asati boretidosona. <verse eid="ISA 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 33:9" />Biittay azzanis; daaburis; Libaanosey yeellatidi melis; Saarona zangaaray mela biitta gidis. Baasane deriyaninne Qarmeloosa deriyan de7iya mitha haythay qoqofetis.<verse eid="ISA 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 33:10" />Goday haysada yaagees: “Ha77i taani dendana; ha77i taani bonchetana; ha77i taani dhoqu dhoqu gaana. <verse eid="ISA 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 33:11" />Hinte utulla qanthatidi puno yelideta; hinte shempoy hintena tamada maana. <verse eid="ISA 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 33:12" />Asay booqinte shuchada taman xuugetana; qassi agunthada taman eexana. <verse eid="ISA 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 33:13" />Hinteno, haahon de7eysato, ta oothidaysa si7ite; matan de7eysato ta wolqaa akeekite” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 33:14" />Xiyoonen de7iya nagaranchoti dagammidosona; Xoossaa eronnaysati kokoridosona. Enti, “Nu giddofe miya tamaranne merinaw eexiya lacuwara daanaw danda7ey oonee?” <verse eid="ISA 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 33:15" />Xillotethan hemetey, suure odetey, bessonna ogera bentiya go77a ixey, ba kushiya wodhaafe ekonna mela diggey, shempo wodhoba si7onna mela ba haythaa tuccey, iitabaa xeellonna mela ba ayfiya kammey, <verse eid="ISA 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 33:16" />he uray dhoqa bessan daana. I, qosetidi attiya bessay mino zaalla gidana; iya kathay iyaw imetana; I, uyaa haathay pacenna.<verse eid="ISA 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 33:17" />Hinte ayfey kawa, iya yegelssara be7ana; haahon de7iya biitta demmana. <verse eid="ISA 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 33:18" />Hinte, “Halaqay awun de7ii? Giira ekeysi awun de7ii? Gimbe shakota halaqay awun de7ii?” yaagidi hinte wozanan beni yashshiya wodiya qopana. <verse eid="ISA 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 33:19" />Wozana mino asaa, hintew gelonna doonan odetiya asaanne inxarsay dedotiya asaa hizape guye hinte be7eketa.<verse eid="ISA 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 33:20" />Nuuni nu ba7aale bonchiya Xiyoone katamaa be7ite! Wopu gidi de7iya, iya dhishey shodetonna, iya wodoroy duuxonnanne iya dhishey qaaxonna dunkaane mela hanida Yerusalaame katamaa hinte, hinte ayfen be7ana. <verse eid="ISA 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 33:21" />He bessan Goday nuus wolqaa gidana. He bessay dalga safanne goggiya haatha mela gidana. Wogoloy iya bollara baanaw danda7enna; gita markabeti yaara kanthanaw danda7okona. <verse eid="ISA 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 33:22" />Goday nuus pirdeysa; Goday nuus higge immeysa; Goday nu kawa; I nuna ashshana.<verse eid="ISA 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 33:23" />Ne qasho wodoroy dol7ana; markabiya tuussay shuggana; iya sharayka toletibeenna. He wode daro di7o shaaketana; hari attoshin wobbetika di7o ekana. <verse eid="ISA 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 33:24" />Xiyoonen de7iya oonika “Tana sakees” yaagenna; yan de7iya asaa nagaray atto geetetana.<verse eid="ISA 33:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="ISA 34" />
  <para style="s1">Kawotethati Pirdetana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 34:1" />Hinteno, kawotethato, shiiqidi si7ite! Hinteno, asaw akeekite! Biittaynne biittan de7iyaba ubbay, sa7inne sa7ape keyaaba ubbay si7o. <verse eid="ISA 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 34:2" />Goday kawotethata ubbaa bolla hanqetis; enta tooranchota ubbaa bolla yilotis. I, enta ubbaa dhaysana; enta shukeysatas aathidi immana. <verse eid="ISA 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 34:3" />Enta ahay holetidi, attidi xinqana; dereti enta suuthan kametana. <verse eid="ISA 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 34:4" />Salo xoolintoti ubbay seerana; saloti saleenada xaaxetana. Woyne haythinne balase ayfey qoqofeteysada xoolintoti ubbay qoqofetana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:29">Maato 24:29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:25">Mar 13:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:26">Luqa 21:26</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:13-14">Qon 6:13-14</ref>.</char></note> <figure style="fig" alt="Scrole" file="HK00150B.tif" size="col" ref="34:4">Xaatha Maxaafa</figure><verse eid="ISA 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 34:5" />Ta mashshay salotan alana gakanaw uyis; Heko Edoome bolla, taani dhaysida asaa bolla pirdanaw wodhana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:1-6">Isa 63:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:7-22">Ermi 49:7-22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:12-14">Hiz 25:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 35:1-15">35:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:11-12">Amo 1:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:1-14">Abdi 1-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:2-5">Milki 1:2-5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 34:6" />Godaa mashshay suuthan muuketis. Yarshos shuketiya dorsatanne deeshata suuthan mashshi muuketeysadanne enta kilaho modhuwan kameteysada Godaa mashshay suuthan muuketis; modhuwan kametis. Goday Baasora kataman yarsho, Edoome biittan gita shuka giigisis. <verse eid="ISA 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 34:7" />Menthati, wofaanotinne boorati entara kundana. Enta gadey suutha xalaala gidana; enta biittay modhon munuqetana. <verse eid="ISA 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 34:8" />Goday halo keyana gallasinne Xiyoone olida morketa bolla kushe zaariya laythi giigisis.<verse eid="ISA 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 34:9" />Edoome shaafati melidi made gidis; iya baanay diinne laametana; iya biittay eexiya made gidana. <verse eid="ISA 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 34:10" />Qammanne gallas tamay to77enna; iya cuyay merinaw cuyana. Edoome biittay yeletethaafe yeletethaa gakanaw baysa gidana; oonika merinaw yaara kanthenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:11">Qon 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:3">19:3</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 34:11" />Shin xiloynne quxarey iya laattana; guttoynne quuroy yan daana. Xoossay Edoome bolla laaletha wadha wodoronne baysatetha tumbe yeddana. <verse eid="ISA 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 34:12" />He biitta aysiya kawoy deenna; halaqati yaape kichana. <verse eid="ISA 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 34:13" />Kawo keethata agunthi, miixata ohi ma7ana; workanati allatiya bessinne yanchoti de7iya soo gidana. <verse eid="ISA 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 34:14" />Bazzo do7ati godaretara gahetana; tuna ayyaanati issoy issuwara xeegetana; qamma qoolleti wodhidi yan daana. <verse eid="ISA 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 34:15" />Guttoti yan keethe keexidi, phuuphullidi qoxana. Banta nayta banta qefeta garsan haphana; phircoti banta laggetara yan shiiqana.<verse eid="ISA 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 34:16" />Godaa maxaafan koyidi nabbabite. Godaa doonay odida gishonne iya ayyaanay shiishida gisho, haysatape issoyka pacenna; qassi issoyka ba laggey bayna deenna. <verse eid="ISA 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 34:17" />I, entaw saama kessis; iya kushey biitta entaw wodoron shaakis; enti iya merinaw laattana; yeletethaafe yeletethaa gakanaw enti yan daana.<verse eid="ISA 34:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="ISA 35" />
  <para style="s1">Wozetida Deriya Ufaysa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 35:1" />Baysa biittaynne mela biittay ufaytana; aykoy bayna mela biittay ufaytananne ciiyana. <verse eid="ISA 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 35:2" />Mela biittay ciishshe ma7ana; ufaysa mazmure yexana. Libaanose bonchuwa ma7ana; Qarmeloosanne Saarona gitatethay imetana; enti Godaa bonchuwanne nu Xoossaa gitatetha be7ana.<verse eid="ISA 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 35:3" />Daaburida kushetanne argaacida gulbatata minthite. <verse eid="ISA 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 35:4" />Yashsha wozani de7eysatako, “Minnite! Yayyofite! Heko, hinte Xoossay halo keyanawunne ba xoossatethan kushe zaaranaw yidi hintena ashshana” yaagite.<verse eid="ISA 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 35:5" />He wode, qooqeta ayfey dooyetana; tulleta haythay si7ana. <verse eid="ISA 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 35:6" />Wobbeti gen7eda gupana; dedoti ufaysan yexana; mela biittan haathi goggana; mela bessan pultoy dhuuqana. <verse eid="ISA 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 35:7" />Xuuggiya shafey eele haathi gidana; mela biittay haathe pultana; workanati allatiya bessan maatinne mayreynne maqi dolana.<verse eid="ISA 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 35:8" />Yaara wogga ogey keyana; ika “Geeshshatetha Oge” geetetana. Tunati he ogiyara bookona; eeyati yan simeretokona; shin geeshshatas gidana. <verse eid="ISA 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 35:9" />Gaammoy woyko yashshiya do7ati yaara kanthokona; yan bentokona; shin wozetidaysata xalaali hemetana. <verse eid="ISA 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 35:10" />Goday wozidaysati simmana; yexish, Xiyoone gelana; merinaa ufaysay enta huuphiyan uttana. Enti ufaytananne hashshu gaana; azzanoynne ooley entafe haakana.<verse eid="ISA 35:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="ISA 36" />
  <para style="s1">Sanakreema Mandetha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 18:13-27">2 Kawo 18:13-27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:1-19">2 Taari 32:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 36:1" />Hizqiyaasi kawotida tammanne oyddantho laythan, Asoore kawoy Sanakreemi yuushoy gimbetida Yihuda katamata olidi oykis. <verse eid="ISA 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 36:2" />Hessafe guye, Asoore kawoy Laakiso katamaape issi toora mocona daro olanchotara kawa Hizqiyaasako Yerusalaame yeddis. I, bidi Ma7o Meecciya gadiyako efiya ogiyape qommo baggara de7iya eelida haathay goggiya dhawa matan eqis. <verse eid="ISA 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 36:3" />Kawo gadho aysiya Alqa na7ay Eliyaqeemi, xaafey Sheebinne, taarike xaafey, Asaafa na7ay, Yo7aasi iyako kare keyidosona.<verse eid="ISA 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 36:4" />Asoore toora moconay entako, “Hizqiyaasas haysada yaagidi odite: ‘Wolqaama Asoore kawoy, neeko haysada’ yaagees: neeni haysa mela minnanaw aybin ammanetadii? <verse eid="ISA 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 36:5" />Neeni coo qaalan, olaa oletanaw taw cincatethinne wolqi de7ees yaagasa. Shin neeni oonan ammanetada ta bolla haysada makallay? <verse eid="ISA 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 36:6" />Neeni ‘Gibxe kawoy tana maaddana’ gada qopidaba gidiko meqida mayre xam7a guufetiya asa mela. Xam7ay meqin pincoy kushiya caddesinne madunxisees. Gibxe kawoy banan ammanetiya asa ubbaas hessa mela.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 29:6-7">Hiz 29:6-7</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 36:7" />Shin neeni, ‘Nuuni Godan, nu Xoossan, ammanetoos’ yaagiko, Hizqiyaasi Yihudanne Yerusalaame asaa, ‘Hinte Yerusalaamen de7iya yarsho bessan goyinnanaw koshshees’ gidi, Xoossaa goyinniya dhoqa bessatanne yarsho bessata diggiday iya gidennee?<verse eid="ISA 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 36:8" />“Ane ha77i haaya! Ta godaa Asoore kawuwara geedareta. Togganaw danda7iya asi ne demmiko, nam7u mukulu parata ta new immana. <verse eid="ISA 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 36:9" />Neeni, ‘Gibxeti para asatanne para gaareta taw yeddana’ gada ammaniko, ta godaa toora moconatape issi laafaka zaaranaw danda7aka. <verse eid="ISA 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 36:10" />Hessa bollaka, taani ha biitta dhaysanaw tuma Godaa sheney bayna keyadina? Goday ba huuphen tana ‘Bada ha biitta olada dhaysa’ yaagidi kiittis” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 36:11" />Hessafe guye Eliyaqeemi, Sheebinne Yo7aasi Asoore halaqaako, “Nuuni eriya Aramike doonara nuus ne aylletas odape attishin, gimbe dirsa bolla de7iya asay si7ana mela Ibraawetho doonan odopa” yaagidosona.<verse eid="ISA 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 36:12" />Shin halaqay zaaridi, “Ha kiitaa taani hintewunne hinte godaa xalaalas odana mela tana ta goday kiittibeenna. Hintera issife banta shi7a maanawunne banta sheesha uyanaw de7iya, ha gimbe dirsaa bolla de7iya asa ubbaas odana mela kiittis” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 36:13" />Asoore halaqay dendi eqidi, ba qaala dhoqu oothidi, Ibraawetho doonan haysada yaagis: “Wolqaama gidida Asoore kawoy giyaba si7ite! <verse eid="ISA 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 36:14" />Kawoy hinteko haysada yaagees; ‘Hizqiyaasi hintena cimmofo’ I hintena ta kushepe ashshanaw danda7enna. <verse eid="ISA 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 36:15" />Hizqiyaasi hintena, ‘Tuma Goday nuna ashshana; ha katamayka Asoore kawa kushen gelenna’ yaagidi, hinte Godan ammanetana mela oothofo.<verse eid="ISA 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 36:16" />“Hinte Hizqiyaasi odiyaba si7opite. Asoore kawoy hintena, ‘Taara sigetite; haa taako yiite. Hessa hinte oothiko, hinte ubbay hinte woynepenne hinte balasepe maana; hinte bookida ollaafeka haathe uyana. <verse eid="ISA 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 36:17" />Taani yada, hintena hinte biitta daaniya biitta ekada efana. He biittay kathinne woyney kumida biitta’ ” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 36:18" />“Hizqiyaasi, ‘Goday hintena ashshana’ yaagidi cimmonnaada naagetite. Hara kawotethata xoossatape ba biitta Asoore kawa kushepe ashshida xoossi de7iyee? <verse eid="ISA 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 36:19" />Hamaata xoossatinne Arfada xoossati awun de7oona? Safarwayma xoossati awu bidonaa? Enti Samaariya ta kushepe wothi ekidona? <verse eid="ISA 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 36:20" />Ha biittata xoossatape ba biitta ta kushepe ashshidi ekiday de7ii? Yaatin hinte, ‘Goday Yerusalaame ta kushepe ashshana’ yaagidi qopeetii?” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 36:21" />Shin kawoy entako, “Iyaw ay zaaroka immopite” yaagidi zorida gisho, asay issi qaalaka iyaw zaaronna si77i gidoosona. <verse eid="ISA 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 36:22" />Hessafe guye kawo gadho aysiya Kalqe na7ay Eliyaqeemi, xaafey Sheebinne taarike xaafey Asaafa na7ay Yo7aasi banta ma7uwa peedhidosona. Hizqiyaasako bidi Asoore halaqay gidaba ubbaa iyaw odidosona.<verse eid="ISA 36:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="ISA 37" />
  <para style="s1">Hizqiyaasi Isayaasa Zore Oychis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 19:1-7">2 Kawo 19:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 37:1" />Kawoy Hizqiyaasi hessa si7ida wode ba ma7uwa peedhidi, kayo ma7o ma7idi, Godaa keethi gelis. <verse eid="ISA 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 37:2" />Kawo gadho aysiya Eliyaqeemi, xaafey Sheebinne kaalethiya kahineti kayo ma7o ma7idi, Amoxe na7aa nabiya Isayaasako baana mela kiittis. <verse eid="ISA 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 37:3" />Enti Isayaasako bidi, Hizqiyaasi haysada yaagees: “Ha gallasay meto gallas, seera gallasinne yeella gallas. Hessika na7i yeletanaw wodey gakin, bannakada yelanaw wolqi dhayida maccasa mela gidida. <verse eid="ISA 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 37:4" />De7o Xoossaa cayanaada iya goday, Asoore kawoy, kiitida halaqaa qaala Goday ne Xoossay si7onna aggenna. Qassi Goday ne Xoossay he qaala gaason iya seeronna aggenna. Hessa gisho, asaa giddofe attanaysatas woossa” yaagidosona.<verse eid="ISA 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 37:5" />Kawoy Hizqiyaasi kiittidaysa Isayaasi si7ida wode, <verse eid="ISA 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 37:6" />entako, “Hinte godaas haysada yaagidi odite: Goday, ‘Asoore kawa aylleti tana cayishin, neeni si7ida cashsha qaalas yayyofa. <verse eid="ISA 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 37:7" />Heko, I oda si7idi, ba biitta simmana mela, taani iya giddon issi ayyaana yeddana. Yaatada I ba biitta bidi yan mashshan hayqanaada oothana’ yaagees” yaagidi kiittis.<verse eid="ISA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 37:8" />Asoore kawoy Laakiso katamaape dendidi bidaysa Asoore halaqay si7idi, guye simmidi kawoy Libina kataman oleteysa demmis.<verse eid="ISA 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 37:9" />Kawoy Sanakreemi, “Tophe kawoy Tirihaaqi nena olanaw yis” giya odaa si7idi, Hizqiyaasas haysada yaagidi kiittis. <verse eid="ISA 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 37:10" />“Yihuda kawa Hizqiyaasa, neeni ammanetiya Xoossay, ‘Yerusalaame Asoore kawa kushen yeggenna’ yaagidi cimmofo. <verse eid="ISA 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 37:11" />Asoore kawoti biittata ubbaa waati dhaysidaako neeni si7adasa. Yaatin, neeni attanee? <verse eid="ISA 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 37:12" />Beni ta mayzati dhaysida Gozaana, Kaaranenne Rafeesa biitta xoossatinne Talasaaran de7iya Edene biitta xoossati he biittata dhayope ashshidonaa? <verse eid="ISA 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 37:13" />Hamaata kawoy, Arfada kawoy, Safarwayma kawoy, Heena kawoynne Iwa kawoy awun de7oona?” yaagidi kiittis.<verse eid="ISA 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hizqiyaasa Woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 37:14" />Hizqiyaasi dabdaabiya kiitetida asaape ekidi nabbabis. Dabdaabiya Godaa keethi efidi Godaa sinthan miccis. <verse eid="ISA 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 37:15" />Godaa haysada yaagidi woossis: <verse eid="ISA 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 37:16" />“Abeeti Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaw, kiruubetape gidduwan uttida Isra7eele Xoossaw, sa7a kawotethata ubbaa bolla ne xalaali Xoosse. Saluwanne sa7aa neeni medhadasa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:22">Kessa 25:22</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 37:17" />Abeeti Godaw, ne haytha yeggada haa si7a. Abeeti Godaw, ne ayfiya dooyada haa xeella. Nena, de7o Xoossaa, Sanakreemi cayida cashshaa si7a.<verse eid="ISA 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 37:18" />“Abeeti Godaw, Asoore kawoti kawotethatanne enta biitta dhaysidaysi ee tuma. <verse eid="ISA 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 37:19" />Enta xoossata taman xuuggidi dhaysidosona; Enta xoossati kaseka asa kushey massidi kessida mithinne shuchi gidiya gisho, xoossata gidokona. <verse eid="ISA 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 37:20" />Hiza abeeti Godaw, nu Xoossaw, ne xalaali Godaa gideysa sa7aa kawotethati ubbay erana mela neeni nuna iya kushepe ashsha” yaagidi woossis.<verse eid="ISA 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sanakreema Kundethaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 19:2-37">2 Kawo 19:2-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 37:21" />Hessafe guye, Amoxe na7ay Isayaasi Hizqiyaasas haysada yaagidi kiittis: Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagees: “Neeni Asoore kawa Sanakreema gaason tana woossida woosa taani si7as” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 37:22" />“Goday Sanakreema haysada yaagis.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:22">Xiyoone geela7iya nena kadhasu; leqasu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:22">Yerusalaame na7iya ba huuphiya qaathada nena borasu.<verse eid="ISA 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 37:23" />Neeni cayidaynne toochiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:23">Ne oodde bolla ne qaala dhoqu oothada odetadii?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:23">Ne otoron oona dhoqu gada xeelladii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:23">Hessa ne oothiday Isra7eele Geeshshaa bollana gidennee?<verse eid="ISA 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 37:24" />Neeni kiitida asaa baggara Godaa cayadasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">Haysada yaagadasa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">‘Ta daro para gaaretara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">dhoqa zumaa huuphiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">Libaanose zuma xeera keyas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">Ubbaafe adussa zigatanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">ubbaafe lo77o xiiddata qanxas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">Dhoqa bessan de7iya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">xittida wora gakas.<verse eid="ISA 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 37:25" />Taani allaga biittatan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:25">haatha olla bookada haathe iyape uyas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:25">Gibxe biittan goggiya haatha ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:25">taani ta tohuwan yedhada melisas’ ”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 37:25">yaagadasa.<verse eid="ISA 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 37:26" />“Daro wodepe sinthe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:26">neeni gimbetida katamata laallada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:26">shucha keela kessana mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:26">ta qofaa qacha wothidaysa ne erabikii?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:26">Taani ha77i oothiya oosota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:26">beni halcha wothas.<verse eid="ISA 37:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 37:27" />Hessa gisho, enta asaas wolqay ixin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:27">enti kawuyidosonanne yeellatidosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:27">Enti maata melanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:27">yooga ciishsha mela.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:27">Enti keethaa huuphen doliya maata melanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:27">leegey kundisiya katha mela hanidosona.<verse eid="ISA 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 37:28" />“Shin neeni uttiya, keyiya, geliya bessaanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:28">ta bolla ne hanqetida hanquwa erayis.<verse eid="ISA 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 37:29" />Ne ta bolla hanqetida gishonne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:29">ne otoruwa taani si7ida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:29">taani ne siidhiyan dafo aathana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:29">ne doonan bixaala barsana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:29">Yaatada neeni yida ogiyara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:29">nena guye zaarana.”<verse eid="ISA 37:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 37:30" />Isayaasi kawa Hizqiyaasako haysada yaagis. “Hessi poletanaysas mallay haysa; ha laythinne wonto laythi hinte aasebo kaxida kathi maana. Shin heedzantho laythan hinte, hinte huuphen zeritenne cakite; woyne tokitenne iya ayfiya miite. <verse eid="ISA 37:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 37:31" />Yihuda asaape attidaysati xapho yeddana; ayfe ayfana. <verse eid="ISA 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 37:32" />Attida guuthati Yerusalaamepenne Xiyoone deriyape yaana. Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa qanaatey hessa oothana.<verse eid="ISA 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 37:33" />“Hessa gisho, Asoore kawuwaba Goday haysada yaagees. Asoore kawoy ha katamaa gelenna; woyko haysan ba dongiya dukenna; woyko ba gondalliya oykidi, ha katamaa sinthe aadhenna; woyko katamaa yuushuwa teqenna. <verse eid="ISA 37:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 37:34" />Asoore kawoy ba yida ogiyara guye simmana; ha katamaa gelenna.” Taani Goday haysa odayis.<verse eid="ISA 37:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ISA 37:35" />“Taani ta bonchuwa gishonne ta aylliya Dawita gisho, ha katamaa ashshana” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ISA 37:36" />He qamma Godaa kiitanchoy keyidi, Asoore asay dunkaanida guta bidi, 185,000 addeta wodhis. Wontetha gallas asay dendidi ahi aha bolla dooretidaysa be7idosona. <verse eid="ISA 37:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ISA 37:37" />Hessa gisho, Asoore kawoy Sanakreema dendidi, guye simmi bidi Nanawe kataman uttis.<verse eid="ISA 37:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ISA 37:38" />Issi gallas Sanakreema ba xoossaa Nisirooka keethan goyinnishin, iya nayti Adramelekinne Sarxari mashshan iya wodhidi Araraate biitta baqatidosona. Iya na7ay Asiradooni iya bessan kawotis.<verse eid="ISA 37:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="ISA 38" />
  <para style="s1">Hizqiyaasa Hargiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 20:1-11">2 Kawo 20:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:24-26">2 Taari 32:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 38:1" />He wode kawoy Hizqiyaasi hargidi, hayqanaw matis. Amoxe na7ay nabey Isayaasi iyako bidi, Goday, “Ne hayqana haniya gisho ne keetha giigisa” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 38:2" />Hizqiyaasi godaako simmi zin7idi, Godaa woossis. <verse eid="ISA 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 38:3" />“Abeeti Godaw, taani ne sinthan tumatethaninne kumetha wozanan hemetidaysanne nena ufaysiyabaa oothidaysa hassaya” yaagidi cametidi yeekis.<verse eid="ISA 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 38:4" />Hessafe guye, Godaa qaalay Isayaasako, <verse eid="ISA 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 38:5" />Bada Hizqiyaasako, Goday ne mayza Dawita Xoossay, “Taani ne woosa si7as; ne afuthaa be7as. Ne laytha bolla taani tammanne ichashu laytha gujana. <verse eid="ISA 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 38:6" />Nenanne ha katamaa Asoore kawa kushepe ashshana; taani ha katamaas oletana” yaaga.<verse eid="ISA 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 38:7" />“Goday ba gida qaala polanaw immida mallay haysa yaagis: <verse eid="ISA 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 38:8" />Akaazi keyanaw giigisida dethan de7iya kuyay tammu tango guye simmidi baana mela taani oothana” yaagis. Kuyay tammu tango guye simmidi bis.<verse eid="ISA 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 38:9" />Yihuda kawoy Hizqiyaasi hargiyafe paxidi xaafida mazmurey haysa:<verse eid="ISA 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 38:10" />Taani, “Ta de7o laythay bagga gakonna de7ishin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:10">hayqo pengera gelana haniyana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:10">Attida laytha bonqetana haniyana?” yaagas.<verse eid="ISA 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 38:11" />“Taani de7on de7eyisata biittan Godaa be7ike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:11">ha sa7an ase be7ike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:11">ha alamiyan de7eysatara zaarada de7ike.<verse eid="ISA 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 38:12" />Dorse heemmeyisata dunkaaniyada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">ta de7oy shodetis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:12">Dorzey afila wandaraashen xaaxeysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">ta de7oy xaaxetis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:12">Dorzey afila duuthiyada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">ta de7uwa duuthis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:12">Wontafe omarsi gakanaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">tana dhaysaasa” yaagas.<verse eid="ISA 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 38:13" />“Qamma kumetha danda7an naagas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:13">gaammoda ta meqetha ubbaa menthadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:13">wontafe omarsi gakanaw tana dhaysadasa.<verse eid="ISA 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 38:14" />Taani kaarodanne cilashoda waassas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:14">holleda zuuzumas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:14">Ta ayfey salo xeellishe daaburis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:14">Godaw, taani un7etas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:14">neeni tana ha un7aafe kessa” yaagas.<verse eid="ISA 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 38:15" />Haysa ubbaa oothiday Godaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:15">taani ay gaanaw danda7iyana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:15">Ta shempoy un7etida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:15">ta laytha ubbaa ashketethan daana.<verse eid="ISA 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 38:16" />Godaw, haysa mela seeran</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:16">asay de7on de7ees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:16">Ha77i ta payyatetha zaarada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:16">tana de7on wotha!<verse eid="ISA 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 38:17" />Ta un7etethay taw lo77o gidis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:17">neeni ta shempuwa dhayo ollafe ashshadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:17">ta nagara ubbaa neeni guye yeggadasa.<verse eid="ISA 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 38:18" />Duufoy nena galatenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:18">hayqoy nena sabbenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:18">Ollan wodhidaysati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:18">ne ammanetetha ufaysi oothokona.<verse eid="ISA 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 38:19" />Taani hachi nena galateysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:19">de7on de7eysati nena galatoosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:19">Ne ammanetetha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:19">aawati banta naytas odoosona.<verse eid="ISA 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 38:20" />Goday tana ashshana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:20">hessa gisho, nuuni nu de7o laytha ubban,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:20">Godaa keethan diithan yexana.<verse eid="ISA 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 38:21" />Isayaasi kase, “Balase daaxidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:21">iya kixa bolla wothite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:21">I paxana” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 38:22" />Hizqiyaasi kase, “Taani paxada Godaa keethi baanaysas mallay aybe” yaagidi Isayaasa oychis.<verse eid="ISA 38:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="ISA 39" />
  <para style="s1">Babiloonepe Yida Asata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 20:12-19">2 Kawo 20:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 39:1" />He wode, Baldaana na7ay, Babiloone kawoy Mardook-Baldaani, Hizqiyaasi hargidi paxidaysa si7ida gisho, dabdaabenne imota Hizqiyaasas yeddis. <verse eid="ISA 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 39:2" />Hizqiyaasi kiitetidi yida asata mokis. Ba shaluwa minjiya keethan de7iya bira, worqaa, sawuwa, lo77o zayte, ba ola miishetanne ba shaluwa minjiya keethan de7iyaba ubbaa enta bessis. Ba son woyko ba gadhuwan de7iyaba ubbaafe Hizqiyaasi enta bessonna aggidabay baawa.<verse eid="ISA 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 39:3" />Nabey Isayaasi kawa Hizqiyaasako bidi, “Ha asati woygidona? Awupe yidona?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 39:3">Hizqiyaasi, “Enti taako, haaho biitta Babiloonepe yidosona” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 39:4" />Isayaasi zaaridi, “Enti ne son ay ay be7idonaa?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 39:4">Hizqiyaasi, “Enti ta gadhon de7iya ubbaba be7idosona; ta shaluwa minja keethan de7iyabaape taani enta bessonnabay baawa” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 39:5" />Yaatin, Isayaasi Hizqiyaasako, “Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday giyaba si7a. <verse eid="ISA 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 39:6" />‘Neeni, kawo gadhon de7iyaba ubbaynne ne mayzati hachi gakanaw shiishidaba ubbay kumthi di7etidi, Babiloone biitta baana wodey yaana; aybika attenna. <verse eid="ISA 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 39:7" />Qassi neepe yeletida ne ashonne ne suuthu gidida ne kochati di7etidi baana; Babiloonen kawo gadhon shuufa gididi oothana’ yaagees”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:1-7">Daane 1:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:10-16">2 Kawo 24:10-16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2 Taari 36:10</ref>.</char></note> yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 39:8" />Hizqiyaasi zaaridi, “Neeni odida Godaa qaalay lo77o. Shin ta laythan saronne wopa gido” yaagidi qopis.<verse eid="ISA 39:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="ISA 40" />
  <para style="s1">Minthetho Qaala</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 40:1" />Hinte Xoossay haysada yaagees:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:1">“Ta deriya minthethite! Minthethite!<verse eid="ISA 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 40:2" />I aylletethan de7ida wodey poletis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:2">iya nagaray atto geetetis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:2">ba nagaraa gisho, Goday iya dako seeridaysa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:2">Yerusalaames liiqo qaalan odite; awaajite” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 40:3" />Haysada giya girsay si7etees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:3">“Mela biittan Godaa ogiya giigisite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:3">nu Xoossaas Araba mela biittan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:3: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aykoyka bayna manqo biitta woyko mela biitta woyko xuugetida biitta guussu </char></note> horoga sitti oothite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:3">Maato 3:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:3">Mar 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:23">Yoha 1:23</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 40:4" />Zangaara ubbay dhoqu gaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:4">dereynne zumay ziqi gaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:4">iita ogetinne gela kessati dembatana.<verse eid="ISA 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 40:5" />He wode Godaa bonchoy qoncana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:5">asho ma7ida ubbay hessa issife be7ana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:5">Godaa doonay haysa odis” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 40:6" />Issi girsi, “Waassa” yaagishin si7as;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:6">taani, “Woygada waasso?” yaagas.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 40:6" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:6">“Asi ubbay maata mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:6">iya boncho ubbay ciishsha mela.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:10-11">Yay 1:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:24-25">1 Phex 1:24-25</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 40:7" />Godaa iya bolla shempiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:7">maatay melees; ciishshay qoqofetees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:7">asi tuma maata mela.<verse eid="ISA 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 40:8" />Maati melees; ciishshi qoqofetees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:8">shin nu Xoossaa qaalay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:8">merinaw eqidi de7ees” yaagada waassa.<verse eid="ISA 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 40:9" />Neno Xiyoones lo77oba odeyso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">zuma bolla keya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">Neno Yerusalaames lo77oba odeteyso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">ne qaala dhoqu oothada waassa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">Yayyofa; dhoqu ootha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">Yihuda katamatas, “Hinte Xoossay haysish” yaaga.<verse eid="ISA 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 40:10" />Heko, Ubbaa Haariya Goday wolqara yees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:10">iya qesey iyaw haarana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:10">Iya woytoy iyara de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:10">ciggiya gatey iya sinthana.<verse eid="ISA 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 40:11" />I ba wudiya henthanchoda heemmana;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:15">Hiz 34:15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:11">Yoha 10:11</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:11">Ba dorsa marata ba qesiyan shiishana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:11">enta ba ki7on idimmana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:11">dhantheyisata loddara kaalethana.<verse eid="ISA 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 40:12" />Haathata ba kushe qaaqan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:12">salota takadhon likiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:12">biitta baana daachon makiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:12">deretanne zumata mizaanen likiday oonee?<verse eid="ISA 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 40:13" />Godaa Ayyaana eriday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:13">iya zoridi tamaarsiday oonee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:34">Roome 11:34</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 2:16">2 Qoro 2:16</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 40:14" />Iyaw qoncisana mela oona zore oychidee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:14">Suure pirdaa iya tamaarsiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:14">Iya cincatethi tamaarsiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:14">iya akeeka bessiday oonee?<verse eid="ISA 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 40:15" />Heko, kawotethati xuggan de7iya issi xoko mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:15">enti mizaane bolla de7iya baana mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:15">I yuushoy abban teqetida biittata baanada likes.<verse eid="ISA 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 40:16" />Libaanose mithay yarsho bessan eexanaw gidenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:16">iyan de7iya do7ati xuussa yarshos gidokona.<verse eid="ISA 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 40:17" />Kawotethati ubbay iya sinthan baynaba mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:17">enti iya sinthan ubba aykoka gidokona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:17">baynabapeka laafa.<verse eid="ISA 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 40:18" />Yaatin, Xoossaa hinte oodera ginayetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:18">Ayba misilera gathidi xeelletii?<verse eid="ISA 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 40:19" />Kushe hiillanchoy eeqa misile giigisees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:19">worqa sheesheysi worqan lanxees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:19">bira sheesheysi iya bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:19">bira santhalaata medhees.<verse eid="ISA 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 40:20" />Miishey bayna manqoy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:20">yarshos xoodhonna mithi doorees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:20">Misiley qaaxonna mela essanaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:20">kushe hiillancho koyees.<verse eid="ISA 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 40:21" />Eribeeketii? Woyko si7ibeeketii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:21">Haysi hintew koyrope odetibeennee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:21">Woyko sa7i medhetoosape</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:21">haysa hinte akeekibeketii?<verse eid="ISA 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 40:22" />I biitta gertuwafe bolla baggan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:22">ba araatan uttees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:22">biittan de7iya asati xaqo mela.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:22">Salota gesheda miccees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:22">dunkaaneda de7iya bessi oothidi tolees.<verse eid="ISA 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 40:23" />I, halaqata baynabaada oothees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:23">ha alamiya haareyisata hada kessees.<verse eid="ISA 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 40:24" />Enti toketidi buroo gam7onnashin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:24">zeretidi buroo xapho yeddonnashin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:24">Goday enta bolla carko yeddis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:24">enti melin gotey enta punoda efis.<verse eid="ISA 40:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 40:25" />Yaatin, tana oodera likeyetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:25">Tana oodera ginayetii? yaagees geeshshay.<verse eid="ISA 40:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 40:26" />Hinte ayfiya dhoqu oothidi salo xeellite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">ha xoolintota medhiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:26">I enta olanchoda kaalethees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">enta taybuwa erees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:26">I enta ubbaa enta sunthan sunthan xeegees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">iya wolqa gitatethaafenne minotethafe dendoysan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">entafe issoyka dhayenna.<verse eid="ISA 40:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 40:27" />Neno Yayqoobaa, neno Isra7eele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:27">Ta ogey Godaape geemmis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:27">ta pirday Xoossaafe qosetis;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 40:27">yaagada ayis odetay?<verse eid="ISA 40:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 40:28" />Erabikii? Si7abikii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:28">Goday merina Xoossa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:28">biitta ubbaa medhiday iya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:28">I daaburenna; woyko argaacena;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:28">oonika iya qofaa eranaw danda7ena.<verse eid="ISA 40:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 40:29" />I daaburidaysatas wolqa immees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:29">minotethi baynaysas minotethi gujees.<verse eid="ISA 40:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 40:30" />Hari attoshin yalaga nayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:30">daaburoosona; argaacosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:30">na7atethati daaburidi kundoosona.<verse eid="ISA 40:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 40:31" />Shin Godaa ammanetidi naageysati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:31">banta wolqaa oorathana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:31">Enti arganthada qefen paallana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:31">woxana, shin daaburokona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:31">hemetana, shin argaacokona.<verse eid="ISA 40:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="ISA 41" />
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Maaduwa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 41:1" />Hinteno, yuushoy abban teqetida biittato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:1">si77i gidi, taani odeysa si7ite!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:1">Derey banta wolqaa ooratho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:1">enti haa shiiqidi, odeto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:1">ane nuuni pirdetanaw issife shiiqoos.<verse eid="ISA 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 41:2" />“Doloha baggafe issuwa denthidi biya bessa ubban xoono immey oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">I kawotethata iya kushen aathidi immees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">kawota iyaw haarisis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:2">I enta ba mashshan bido kessees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">ba dongiyan enta puno oothees.<verse eid="ISA 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 41:3" />I enta yedethishe, iya tohoy kase yedhiboona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:3">ogiyara saro kanthees.<verse eid="ISA 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 41:4" />Haysa oothidaynne poliday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:4">yeletethaaka koyrope xeegiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:4">Taani Goday, koyruwara de7ayis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:4">wursetharaka de7ey tana” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 41:5" />Yuushoy abban teqetida biittati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:5">hessa be7idi yayyidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:5">sa7aa gaxan de7eysati kokoridosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:5">Enti issife shiiqidi taako yidosona.<verse eid="ISA 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 41:6" />Issoy issuwa maaddees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:6">ba ishaa, “Minna” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 41:7" />Kushe hiillanchoy worqa sheesheysa minthethees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">naariqan qoxidi lee7iseysi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">baachan birata seeriseysa, “Minna” gees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:7">I birata dhantheysa, “Lo77o oothaasa” yaagees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">eeqay qaaxonna mela mismaaren dhishees.<verse eid="ISA 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 41:8" />“Shin neno Isra7eele, ta aylliyaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:8">ta doorida Yayqoobaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:8">ta laggiya Abrahaame kochaw,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:7">2 Taari 20:7</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:23">Yay 2:23</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 41:9" />taani nena biitta gaxape ehas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:9">haahosoope xeegada, ‘Neeni ta aylle’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:9">taani nena dooras; taani nena yeggike.<verse eid="ISA 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 41:10" />Yayyofa, taani neera de7ayis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:10">dagammofa, taani ne Xoossaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:10">Taani nena minthana; nena maaddana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:10">taani nena xooniya ta ushacha kushiyan katisana.<verse eid="ISA 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 41:11" />Ne bolla hanqetiya ubbay yeellatidi kawuyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:11">neera eqeteysati baynaba gidana.<verse eid="ISA 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 41:12" />Ne morketa neeni koyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:12">shin enta demmaka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:12">nena oleysati baynaba gidana.<verse eid="ISA 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 41:13" />Taani Goday, ne Xoossay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:13">ne ushacha kushiya oykana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:13">yayyofa, taani nena maaddana.<verse eid="ISA 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 41:14" />Neno guxuniyaw, Yayqooba, hinteno Isra7eele asaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:14">yayyofite; taani hintena maaddana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:14">hintena woziya Isra7eele Geeshshay tana.<verse eid="ISA 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 41:15" />Heko, taani nena oorathi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:15">qaranne achara de7iya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:15">kathi qoxiya miishe oothas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:15">Neeni dereta qoxada liiqisana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:15">zumataka puno oothana.<verse eid="ISA 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 41:16" />Neeni enta punnana; carkoy enta efana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:16">shin neeni Godan ufaytana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:16">Isra7eele Geeshshan bonchetana.”<verse eid="ISA 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 41:17" />“Manqotinne metootanchoti haathe koyana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:17">shin demmokona; enta qoodhey saamon melana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:17">Gidoshin, taani Goday enta si7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:17">taani, Isra7eele Xoossay, enta aggike.<verse eid="ISA 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 41:18" />Taani mela zumata bolla shaafa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:18">zangaaratan pulto dhuusana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:18">Bazzuwa haathi eelliya bessi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:18">mela biitta pultoy keyaso oothana.<verse eid="ISA 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 41:19" />Taani mela biittan, ziga, soqala mithi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:19">barseneete mithaanne shamaho dolisana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:19">Mela biitta xiiddi, maaroynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:19">caci kumida biitta oothana.<verse eid="ISA 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 41:20" />Isra7eele Geeshshay hessa medhidaysanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:20">Godaa kushey hessa oothidaysa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:20">asay be7ana, erana, qopananne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:20">akeekana mela taani hessa oothas.”<verse eid="ISA 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 41:21" />“Ane hinte mootuwa shiishite” yaagees Goday;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:21">“Ane hinte marka haa ehite” yaagees Yayqooba kawoy.<verse eid="ISA 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 41:22" />Ane enti banta eeqata haa eho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:22">aybi hananeeko enta eeqati nuus odo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:22">Nuuni akeekana melanne enta wursethaa erana mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:22">kase hanidabay aybeko nuus odo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:22">woyko sinthafe hananaba nuus qonciso.<verse eid="ISA 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 41:23" />Hinte xoossata gideysa nuuni erana mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:23">sinthafe yaanaw de7iyaba nuus odite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:23">Nuuni dagammana melanne yayyana mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:23">lo77o gidin iita gidin ane issiba oothite.<verse eid="ISA 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 41:24" />Shin hinte baynaba mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:24">hinte oosoyka hada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:24">hintena dooriya asayka ixetidaysata.<verse eid="ISA 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 41:25" />Taani pudeha baggafe issuwa denthin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:25">I yees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:25">Ta sunthaa xeegiya issoy dolohape yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:25">oto medheysi urqa yedheysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:25">I kaaletheyisata yedhana.<verse eid="ISA 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 41:26" />Nuuni erana melanne I like gaana mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:26">kasetidi nuus haysa odiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:26">Hintefe oonika kasetidi haysa qoncisiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:26">woyko awaajiday woyko ba qaala sissiday baawa.<verse eid="ISA 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 41:27" />Taani haysa kasetada Xiyoones odas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:27">taani Yerusalaames mishiraacho odeysa immas.<verse eid="ISA 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 41:28" />Shin taani xeelliya wode issoyka baawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:28">taani zore oychiya wode enta eeqata giddofe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:28">zaaro immiya issoyka baawa.<verse eid="ISA 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 41:29" />Heko, enti ubbay hada; enta oosoyka pathenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:29">sheeshidi medhida enta misiletika carko.<verse eid="ISA 41:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="ISA 42" />
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Aylle</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 42:1" />“Taani katisada oykida ta aylley,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:1">ta iyan ufayteysi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:1">taani dooridaysi haysa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:1">Taani ta Ayyaana iya bolla wothas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:1">I kawotethatas suure pirda ehana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Maato 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:5">17:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luqa 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">9:35</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 42:2" />I waassenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:2">ba qaala dhoqu oothenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:2">ba qaala ogen sissenna.<verse eid="ISA 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 42:3" />Dincetida mayriya I menthenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:3">lii7i lii7idi eexiya muqaada I toysenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:3">ammanetethan I suure pirda ehana.<verse eid="ISA 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 42:4" />I biittan suure pirda essenna gakanaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:4">argaacena woyko guye geenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:4">Yuushoy abban teqetida biittan de7iya asay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:4">iya higgiya si7anaw naagees.<verse eid="ISA 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 42:5" />Salota medhidaynne enta micciday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:5">sa7aanne sa7a bolla de7iyaba medhiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:5">sa7an de7iya asaas shempo immiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:5">iyan hemetiya ubbaas de7o immiday,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:5">Godaa Xoossay haysada yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 42:6" />Taani Goday nena xillotethan xeegas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:6">ne kushiya oykada nena naagana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:6">Taani nena asaas caaqo oothana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:6">kawotethatas poo7o oothada immana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:6">Isa 49:6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:32">Luqa 2:32</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:47">Hawa 13:47</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:23">26:23</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 42:7" />Neeni qooqe ayfeta dooyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:7">dhuma ollan, qasho keethan de7eyisata kessana.<verse eid="ISA 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 42:8" />Taani Godaa; hessi ta sunthaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:8">ta bonchuwa taani haras immike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:8">ta galataa eeqatas immike.<verse eid="ISA 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 42:9" />Heko taani kase odidaba ubbay poletidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:9">ha77i taani oorathaba awaajayis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:9">enti hananaape sinthe taani hintew odayis” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossay Galateto</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 42:10" />Godaas ooratha mazmure yexite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:10">biitta gaxape gaxaa gakanaw iya galata yexite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:10">Abba giddora beysatinne iyan de7eysati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:10">yuushoy abban teqetida biittatinne iyan de7iya ubbay yexo.<verse eid="ISA 42:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 42:11" />Mela biittan de7iya katamati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:11">Qedaare asay de7iya gutati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:11">banta qaala dhoqu oothonna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:11">Sela7a kataman de7eysati ufaysan yexo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:11">deriya huuphen banta ililsaa sisso.<verse eid="ISA 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 42:12" />Enti boncho Godaas immo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:12">iya galata yuushoy abban teqetida biittatan odo.<verse eid="ISA 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 42:13" />Goday mino asada keyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:13">ba qaala dhoqu oothidi ola awaajana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:13">Ba qaala dhoqu oothidi gereerana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:13">ba morketa xoonana.<verse eid="ISA 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 42:14" />Daro wode si77i gada gam7as;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:14">si77i gada danda7as.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:14">Shin ha77i iqethi oykida maccasada ta waassana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:14">tooka shempananne peenuqana.<verse eid="ISA 42:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 42:15" />Deretanne zumata laallana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:15">enta bolla dolidaba ubbaa melisana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:15">Shaafata yuushoy abban teqetida biitta kessana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:15">eele haathata melisana.<verse eid="ISA 42:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 42:16" />Taani qooqeta enti eronna ogiyara kaalethana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:16">enti eronna horogara efana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:16">Enta sinthan dhumaa poo7o kessana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:16">enta sinthan de7iya ogiya baasana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:16">Ha ubbaa taani entaw oothana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:16">taani enta oothonna aggike.<verse eid="ISA 42:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 42:17" />“Shin eeqa misiletan ammaneteysati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:17">misileta, ‘Hinte nu xoossata’ yaageysati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:17">yeellan guye simmana.<verse eid="ISA 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 42:18" />Hinte tulleti, si7ite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:18">hinte qooqeti, xeellite,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:18">loythidi be7ite.<verse eid="ISA 42:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 42:19" />Ta aylliyafe hari qooqey oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:19">Ta kiittidaysafe hari tulley oonee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:19">Bana Godaas aathidi immida uraape</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:19">Godaa aylliyafe hari qooqey oonee?<verse eid="ISA 42:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 42:20" />Darobaa be7adasa, shin akeekaka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:20">ne haythay dooya, shin si7aka” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 42:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 42:21" />Goday ba xillotetha gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:21">ba higgiya gitayanawunne bonchanaw dosis.<verse eid="ISA 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 42:22" />Shin ha asay bonqetis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">de7iyaba eketis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:22">Olla giddon xihen oyketis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">qasho keethan enta bolla gordetis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:22">Enti bonqetidosona, shin enta ashshey baawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">di7etidosona, shin oonika “Enta guye zaara”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 42:22">giya asi baawa.<verse eid="ISA 42:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 42:23" />Hinte giddofe haysa si7ey oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:23">sinthafe yaana wodiyaba qopey oonee?<verse eid="ISA 42:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 42:24" />Yayqooba di7etethas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:24">Isra7eele bonqees aathidi immiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:24">Nagara oothidi nu qohida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:24">iya ogiya kaallanawunne, iya higgiya kiitetanaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:24">nuuni ixida Godaa gidenneyee?<verse eid="ISA 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 42:25" />Hessa gisho, I enta bolla ba eexiya hanquwa gussis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:25">enta yuushuwa tama lacon teqis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:25">shin enti eribookona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:25">I enta xuuggis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:25">shin enti akeekibokona.<verse eid="ISA 42:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="ISA 43" />
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Ashshiya Issuwa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 43:1" />Shin neno Yayqoobaa nena medhiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:1">neno Isra7eele, nena giigisiday,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:1">Goday haysada yaagees:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:1">“Taani nena wozida gisho yayyofa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:1">taani nena ne sunthan xeegas; neeni tabaa.<verse eid="ISA 43:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 43:2" />Neeni haatha giddora pinniya wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:2">taani neera gidana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:2">Neeni shaafata giddora pinniya wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:2">enti nena mittokona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:2">Neeni tama giddora aadhiya wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:2">xuugetaka; lacoyka nena meenna.<verse eid="ISA 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 43:3" />Taani nena Ashshiysa, Isra7eele Geeshshaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:3">Godaa ne Xoossaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:3">Gibxe new wozo oothada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:3">Tophenne Saaba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:3">new laame oothada immana.<verse eid="ISA 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 43:4" />Neeni ta sinthan al7onne boncho gidiya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:4">taani nena dosiya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:4">asaa ne gisho, kawotethata ne shempuwa gisho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:4">laame oothada immana.<verse eid="ISA 43:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 43:5" />Taani neera de7iya gisho yayyofa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:5">taani ne nayta dolohape</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:5">nena wulohape shiishana.<verse eid="ISA 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 43:6" />Taani pudeha baggaa, ‘Enta zaarada eha!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:6">dugeha baggaa, ‘Enta teqofa’ yaagana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:6">Ta adde nayta haahosoope,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:6">ta macca nayta sa7aa gaxape ehana.<verse eid="ISA 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 43:7" />Enti ta sunthan xeegetidaysata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:7">taani ta bonchuwas medhidaysata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:7">taani giigisidaysatanne oothidaysata hammite.”<verse eid="ISA 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 43:8" />Ayfey de7ishin qooqida asata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:8">haythi de7ishin tullida asata kessa.<verse eid="ISA 43:8" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 43:9" />Kawotethati ubbay issife shiiqo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">asay duulata utto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:9">Enta eeqata giddofe haysa odanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">kase aadhidabata nuus qoncisanaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">danda7ey oonee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:9">Hara asay si7idi, “Haysi tuma” gaana mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">enti like gideysa bessanaw banta markata eho.<verse eid="ISA 43:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 43:10" />Goday haysada yaagees: “Hinte ta markata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">hinte tana erana melanne ammanana mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">taani Xoosse gideysa akeekana mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">taani doorida ta aylleti hintena.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:10">Taape kase hara xoossi medhetibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">taape guye hara xoossi deenna.<verse eid="ISA 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 43:11" />Taani Godaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:11">taape attishin, hari ashshey baawa.<verse eid="ISA 43:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 43:12" />Ta kasetada odas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:12">ta oothanaba awaajas, ta ashshas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:12">Hinte giddon de7iya allaga xoossatape</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:12">hessa oothiday baawa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:12">Taani Xoosse gideysas hinte taw markata.<verse eid="ISA 43:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 43:13" />Merinaape merinaw taani Xoosse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:13">ta kushepe oonika ashshena;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:13">ta oothidaba laammanaw danda7ey baawa”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 43:13">yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ISA 43:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa maarotanne Ammanetona Isra7eele</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 43:14" />Goday, hintena Woziya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:14">Isra7eele Geeshshay, haysada yaagees:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:14">“Hinte gisho, taani Babiloone bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:14">olanchota kiittana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:14">Babilooneta ubbaa enti ceeqetiya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:14">markabetara betana mela oothana.<verse eid="ISA 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 43:15" />Taani Godaa, hinte Geeshshaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:15">Isra7eele medhida hinte Kawa” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 43:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 43:16" />Abba giddon oge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:16">wolqaama haathata giddora horoga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:16">kessida Goday haysada yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 43:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 43:17" />Para gaaretanne parata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:17">olanchotanne mino asata abban ehidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:17">enti dendonna mela yeggiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:17">enta muqaada tamada toysida.<verse eid="ISA 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 43:18" />Goday haysada yaagees:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:18">“Kasebata haasayopite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:18">benibata qopofite.<verse eid="ISA 43:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 43:19" />Heko, ha77i taani oorathaba oothayis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:19">ika ha77i dolana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:19">Hessi hintew bentennee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:19">Taani mela biittan oge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:19">mela biittan shaafata kessana.<verse eid="ISA 43:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 43:20" />Taani doorida, ta asaas mela biittan haathe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:20">mela biittan haatha shaafata immas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:20">Wora do7ati, workanatinne yanchoti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:20">tana bonchana.<verse eid="ISA 43:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 43:21" />Taani taw medhida dere gidiya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:21">ta galataa awaajana mala ta haysa oothas.<verse eid="ISA 43:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 43:22" />Shin neno Yayqoobaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:22">neeni ta sunthaa xeegabaka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:22">neno Isra7eele, neeni tana saletadasa.<verse eid="ISA 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 43:23" />Neeni taw xuussa yarshos dorse ehabaaka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:23">hara yarshonka tana bonchabaaka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:23">Taani nena katha yarsho eha gada waaysabike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:23">ixaane taw cuyiso gada daabursabike.<verse eid="ISA 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 43:24" />Neeni taw sawiya ixaane shammabaaka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:24">ne modho yarshon tana ufaysabaka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:24">Shin neeni ne nagaran tana waaysadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:24">ne naaquwan tana daabursadasa.<verse eid="ISA 43:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 43:25" />“Ta gisho gada ne nagaraa quchey tana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:25">ne nagaraa zaarada qopike.<verse eid="ISA 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 43:26" />Ane tana hassayisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:26">neeni xillo gideysa erisanaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:26">issife shiiqidi mootetoos.<verse eid="ISA 43:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 43:27" />Ne koyro aaway nagara oothis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:27">ne astamaareti tana qohidosona.<verse eid="ISA 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 43:28" />Hessa gisho, taani ta keetha halaqata kawushas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:28">Yayqooba gados, Isra7eele cashshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:28">aathada immas.”<verse eid="ISA 43:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="ISA 44" />
  <para style="s1">Dooretida Isra7eele</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 44:1" />Shin ta aylliya Yayqooba, ta doorida Isra7eele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:1">ha77ika si7a.<verse eid="ISA 44:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 44:2" />Nena medhida, ne aaye ulon nena giigisida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:2">Goday haysada yaagees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:2">Ta aylliya Yayqooba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:2">taani doorida Yishuruuna, yayyofa.<verse eid="ISA 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 44:3" />Taani saamotida biittan haatha gussana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:3">mela biitta bolla shaafa gogisana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:3">Ta Ayyaana ne nayta bolla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:3">ta anjuwa ne kochaa bolla gussana.<verse eid="ISA 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 44:4" />Enti haatha doonan dolida maatada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:4">shaafa lanqen de7iya mithada aacana.<verse eid="ISA 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 44:5" />Issoy bana, taani Godaaba yaagana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:5">hankoy bana Yayqooba sunthan xeegana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:5">haray ba kushiya bolla, “Taani Godaaba” yaagidi caddana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:5">I Isra7eele iya sunthan xeegetana.<verse eid="ISA 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 44:6" />Goday, Isra7eele Kawoynne iya Woziday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:6">Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday haysada yaagees:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:6">“Koyroy tana; wursethay tana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:6">taape hara Xoossi baawa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 48:12">Isa 48:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:17">Qon 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:13">22:13</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 44:7" />Ta meli oonee? De7iko ane awaajo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:7">ane ta sinthan eqidi odo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:7">Benipe doomidi, hanidaba odo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:7">sinthafe hananaba qonciso.<verse eid="ISA 44:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 44:8" />Yayyofite; dagammopite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">taani haysa benipe doomada odabikina?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:8">Kasetada erisabikina?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">Hessas hinte taw marka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:8">Taape attishin, hara Xoossi de7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">Hara Zaalli baawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">oonika baynaysa ta erayis” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 44:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 44:9" />Eeqa misileta medhiya ubbay hada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:9">iyan ufaytiyabati enta go7okona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:9">Enta markati qooqeta entaw eri baawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:9">enti yeellatana.<verse eid="ISA 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 44:10" />Bana go77onna eeqa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:10">Xoossa oothidi giigisiday oonee?<verse eid="ISA 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 44:11" />Eeqa medhey asepe attishin, hara gidenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:11">inne iya laggeti yeellatana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:11">ubbati issife shiiqidi eqo, yayyo, yeellato.<verse eid="ISA 44:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 44:12" />Birata qoxeysi eeqa oothanaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:12">ba birata taman seerisidi mala immanaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:12">ba mino kushiyan naariqan qoxees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:12">Hessa giigisishe koshatees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:12">iya wolqay wurees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:12">saamotesinne labbanees.<verse eid="ISA 44:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 44:13" />Anaaxey wodoron likidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:13">irsaasen iya bolla malla wothees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:13">liiqisiya miishen liiqisees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:13">Lo77o asa malan medhidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:13">ba eeqa keethan wothees.<verse eid="ISA 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 44:14" />I hessa oothanaw ziga qanxees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:14">wola woyko xiidda wora giddofe dooridi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:14">diccana mela oothees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:14">Woyko ziga tokidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:14">iran diccana mela naagees.<verse eid="ISA 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 44:15" />Iyape baggaa eethanaw go7etees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:15">iyape baggaa ekidi, eethidi kayees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:15">baggaa eethidi kathi kathees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:15">Attidaysa ekidi xoosse oothidi iyaw goyinnees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:15">eeqa medhidi iya sinthan gufannees.<verse eid="ISA 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 44:16" />Iyape baggaa eethidi kathi kathees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:16">baggan asho caacidi kallidi mees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:16">Qassi tama kayishe, “Eroshsho, tama goopa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:16">waani ho77i” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 44:17" />Qassi attida mithaa massidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:17">goyinniya xoossa misile kessees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:17">He misiliya sinthan gufannidi, iyaw goyinnees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:17">“Neeni taw xoosse gidiya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:17">tana ashsha” yaagidi woossees.<verse eid="ISA 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 44:18" />Enti aykoka erokona; aykoka akeekokona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:18">enti be7onna mela enta ayfey goozetis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:18">akeekona mela enta wozanay gordetis.<verse eid="ISA 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 44:19" />Eeqa oothiya asaa giddofe ba wozanan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">“Iyape baggaa taman eethas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">iya bonquwan kathi kathas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">iyan asho caacada mas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:19">Iyape attidaysa ixetida eeqa oothada medho?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">attida cugetha mithas gufannada goyinno?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">yaagidi qopiya woyko akeekiya asi baawa.<verse eid="ISA 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 44:20" />I bido mees; iya cimetida wozanay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:20">iya hara soo kaalethis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:20">I ba shempuwa ashshanaw danda7enna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:20">“Haysi ta ushacha kushen de7ey wordo gidenna”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:20">gaanaw danda7enna.<verse eid="ISA 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 44:21" />Goday haysada yaagees:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:21">“Yayqoobaa, haysa akeeka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:21">Isra7eele, neeni ta aylle gidiya gisho haysa hassaya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:21">Taani nena medhas; neeni ta aylle;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:21">neno Isra7eele, taani nena dogike.<verse eid="ISA 44:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 44:22" />Taani ne nagaraa pittada diggas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:22">ne naaquwa caaganada quchas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:22">Taani nena wozida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:22">taako simma” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 44:23" />“Hinteno saloto, Goday haysa oothida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">ufaysan yexite; neno biittaw, ilila.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:23">Hinteno dereto, worawnne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">iya giddon de7iya mitha ubbay mazmure yexite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:23">Goday Yayqooba wozis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">Isra7eele giddon bonchetis.<verse eid="ISA 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 44:24" />Ne aaye ulon nena medhidaysi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:24">nena wozidaysi Goday haysada yaagees:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:24">Ubbabaa Medhiday, salota tarka micciday;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:24">sa7aaka tarka hiixiday, taani Godaa.<verse eid="ISA 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 44:25" />Taani wordo nabeta tinbitiya hada oothas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:25">marota kaayowa eeyatethi kessas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:25">Taani cincata cincatethaa shira yeggas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:25">enta eraa eeya oothas.<verse eid="ISA 44:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 44:26" />Taani ta aylleta qaala minthana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:26">ta nabeta tinbitiya polana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:26">Taani Yerusalaame katamaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:26">‘Neeni asay de7iya bessi gidana’ yaagas;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:26">Yihuda katamata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:26">‘Hinte simmidi keexetana; hinte gimbey ooraxana’ yaagas.<verse eid="ISA 44:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 44:27" />Taani goggiya haathata melisana gisho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:27">ciimmo haatha, ‘Ne mela’ yaagana.<verse eid="ISA 44:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 44:28" />Qiroosako, ‘Neeni ta asaa heemmeysa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:28">neeni ta halchuwa poleysa’ yaagana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:28">I, Yerusalaame katamaa, ‘Neeni simmada keexetana’;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:28">xoossa keethaa, ‘Ne baasoy yegetana’ ” yaagana.<verse eid="ISA 44:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="ISA 45" />
  <para style="s1">Qiroosa Dooretetha</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 45:1" />Goday tiyidaysas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:1">kawota danco bilisaana mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:1">deriya iyaw haarisana mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:1">pengeti iya sinthan dooyetana mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:1">iya ushacha kushiya oykida Qiroosa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:1">Goday haysada yaagees:<verse eid="ISA 45:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 45:2" />Taani ne sinthara baana; dereta dembayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:2">naase birata sanqata menthana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:2">birata kobeta qanxana.<verse eid="ISA 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 45:3" />Nena ne sunthan xeegey tana Godaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:3">Isra7eele Xoossaa gideysa neeni erana mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:3">taani new dhuman de7iya shaluwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:3">geeman qosetida duretetha immana.<verse eid="ISA 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 45:4" />Ta aylliya Yayqooba gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:4">taani doorida Isra7eele gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:4">taani nena ne sunthan xeegas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:4">Neeni tana eronna ixikoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:4">taani nena boncho sunthan xeegas.<verse eid="ISA 45:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 45:5" />Taani Godaa; taape hara xoosse baawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:5">neeni tana eronna ixikoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:5">taani new wolqa immana.<verse eid="ISA 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 45:6" />Hessika awi doliyasope wulliyaso gakanaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:6">taape hari baynaysa asay erana melasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:6">taani Godaa; taape hara xoossi baawa.<verse eid="ISA 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 45:7" />Taani poo7onne dhuma medhas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:7">Sarotethinne dhayo ehayis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:7">ha ubba taani Goday oothayis.<verse eid="ISA 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 45:8" />Hinteno saloto, bollafe xillotethi tigite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:8">shaarati bukiso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:8">Biittay dooyeto, atotethi xillotethay issife dolo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:8">taani Goday haysa medhas.<verse eid="ISA 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 45:9" />Bana Medhidaysara palamiya uraa ayye!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:9">I sa7an meqidi wodhida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:9">otope issuwa mela.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:9">Otoy bana medheysako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:9">Neeni, “Ay oothay?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:9">“New kushey baawa” yaagiyee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:20">Roome 9:20</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 45:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 45:10" />Ba aawa, “Tana ayis yeladii?” giya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:10">ba aayiw, “Tana haysada ayis bannakadii?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:10">giya uraa ayye!<verse eid="ISA 45:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 45:11" />Goday, Isra7eele Geeshshay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:11">iya Medhidaysi haysada yaagees:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:11">“Sinthafe hananaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:11">hinte tana ta naytabaa oychanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:11">ta kushe oosotaba tana kiittanaw bessetii?<verse eid="ISA 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 45:12" />Taani sa7aa oothas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:12">aseka iya bolla medhas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:12">Salota taani ta kushen miccas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:12">enta bolla xoolintota ubbaa wothas.<verse eid="ISA 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 45:13" />Taani Qiroosa xillotethan denthas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:13">iya ogiya ubbaa suure oothana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:13">Miishe qanxonna woyko woyto immonna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:13">I ta katamaa keexana; ta asaa di7ope zaarana”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 45:13">yaagees ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="ISA 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 45:14" />“Goday haysada yaagees:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">Gibxe duretethaynne Tophe zal7ey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">geesay adussa gidida Saaba asati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">neeko yidi, nebaa gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">enti santhalaatan qashetidi, nena kaallana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">Enti new goyinnishe, ‘Xoossi neera de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">iyape attishin, hara xoossi baawa’ ” yaagana.<verse eid="ISA 45:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 45:15" />“Isra7eele Ashshiya Godaa Xoossaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:15">tuma neeni nena genthiya Xoosse.<verse eid="ISA 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 45:16" />Eeqa medheysati ubbay yeellatananne kawuyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:16">enti issife yeella ma7ana.<verse eid="ISA 45:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 45:17" />Shin Goday Isra7eele merinaa atotethan ashshana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:17">hinte merinaw yeellateketa kawuyeketa.<verse eid="ISA 45:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 45:18" />Salota medhida Goday, biitta giigisidi oothiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">asi daana melape attishin, biitta coo medhiboonna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">Xoossay haysada yaagees:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">taani Godaa; taape hari baawa.<verse eid="ISA 45:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 45:19" />Taani geeman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:19">woyko dhuma biittan uttada odabike.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:19">Yayqooba zerethaako, ‘Tana coo bessan koyite’ gabike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:19">taani Goday tumaa haasayis; like gididaba qoncisayis.<verse eid="ISA 45:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 45:20" />Hinteno kawotethata giddofe attidaysato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:20">issife haa mata shiiqite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:20">Mithafe oosetida eeqa misiliya tooki yuuyeysatas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:20">ashshanaw danda7onna xoossata woosseysatas eri baawa.<verse eid="ISA 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 45:21" />Ane palamit; hinte mootuwas gaaso shiishite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">issife zoretite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">Daro wodepe kase haysa odiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">Benipe haysa awaajiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">Tana Godaa gidikinaayee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">Taape attishin, hara Xoossi baawa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">Taape attishin, hari xilloynne ashshiya Xoossi baawa.<verse eid="ISA 45:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 45:22" />Hinteno biitta gaxape gaxa gakanaw de7eysato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:22">taako simmidi attite; taape attishin, hara Xoossi baawa.<verse eid="ISA 45:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 45:23" />Taani tanan caaqas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:23">guye simmonna qaali</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:23">ta doonape xillotethan keyis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:23">Gulbati ubbay taw gulbatana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:23">inxarsi ubbay tanan caaqana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:11">Roome 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:10-11">Filphi 2:10-11</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 45:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 45:24" />Enti tabaa haasayishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:24">‘Xillotethinne minotethi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:24">Godaa xalaalan de7ees’ yaagana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:24">Iya ixiya ubbay iyako yidi yeellatana.<verse eid="ISA 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 45:25" />Shin Isra7eele zeretha ubbay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:25">Godan, xoononne boncho demmana.<verse eid="ISA 45:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="ISA 46" />
  <para style="s1">Babiloone Xoossata</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 46:1" />Beella geetetiya Babiloone eeqay hokis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:1">Nebo geetetiya eeqay gufannis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:1">Enta misileti caana mehe bolla caanetidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:1">daaburida mehetas deexo tooho gididosona.<verse eid="ISA 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 46:2" />Deexuwape dendidaysan caana meheti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:2">caanara issife kundidosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:2">Eeqati bantana ashshanaw danda7onna gisho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:2">bantaw di7etidi bidosona.<verse eid="ISA 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 46:3" />Hinteno, Isra7eelepe attidaysato, Yayqooba kochato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:3">hinte qanthatida wodepe doomada naagiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:3">hinte yeletida wodepe doomada tookiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:3">taani odeysa si7ite.<verse eid="ISA 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 46:4" />Hinte cimana gakanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:4">puulumana gakanaw taani tana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:4">ta hintena maaddana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:4">Taani hintena medhas; ta hintena naagana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:4">ta hintena tookananne ashshana.<verse eid="ISA 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 46:5" />Tana oodera gaaddeyeetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:5">woyko oodera likiseetii?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:5">Enti woli daanees gaanaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:5">tana oodera ginayetii?<verse eid="ISA 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 46:6" />Asay worqanne bira banta qarxiitape qolidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:6">xoosse oothidi medhana mela worqa sheesheysas immoosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:6">I oothidi simmin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:6">enti eeqa sinthan gufannidi goyinnoosona.<verse eid="ISA 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 46:7" />Enti iya denthidi, banta hashiyan tookidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:7">iya bessan iya wothin, I he bessan eqi aggees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:7">Ba de7iya bessaafe qaaxenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:7">asi iyako waassiko iyaw zaaro immenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:7">iya metuwape iya ashshena.<verse eid="ISA 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 46:8" />Hinteno nagaranchoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:8">haysa hassayite; qopite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:8">hinte wozanan wothite.<verse eid="ISA 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 46:9" />Beni wode hanidabata hassayite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:9">taape attishin, hara Xoossi baawa; taani Xoosse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:9">ta meli oonika baawa.<verse eid="ISA 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 46:10" />Ta qofay minnana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:10">taani ta halchuwa ubbaa polana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:10">Wursethan hananaba doomethan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:10">sinthafe hananaba koyrottada erisayis.<verse eid="ISA 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 46:11" />Doloha baggafe bonqiya kafo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:11">haaho biittafe ta qofaa poliya asi xeegana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:11">Taani qopidaba polana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:11">taani halchidaba oothana.<verse eid="ISA 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 46:12" />Hinteno wozani muumidaysato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:12">xillotethafe haakidaysato tana si7ite.<verse eid="ISA 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 46:13" />Taani ta xillotethaa matayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:13">ika haahona gidenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:13">Ta atotethay gam7enna; ta atotetha Xiyoones,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:13">ta bonchuwa Isra7eeles immana” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 46:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="ISA 47" />
  <para style="s1">Babiloone Kundethaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 47:1" />“Babiloone geela7ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:1">duge wodhada baana bolla utta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:1">Babiloone naatte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:1">ne araata aggada sa7an utta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:1">Hizape guye neeni saaphotiyaronne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:1">baalotiyaro geetetaka.<verse eid="ISA 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 47:2" />Woxa teqada kathi gaacca;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:2">ne guulunthaa qaara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:2">ne adussa ma7uwa kessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:2">ne wodiriya qaarada shaafa pinna.<verse eid="ISA 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 47:3" />Ne kalloy qaaretana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:3">ne pokoy bentana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:3">Taani halo keyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:3">oodeska qadhetike” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ISA 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 47:4" />Nuna Woziya Isra7eele Geeshshaa sunthay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:4">Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa.<verse eid="ISA 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 47:5" />“Babiloone naatte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:5">bada dhuman si77i gada utta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:5">Hizape guye neeni kawotethata kawiw geetetaka.<verse eid="ISA 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 47:6" />Taani ta asaa hanqetas; ta laata tunisas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:6">taani enta ne kushen aathada immas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:6">Neeni entaw qadhetabaaka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:6">cimidaysata bolla ne deexo qambara wothadasa.<verse eid="ISA 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 47:7" />Neeni, ‘Taani merinaw kawo gidana’ yaagadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:7">shin ne oothida oosuwanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:7">iya wursethay waananeko qopabaaka.<verse eid="ISA 47:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 47:8" />“Neno wopu gada uttidaarenne naagetada de7idaare si7a.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:7-8">Qon 18:7-8</ref>.</char></note> Ne wozanan, ‘Taape attishin, hari baawa; taani am7o gidike; woyko yelada na7i bayna asi gidike’ yaagadasa. <verse eid="ISA 47:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 47:9" />Ha nam7ubati qoponna issi gallas ne bolla yaana. Ne bitay ay darikoka, ne murunnoy ay wolqaamikoka neeni ne naytape mela atteysinne am7etethay attenna.<verse eid="ISA 47:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 47:10" />“Neeni ne iitatethan ammanetada, ‘Oonika tana be7enna’ yaagadasa. Ne eratethaynne cincatethay nena balethin, neeni ne wozanan, ‘Taape attishin, hari baawa’ yaagadasa. <verse eid="ISA 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 47:11" />Shin neeni waatada ne bitan haassaneeko eronna iitay ne bolla yaana. Neeni gate qanxanaw danda7onna dhayoy ne bolla wodhana; qassi neeni aykoka qoponna gadoy ne bolla yaana.<verse eid="ISA 47:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 47:12" />“Ane neeni ne na7atethafe doomada oothashe de7ida ne bitaanne ne murunnuwa ha77ika ootha. Ooni eri ne qopidaysa mela hananeeko woyko neeni iyara daganthaneeko. <verse eid="ISA 47:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 47:13" />Neeni ekida zorey ubbay daabursafe attishin, nena aykoka maaddibeenna. Salo xoolinto taybeysatinne iya xeellidi ageenan ageenan hananaba odeysati ane nena asho. <verse eid="ISA 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 47:14" />Enti buure mela; tami enta maana. Enti tama lacuwape bantana ashshanaw danda7okona. Asi kayaa bonqoy woyko asi iya sinthan uttidi ho77iya tama gidenna. <verse eid="ISA 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 47:15" />Neeni entara daaburidaysati, na7atethafe doomidi neera zal7idaysati new hessa mela. Enti issoy issoy ba balan balan oyketana; nena ashshiya oonika baawa.”<verse eid="ISA 47:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="ISA 48" />
  <para style="s1">Simmonna Ixida Isra7eele</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 48:1" />“Hinteno, Yayqooba soo asaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">Isra7eele sunthan xeegetidaysato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">Yihuda kochaafe yidaysato, haysa si7ite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:1">Hinte Godaa sunthan caaqeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">Isra7eele Xoossaa xeegeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">shin tumatethaninne xillotethan gidenna.<verse eid="ISA 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 48:2" />Hinte, ‘Nuuni geeshsha kataman de7oos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:2">Isra7eele Xoossan zempoos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:2">iya sunthay Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa’ ”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 48:2">yaagidi ceeqeteta.<verse eid="ISA 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 48:3" />Taani sinthafe hananabata daro wodepe kase odas.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:3">ta doonape enti keyin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:3">enti eeson poletana mela oothas.<verse eid="ISA 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 48:4" />Neeni odin si7onnaysa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:4">ne morgey birata mela gideysa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:4">ne som7oy naase biratada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:4">leeqamonaysa taani erayis.<verse eid="ISA 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 48:5" />Hessa gisho, neeni, “Haysa ta eeqay oothis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:5">ta masetida misileti, ta sheeshada oothida misileti oothidosona” goonnaada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:5">Taani hessa new benipe doomada odas.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:5">Enti hananaape sinthe taani enta new erisas.<verse eid="ISA 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 48:6" />“Ta kase odidaysa ne si7adasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:6">I poletidaysa be7adasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:6">yaatin iya tumatethaa ekikii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:6">Hizape ne eronna oorathabata ta new odana.<verse eid="ISA 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 48:7" />Enti beni medhetidaba gidonashin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:7">ha77i medhetidosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:7">Neeni, ‘Taani enta erayis’ goonnaada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:7">haysafe kase neeni entaba si7abaka.<verse eid="ISA 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 48:8" />Neeni si7abaka; erabaaka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:8">ne haythay benipeka dooyetibeenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:8">Neeni ay cimmiya aseeko taani erayis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:8">neeni yeletoosape geella geetetada xeegeteysa erayis.<verse eid="ISA 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 48:9" />Ta sunthaa gisho, taani ta hanquwa zaarana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:9">ta bonchuwa gisho nena dhaysona mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:9">ta hanquwa teqana.<verse eid="ISA 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 48:10" />Taani nena paacas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:10">birada gidonashin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:10">taani nena meto taman paacas.<verse eid="ISA 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 48:11" />Taani ta gisho, haysa oothana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:11">ta sunthay tooshetana mela koyke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:11">taani ta bonchuwa haras immike.”<verse eid="ISA 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babiloonepe Kessi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 48:12" />“Neno Yayqooba, taani xeegida Isra7eele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:12">taani odiyaba si7a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:12">taani iya; koyroyka tana; wursethayka tana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:6">Isa 44:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:17">Qon 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:13">22:13</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 48:13" />Ta kushey biitta baasuwa medhis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:13">ta ushacha kushey salota miccis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:13">Taani enta xeegiya wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:13">enti issife eqoosona.<verse eid="ISA 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 48:14" />“Hinte ubbay issife shiiqidi si7ite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:14">eeqatape haysi hananaysa sinthatidi odiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:14">Goday dooridaysi iya qofaa Babiloone bolla polana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:14">iya qeseyka Babiloone biitta bolla gidana.<verse eid="ISA 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 48:15" />Taani, ta huuphen iyaw odas; iya xeegas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:15">ta iya ehana; I oothiyaba ubbay iyaw poletana.<verse eid="ISA 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 48:16" />“Taako haa shiiqidi haysa si7ite;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:16">“Taani koyrope doomada geeman odabike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:16">hessi hanida wodepe doomada taani yan de7ayis” yaagees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:16">Ha77ika Ubbaa Haariya Godaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:16">iya Ayyaanay tana kiittidosona.<verse eid="ISA 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 48:17" />Nena woziya Goday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:17">Isra7eele Geeshshay haysada yaagees:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:17">“Nena maaddiyaba tamaarsey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:17">ne baanaw bessiya ogiya ne kaalethey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:17">tana ne Godaa, ne Xoossaa.<verse eid="ISA 48:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 48:18" />Neeni ta kiitaa si7idaba gidiyako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:18">ne sarotethay shaafa haathada gogganashin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:18">ne xillotethay abba beetada hananashin.<verse eid="ISA 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 48:19" />Ne kochay abba shafeda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:19">ne nayti taybetonna baana mela daranashin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:19">enta sunthay ta sinthafe dhayenna; kichennashin” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 48:20" />Babiloone biittafe keyite;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:4">Qon 18:4</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:20">Babiloonepe baqatite!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:20">Qaala dhoqu oothidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:20">ufaysan haysada yaagidi waassite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:20">Sa7aa gaxape gaxa gakanaw haysa kiittite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:20">“Goday ba aylliya Yayqooba wozis” yaagidi odite.<verse eid="ISA 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 48:21" />I enta mela biittara kaalethida wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:21">saamotibookona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:21">Zaallafe haathi entaw pultis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:21">I zaalla phalqin haathi dhuuqis. <verse eid="ISA 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 48:22" />“Iitatas saroy baawa” yaagees Goday.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:21">Isa 57:21</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="ISA 49" />
  <para style="s1">Godaa Aylle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 49:1" />Hinteno, yuushoy abban teqetida biittato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:1">taani odeysa si7ite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:1">Hinteno, haahoson de7iya kawotethato akeekite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:1">taani yeletanaape kase Goday tana xeegis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:1">ta aaye ulon de7ishin, ta suntha sunthis.<verse eid="ISA 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 49:2" />Ta inxarsaa qara mashshi oothis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:2">ba kushiya kuyan tana genthis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:2">I tana poshetida donge yiishshi oothidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:2">ba shoohuwan tana qottis.<verse eid="ISA 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 49:3" />I taako, “Isra7eele, neeni ta aylle;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:3">taani ta bonchuwa nenan qoncisana” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 49:4" />Shin taani, “Taani coo daaburas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:4">ta wolqaa go77i baynabaninne hadaban wursas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:4">Gidoshin, ta pirday Godaa matana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:4">ta gatey ta Xoossaa matana” yaagas.<verse eid="ISA 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 49:5" />Taani Godaa ayfe sinthan bonchetida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:5">ta Xoossay taw wolqa gidida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:5">Yayqooba iyako zaaranaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:5">Isra7eele iyako shiishanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:5">taani iya aylle gidana mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:5">tana ta aaye ulon doorida<verse eid="ISA 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 49:6" />Goday taako haysada yaagees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">Neeni Yayqooba kochaa denthanaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">Isra7eelepe attida guuthata zaarada ehanaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">neeni taw aylle gideysi daro guuthaba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:6">Hessafe aathada, ta atotethay biitta gaxa gakana mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">taani nena kawotethatas poo7o oothana.<verse eid="ISA 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 49:7" />Kadhetidaysasinne ixetidaysas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">qassi kawotethata haariya aylliyas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">Isra7eele woziya Goday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">Isra7eele Geeshshay haysada yaagees;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">Ammanthiya Godaa gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">nena doorida Isra7eele Geeshsha gisho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">kawoti be7idi dendi eqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">deriya haareysati be7idi goyinnana.<verse eid="ISA 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalaamey Ooraxana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 49:8" />Goday yaagees;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">“Taani doorida woden ne oysha zaarana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">atotetha gallas taani nena maadana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">Taani nena naagana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">neeni biitta zaarada essana mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">asi doonna biitta neeni laatisana mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">taani nena asaas caaqo oothada immas.<verse eid="ISA 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 49:9" />Di7etidaysata, ‘Keyite!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:9">dhuma qashon de7eyisata, ‘Birshetite!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:9">gaana mela taani nena oothana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:9">Enti oge matan heemetana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:9">mela dere bolla heemetiya bessi demmana.<verse eid="ISA 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 49:10" />Enti koshatokona woyko saamotokona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:10">enta mela biitta mishay xuuggenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:10">away enta meenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:10">Entaw qadheteysi enta kaalethana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:10">pulto haathaako enta laaggana.<verse eid="ISA 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 49:11" />Taani ta dereta ubbaa oge kessana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:11">ta wogga ogeta dhoqu oothana.<verse eid="ISA 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 49:12" />Heko, ta asay haahosoope yaana:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:12">pudeha baggaafenne wuloha baggafe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:12">qassi Aswaana biittafe yaana” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 49:13" />Hinteno saloto, ufaysan yexite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:13">neno biittaw ufayta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:13">Hinteno dereto, ililite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:13">Goday ba asa minthethis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:13">ba metootetida ba asaas qadhetis.<verse eid="ISA 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 49:14" />Shin Xiyooney, “Goday tana aggis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:14">Xoossay tana dogis” yaagasu.<verse eid="ISA 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 49:15" />Aayiya ba dhanthiya na7aa doganaw danda7ay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:15">Ba ulope keyida na7as qadhetekee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:15">Iya dogikoka, taani nena dogike!<verse eid="ISA 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 49:16" />Heko, taani nena ta kushe qaaqan xaafa wothas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:16">ne dirsa gimbeti ubba wode ta sinthan de7oosona.<verse eid="ISA 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 49:17" />Nena zaaridi keexeysati ellesidi yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:17">nena laallidaysati neepe haakana.<verse eid="ISA 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 49:18" />Ane dhoqu gada ne yuushuwa xeella;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">ne nayti ubbay issife shiiqidi neeko yaana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:18">Taani Goday, tanan caaqas:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">neeni enta ubbaa alleeqoda ma7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">gelanaw haniya maccasi alleeqeteysada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">neeni entan alleeqetana.<verse eid="ISA 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 49:19" />Neeni laaletada baysa gidikoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:19">ne biittay dhaykoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:19">ha77i nenan de7iya asaas daro xuummana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:19">nena laallidaysati neepe haakana.<verse eid="ISA 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 49:20" />Neeni kayotiya laythan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:20">new yeletida nayti ne haythan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:20">“Haysi bessay nuus daro xuunthu gidiya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:20">nu daana dalga bessi imma” yaagana.<verse eid="ISA 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 49:21" />Neeni ne wozanan, “Ha nayta ubbaa taw oone yeliday?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">Taani yelada dhonthu gidas; taani di7etas, ixetas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">Yaatin, haysata oone dichiday?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">Taani tarka attas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">yaatin ha nayti ubbay awupe yidona? yaagana.”<verse eid="ISA 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 49:22" />Ubbaa Haariya Goday haysada yaagees:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:22">“Heko, taani kawotethata mallata bessaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:22">asaas ta bandira essana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:22">Enti ne adde nayta idimmidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:22">ne macca nayta banta hashiyan tookidi ehana.<verse eid="ISA 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 49:23" />Kawoti nena dichiya aawata gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">enta macca kawoti nena dhanthiya aayo gidana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:23">Enti gufannidi new goyinnana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">ne toho baana laaccana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:23">Taani Godaa gideysa neeni hessan erana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">tanan ammanetidi naageysati yeellatokona” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 49:24" />Olanchuwafe di7o yegisanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:24">wozan iita asa kushepe di7etida asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:24">kessi ekanaw danda7etiyee?<verse eid="ISA 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 49:25" />Shin Goday yaagees:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:25">Olancho kushepe di7etida asi kessi ekanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:25">wozana mino asape di7o yegisanaw danda7etees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:25">Neera oleteysatara taani oletana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:25">ne naytaka ashshana.<verse eid="ISA 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 49:26" />Nena un7etheysati banta ashuwa maana mela oothana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">woyne uyidi mathoteysada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">enti banta suuthaa uyidi mathotana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:26">He wode asa ubbay taani Godaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">nena Ashshiya, Woziyanne Yayqooba Wolqaamaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">gideysa erana.<verse eid="ISA 49:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="ISA 50" />
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Nagaranne Aylliya Kiitetethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 50:1" />Goday yaagees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">“Taani hinte aayiw yeddida pirima worqatey awun de7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">taani ooddes hintena taani bayzadina?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:1">Heko, hinte nagaraa gisho hinte bayzetideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">hinte naaquwa gisho hinte aayiya yedetasu.<verse eid="ISA 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 50:2" />Taani yida wode, haysan asi ayis dhayidee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">Taani xeegida wode, ‘Yee!’ gaanaw ayis asi dhayidee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Taani hintena wozanaw ta kushey qantheyee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">hintena ashshanaw taw wolqi baaweyee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Taani abba seerada melisayis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">shaafata mela biitta oothayis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Haathi dhayin entan de7iya moloti wooqosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">saamoy wodhin hayqoosona.<verse eid="ISA 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 50:3" />Taani salota dhuma mayzayis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:3">enta kamay kayo ma7o daanees” yaagis.<verse eid="ISA 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 50:4" />Daaburidaysa taani qaalan minthetho erana mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:4">Ubbaa Haariya Goday taw tamaarida inxarsi immis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:4">I tana wonta wonta barkisidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:4">taani tamaareda si7anaada ta haythaa dooyees.<verse eid="ISA 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 50:5" />Ubbaa Haariya Goday ta haythaa dooyis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:5">taani geella gidabike; guye simmabike.<verse eid="ISA 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 50:6" />Taani ta zokuwa shoceysatas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:6">ta buuchaa shoddeysatas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:6">ta gacuwa aathada immas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:6">Ta bolla cutteysatapenne tana kawusheysatape</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:6">ta som7uwa genthabike.<verse eid="ISA 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 50:7" />Ubbaa Haariya Goday tana maaddiya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:7">taani yeellatike.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:7">Taani ta som7uwa salo shuchu oothas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:7">taani yeellatonnaysa erayis.<verse eid="ISA 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 50:8" />Taw pirdeysi matan de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:8">yaatin, tana mootey oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:8">Ane taara mootetanaw eqo!<verse eid="ISA 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 50:9" />Ubbaa Haariya Goday tana maaddees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:9">yaatin, ta bolla pirdey oonee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:9">Enti ubbay ma7oda cimana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:9">enta bili maana.<verse eid="ISA 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 50:10" />Hinte giddofe Godaa yayyey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:10">iya aylliya qaalas kiitetey oonee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:10">Dhuman hemeteynne poo7oy baynay I oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:10">He uray Godaa sunthan ammaneto; ba Xoossan zempo.<verse eid="ISA 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 50:11" />Hinteno tama eethiya ubbato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:11">laco xompe hintew shiisheysato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:11">hinte eethida tama poo7uwan hemetite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:11">Laco xompiyan simeretite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:11">Hinte ta kushepe ekanaw de7ey haysa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:11">hinte wolqaama meto seelan zin7ana.<verse eid="ISA 50:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="ISA 51" />
  <para style="s1">Merina Atotethi Xiyoones</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 51:1" />Hinteno xillotethi kaalleysato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:1">hinteno Godaa koyeysato si7ite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:1">Hinte phalqetidi eketida shuchaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:1">hinte booketidi keyida ollaa xeellite.<verse eid="ISA 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 51:2" />Hinte aawa Abrahaamenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:2">hintena yelida Saaro xeellite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:2">I barka de7ishin, taani iya xeegada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:2">anjasinne taybon darsas.<verse eid="ISA 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 51:3" />“Goday Xiyoonenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">laaletida bessan de7iya asa ubbaa minthethana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:3">I mela biitta Edene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">kalotida biitta Godaa atakilte gadeda oothana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:3">Yan ufaysinne hashshu guussi daana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">galatinne mazmurey si7etana.<verse eid="ISA 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 51:4" />“Ta asaw; ta odiyaba si7ite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:4">ta deriyaw, hinte haythaa taako zaarite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:4">Higgey taape keyees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:4">ta suure pirday kawotethatas poo7o gidana.<verse eid="ISA 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 51:5" />Ta xillotethay ellesidi shiiqana; ta atotethay matis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:5">ta qesey kawotethatas suure pirdaa ehana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:5">Yuushoy abban teqetida biittati ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:5">tanan ammanetidi naagana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:5">taani enta ta wolqan ashshanaysa ufaysan naagana.<verse eid="ISA 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 51:6" />Pude dhoqu gidi salota xeellite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">duge sa7aaka xeellite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:6">Saloti cuyada laaletidi dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">sa7i afilada wurana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">iyan de7iya asa ubbay udunxeda hayqana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:6">Shin ta atotethay merinaw daana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">ta xillotethay wurenna.<verse eid="ISA 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 51:7" />“Hinteno xillotethaa ereysato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:7">ta higgey hinte wozanan de7eysato, si7ite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:7">Asaa bore yayyofite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:7">enta cashshas dagammopite.<verse eid="ISA 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 51:8" />Bili ma7o, dorsa ikise guxuney meysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:8">enti meetetana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:8">Shin ta xillotethay merinaw daana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:8">ta atotethay yeletetha ubbaas gidana” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 51:9" />Abeeti Godaw, denda! Denda!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:9">Godaa qesiyaw, wolqaa ma7a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:9">Beni wodetaninne yeletethan hanidaysada denda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:9">Ra7aaba geetetiya dawiya qanxerethidaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:9">caddiday nena gidikiyee?<verse eid="ISA 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 51:10" />Abbaanne gita ciimmo haatha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:10">melisiday nena gidikiyee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:10">Ne wozidaysati pinnana mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:10">ciimmo abba oge oothiday nena gidikiyee?<verse eid="ISA 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 51:11" />Goday wozidaysati yexishe simmidi Xiyoone yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:11">merinaa ufaysay kallacha mela enta bolla uttana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:11">Enti ufaysinne hashshu giyaba demmana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:11">azzanoynne yeehoy entafe haakana.<verse eid="ISA 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 51:12" />Goday, “Taani, hintena minthethey tana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:12">yaatin, hayqiya asenne maatada shulliya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:12">asa na7a yayyanaw hinte oonee?<verse eid="ISA 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 51:13" />Salota miccidanne sa7a baasuwa essida Godaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">hintena medhida Xoossaa dogideta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:13">Enti hintena dhaysanaw un7ethiya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">asaa hanquwa gaason ubba gallas yashshan de7eeta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:13">Shin hintena un7etheyisata hanqoy awun de7ii?<verse eid="ISA 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 51:14" />Di7etidaysati eeson birshetana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:14">qashetida ollan hayqokona; koshatokona.”<verse eid="ISA 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 51:15" />“Taani Godaa, ne Xoossaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:15">guummana mela abba qaathey tana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:15">ta sunthay Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa.<verse eid="ISA 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 51:16" />Ta qaala ne doonan wothiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:16">ta kushe kuyan nena genthiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:16">salota micciday, sa7aa baasuwa essiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:16">Xiyooneko, ‘Neeni ta ase’ ” yaagiday tana.<verse eid="ISA 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Hanqo Xuu7a</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 51:17" />Neno, Godaa kushepe gandigarsiya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:17">hanqo xuu7aa ashshona uyida Yerusalaame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:17">barka! Denda! Denda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:10">Qon 14:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:19">16:19</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 51:18" />Iya yelida naytape iyo kaalethiya issoyka baawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:18">iya dichida naytape I kushiya oykidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:18">efida issoyka baawa.<verse eid="ISA 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 51:19" />Ha nam7ubati ne qaada gididosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:19">hessati laaletethinne dhayo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:19">koshinne mashshi ne bolla yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:19">yaatin, nena ooni minthethanee?<verse eid="ISA 51:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 51:20" />Ne nayti giten gelida gen7eda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:20">oge gaxan kundidi labbanidosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:20">Enti Godaa hanquwaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:20">ne Xoossaa seeran kumidosona.<verse eid="ISA 51:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 51:21" />Hessa gisho, woyne ushshan gidonashin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:21">meton mathotidaysato, hinte haysa si7ite.<verse eid="ISA 51:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 51:22" />“Ba asaas mootetiya ne Goday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:22">ne Xoossay yaagees;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:22">Heko, nena gandigarisiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:22">ta hanqo xuu7aa taani ne kushepe ekas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:22">neeni zaarada he mathoyiya ushsha uyaka.<verse eid="ISA 51:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 51:23" />Taani hessa nena un7ethiya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:23">asaa kushen wothana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:23">Enti neeko, ‘Nuuni ne bollara hemetidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:23">aadhana mela zaqulla’ ” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:23">Neeni enti aadhana gakanaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:23">ne zokuwa entaw biittadanne ogeda oothadasa.<verse eid="ISA 51:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="ISA 52" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 52:1" />Neno Xiyoone, barka; barka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:1">minotethi afilada ma7a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:1">Neno geeshsha katame, Yerusalaame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:1">ne boncho ma7uwa ma7a.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:2">Qon 21:2</ref>, <ref loc="REV 21:27">27</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:1">Hizape guye qaxaretonaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:1">tuni ne giddo gelenna.<verse eid="ISA 52:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 52:2" />Neno, di7etida Yerusalaame, ne baana qoqofa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:2">dendada ne araata bolla utta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:2">Neno Xiyoone asaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:2">ne qoodhen qashetida santhalaata birsha.<verse eid="ISA 52:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 52:3" />Ubbaa Haariya Goday haysada yaagees:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:3">“Hinte kase gatey bayna bayzetideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:3">ha77i qassi miishe immonna coo wozetana.<verse eid="ISA 52:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 52:4" />Goday haysada yaagees:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:4">Ta asay koyro bete asi gididi Gibxe bis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:4">guyepe Asooreti ta asaa coo un7ethidosona.<verse eid="ISA 52:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 52:5" />Xoossay haysada yaagidi odees:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:5">Ta asay gatey bayna coo di7etidi bin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:5">taw haysan aybe de7ey?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:5">Enta haareysati toochoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:5">ta sunthay ubba wode cayetees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:24">Roome 2:24</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 52:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 52:6" />Hessa gisho, ta asay ta sunthaa erana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:6">he gallas haysa odey tana gideysa enti erana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:6">ee, I tana” yaagees Ubbaa Haariya Goday.<verse eid="ISA 52:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 52:7" />Lo77o mishiraacho ehiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:7">sarotethaa awaajiya, atotethi odiya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:7">Xiyooneko, “Ne Xoossay kawotis” yaagishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:7">deriya bollara yaa tohoti waani lo77oona.<verse eid="ISA 52:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 52:8" />Ne katamaa naageysati banta qaala dhoqu oothidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:8">ufaysan issife yexoosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:8">Goday Xiyoone simmiya wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:8">enti banta ayfen be7ana.<verse eid="ISA 52:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 52:9" />Hinteno Yerusalaamen laaletida bessato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:9">issife ufaysan yexite;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:9">Goday ba asaa minthethis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:9">Yerusalaame wozis.<verse eid="ISA 52:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 52:10" />Goday ba geeshsha qesiya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:10">kawotethata ubbaa sinthan qoncisis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:10">Biitta gaxaa gakanaw de7iya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:10">asa ubbay nu Xoossaa atotetha be7ana.<verse eid="ISA 52:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 52:11" />Hinteno Godaa miishiya tookeysato, shaaketite,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:11">shaaketite, yaape keyite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:11">Tunabaa bochofite; iya giddofe keyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:11">hintena geeshshite.<verse eid="ISA 52:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 52:12" />Shin hinte keyishe eeson keyeketa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:12">woyko goodetidi beeketa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:12">Goday hintefe sinthe aadhidi kaalethana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:12">Isra7eele Xoossay guyera gididi hintena naagana.<verse eid="ISA 52:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Waaye Ekiya Aylle</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 52:13" />“Heko, ta aylley akeekan oothana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:13">I bonchetidi, dhoqu dhoqu gaana; daro gitatana.<verse eid="ISA 52:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 52:14" />Iya som7oy asa ubbaafe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:14">iya medhoy asa naytape aadhidi qohetis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:14">iya be7idi daro asay dagammidosona.<verse eid="ISA 52:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 52:15" />Shin ha77i daro kawotethati ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:15">iyaban malaaletana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:15">iya gaason, daro kawoti banta doona oykana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:15">Enti bantaw odetiboonnaba be7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:15">si7iboonaba akeekana” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 52:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="ISA 53" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 53:1" />Nuuni odidaba ooni ammanidee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:1">Godaa qesey ooddes qoncidee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:38">Yoha 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:16">Roome 10:16</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 53:2" />I iya sinthan mela biittan aacida duruma mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:2">xapho yeddida dola mela diccis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:2">Nuuni iya loythi xeellonna mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:2">mali woyko teemi baawa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:2">Nuuni iyako shiiqonna mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:2">cuchu mal7o gidenna.<verse eid="ISA 53:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 53:3" />I asan kadhetis, ixetis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:3">I metopenne azzanope</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:3">shaaketi eronna asi gidis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:3">Asi iya be7anaape gidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:3">ba som7uwa wora zaariya asada kadhetis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:3">nuuni iya bonchibooko.<verse eid="ISA 53:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 53:4" />I tuma nu waayiya baw ekis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:4">qassi nu daabura tookis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:17">Maato 8:17</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:4">Shin nuuni, I Xoossan deshetidi kundidadanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:4">madunxidaada qopida.<verse eid="ISA 53:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 53:5" />Shin I nu nagaraa gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:5">cadetidi madunxis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:5">nu qohuwa gisho shocetidi liiqis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:24">1 Phex 2:24</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:5">Iya seeran nuuni saro demmida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:5">iya madunthan nuuni paxida.<verse eid="ISA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 53:6" />Nuuni ubbay oge balida dorsada wora bida;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:25">1 Phex 2:25</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:6">nu ubbay nu ogiya ogiya bida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:6">Shin Goday nu ubbaa naaquwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:6">iya bolla wothis.<verse eid="ISA 53:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 53:7" />I un7etis; qohetis;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:6">Qon 5:6</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:7">shin ba doona dooybeenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:7">Shukanaw efiya urge dorsada laagetis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:7">ba ikisiya meediya uraa sinthan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:7">si77i giya dorsa mela aykoka pogibeenna.<verse eid="ISA 53:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 53:8" />Enti iya un7ethoninne geella pirdan efidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:8">I ta asaa nagaraa gisho shocetidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:8">de7on de7eyisata biittafe kichidaysa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:8">iya kochaafe ooni akeekidee?<verse eid="ISA 53:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 53:9" />Iya doonan bali bayna, I, iitaba oothonna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:9">ba hayquwan iita asatara taybetis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:9">iya duufoy dure asatara gidis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:22">1 Phex 2:22</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 53:10" />Shin iya qohetethaynne iya un7etethay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:10">Godaa shene gidis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:10">I bana nagara yarsho oothiya wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:10">ba kochaa be7ana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:10">Iya laythay aduqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:10">Godaa sheney iya kushen poletana.<verse eid="ISA 53:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 53:11" />Ba shempuwa waayiyape guye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:11">I de7o poo7o be7ana; ufaytana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:11">Ta xillo aylley ba eratethan darota xillisana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:11">enta qohuwaka tookana.<verse eid="ISA 53:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 53:12" />Hessa gisho, taani iya gishuwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">gita asata giddon immana;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 15:28">Mar 15:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:37">Luqa 22:37</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">minotara I di7uwa shaaketana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:12">I ba shempuwa hayqos aathidi immidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">iitatara paydetis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:12">I daro asaa nagaraa tookis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">geellatas gaannatis.<verse eid="ISA 53:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="ISA 54" />
  <para style="s1">Xiyoone Sintha Bonchuwa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 54:1" />Naate, yelonna maynthe, yexa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:1">Naate, iqeta eronnaare, ufaysan ilila!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:1">Azinara de7iya maccase naytape</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:1">barka de7iya maccase nayti darana.<verse eid="ISA 54:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 54:2" />Ne dunkaaniya bessaa dalgisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:2">dunkaaniya gesheta piddi oothada micca;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:2">xuumisopa; wodoruwa adussa; dhishiya mintha.<verse eid="ISA 54:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 54:3" />Neeni ushachinne haddirsi dalgana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:3">ne kochati kawotethata laattana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:3">baysatida enta katamatan keexidi daana.<verse eid="ISA 54:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 54:4" />“Yayyofa; neeni yeellataka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:4">dagammofa; neeni kawuyaka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:4">Ne yalagatetha yeella neeni dogana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:4">ne am7etetha boriya hizape guye hassayaka.<verse eid="ISA 54:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 54:5" />Ne azinay nena Medhidaysa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:5">iya sunthay Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:5">Isra7eele Geeshshay nena Wozidaysa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:5">I biitta ubbaa Xoossaa geetetana.<verse eid="ISA 54:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 54:6" />Azini aggin, dogetada azzaniya maccasada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:6">yalagatethan azina soope keyida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:6">maccasada neeni hanada de7ishin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:6">taani Goday nena zaarada xeegas.<verse eid="ISA 54:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 54:7" />“Guutha wode taani nena aggas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:7">shin gita qadhen taani nena zaarada ehana.<verse eid="ISA 54:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 54:8" />Suulliya hanqon taani ta som7uwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:8">neepe guutha wodes genthas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:8">Shin merinaa maarotethan taani new qadhetana”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:8">yaagees nena woziya Goday.<verse eid="ISA 54:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 54:9" />“Haysi taw Nohe wodiya mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:9">he wode taani dhayo haathan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:9">zaarada sa7aa dhaysike gada caaqidaysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:9">zaarada ne bolla hanqetonna melanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:9">seeronna mela taani caaqas.<verse eid="ISA 54:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 54:10" />Dereti qaxanaw, zumati banta bessaafe kichanaw danda7oosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:10">shin ta merinaa siiqoy neepe shaaketenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:10">ta sarotetha caaqoy neepe kichenna”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 54:10">yaagees new qadhetiya Goday.<verse eid="ISA 54:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 54:11" />“Neno, metootida katame, gotey yaanne haanne shocidaare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:11">minthethiyabay dhayidare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:11">Heko, taani nena boncho shuchan alleeqisada keexana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:11">ne baasuwa sanpare shuchan hiixana.<verse eid="ISA 54:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 54:12" />Ne shucha gimbiya qustiya zo7o inqo shuchan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:12">ne pengiya phooliya al7o shuchan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:12">ne dirsa boncho shuchan gimbana.<verse eid="ISA 54:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 54:13" />Ne nayti ubbay Godaape tamaarana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:13">ne nayta sarotethay darana.<verse eid="ISA 54:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 54:14" />Neeni xillotethan minnada eqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:14">geneynne un7ethoy neepe haakana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:14">Nena yashisiyaba deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:14">dagami neeko shiiqenna.<verse eid="ISA 54:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 54:15" />Nena olanaw dendey de7iko, hessi taape gidenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:15">nena qohanaw koyey de7iko, I kundana.<verse eid="ISA 54:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 54:16" />“Heko, huben tama hubidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:16">ba qopida ola miishiya qoxiya uraa taani medhas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:16">dhaysana mela dhayseysa medhiday tana.<verse eid="ISA 54:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 54:17" />Nena qohanaw oosetida ay miisheyka ne bolla oothenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:17">nena mootiya inxarsa ubbaas ne zaaro immana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:17">Godaa aylleta laatay haysa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:17">taape enti ekiya xillo haysa” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ISA 54:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="ISA 55" />
  <para style="s1">Saamotida Ubbay Yo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 55:1" />Hinteno, saamotidaysato, ubbay taako haa yiite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:1">miishey baynaysato, haa yiite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:1">Shammidi miite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:1">haa yidi, miishe qanxonna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:1">coo woyne ushshinne maathi shammite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">55:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:6">Qon 21:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:7">22:7</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 55:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 55:2" />Kathi gidonnabaas hinte miishiya ayis kesseetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:2">Kalsonnaban hinte wolqaa ayis wurseetii?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:2">Ane tana si7ite, taani odeysa hayzite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:2">lo77o kathaa miite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:2">lo77o kathan hinte asatethaa ufaysite.<verse eid="ISA 55:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 55:3" />“Hinte haytha taako zaaridi tana si7ite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:3">de7on daanaw ta odeysa si7ite;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">55:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:34">Hawa 13:34</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:3">taani Dawitas gelida ufaysa qaalan hintena anjana.<verse eid="ISA 55:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 55:4" />Heko, taani iya kawotethatas marka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:4">kaaletheysanne halaqa oothas.<verse eid="ISA 55:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 55:5" />Goday, ne Xoossay, Isra7eele Geeshshay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:5">nena bonchida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:5">neeni eronna kawotethata xeegana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:5">nena eronna kawotethati ellesidi neeko yaana.”<verse eid="ISA 55:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 55:6" />“Goday bentiya wode iya koyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:6">matan de7iya wode iya xeegite.<verse eid="ISA 55:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 55:7" />Iita asi ba ogiyape simmo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:7">nagaranchoy ba qofaa aggo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:7">Godaako simmo, ika iya maarana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:7">I nu Xoossaako simmo, iyaw atto gaana.<verse eid="ISA 55:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 55:8" />Ta qofay hinte qofaa mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:8">ta ogey hinte ogiya mela gidenna”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 55:8">yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ISA 55:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 55:9" />Saloti sa7aape dhoqeysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:9">ta ogey hinte ogiyape,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:9">ta qofay hinte qofaape dhoqees.<verse eid="ISA 55:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 55:10" />Irinne shachi salope wodhidi,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">55:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 9:10">2 Qoro 9:10</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:10">biitta laakisidi, kathi dolana melanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:10">ayfana mela ootheysada, zereysas zerethi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:10">meysas kathi immonna guye salo simmenna.<verse eid="ISA 55:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 55:11" />Ta doonape keyiya qaalay hessa mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:11">I taani halchidaysa polonnanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:11">ta kiittidaysa oothonna taako coo simmenna.<verse eid="ISA 55:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 55:12" />“Hinte ufaysan keyana; saron moyzetana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:12">deretinne zumati hinte sinthan ufaytidi yexana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:12">bazzo mithati ubbay banta kushiya baqana.<verse eid="ISA 55:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 55:13" />Aguntha gisho xiidda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:13">gom7ore gisho xaythi dolana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:13">Hessi Godaa qofisiyabaanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:13">merinaw dhayonna malla gidana”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 55:13">yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ISA 55:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="ISA 56" />
  <para style="s1">Atotethi Haratas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 56:1" />“Suure pirdaa naagite; xillo oothite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:1">ta atotethay ellesidi yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:1">ta xillotethay matan qoncana.<verse eid="ISA 56:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 56:2" />Haysa oothiya uray,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:2">Sambaata tunisonna bonchiya uraynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:2">ba kushey iitabaa oothonna mela teqiya uray anjetidaysa”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 56:2">yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ISA 56:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 56:3" />Godaako shiiqida bete asi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:3">“Goday tana ba asaape shaakana” goopo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:3">shuufay, “Taani melida mithi” goopo.<verse eid="ISA 56:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 56:4" />“Ta Sambaata bonchiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:4">tana ufaysiyaba dooreynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:4">ta caaquwa minthidi naagiya shuufatas,<verse eid="ISA 56:4" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 56:5" />entaw taani ta keethaninne ta dirsa gimbiya giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:5">enti hassayetiyaba immana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:5">Enti macca na7anne adde na7a yelidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:5">demmiya bonchuwafe aadhiya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:5">sunthi taani entaw immana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:5">taani merinaw dhayonna sunthi entaw immana.<verse eid="ISA 56:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 56:6" />Godaa haggaazanaw, Godaa dosanawunne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:6">iya aylle gidanaw bantana iyako shiishiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:6">sambaata tunisonna bonchiyanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:6">ta caaqo qaala minthidi naagiya bete asata,<verse eid="ISA 56:6" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 56:7" />taani ta geeshsha zumaa bolla ehada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">ta woosa keethan enta ufaysana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:7">Enti ta yarsho bessan shiishiya xuussa yarshoynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">hara yarshoy eketana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">ta keethay asa ubbay Xoossaa woossiya keethi geetetana”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">56:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:13">Maato 21:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:17">Mar 11:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:46">Luqa 19:46</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 56:7">yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 56:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 56:8" />“Shiqidaysata bolla gujada harataka taani shiishana”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:8">yaagees Isra7eelepe laaletidaysata shiishiya, Ubbaa Haariya Goday.<verse eid="ISA 56:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossay Iitata Mootees</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 56:9" />Hinteno bazzo do7ato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:9">hinteno wora do7ato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:9">ubbay haa yidi miite.<verse eid="ISA 56:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 56:10" />Isra7eele asaa naageysati qooqe; entaw eri baawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:10">enti ubbay boccanaw danda7onna butale kanata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:10">enti zin7idi elmotoosona; dhisko dosoosona.<verse eid="ISA 56:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 56:11" />Enti midi kallonna yaramba kana mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:11">enti akeeki pacida henthancho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:11">Enti ubbay banta oge bidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:11">ubbay banta go77a xalaala koyoosona.<verse eid="ISA 56:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 56:12" />Enti, “Haa yiite; woyne ushsha ane uyoos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:12">mathoyiya ushsha ane ganoos!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:12">Wontoy hachi mela gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:12">hachifeka aadhidi lo77ana” yaagosona.<verse eid="ISA 56:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="ISA 57" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 57:1" />Xillo asi hayqees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:1">shin hessa qopey baawa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:1">Bantana Xoossas immida asay biittafe eketoosona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:1">shin xillo asi iiti yaanape sinthatidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:1">eketeysa oonika akeekenna.<verse eid="ISA 57:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 57:2" />I, bidi sarotethi de7iya bessi gelees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:2">suuretethan hemeteysati hayqidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:2">shempo demmoosona.<verse eid="ISA 57:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 57:3" />“Hinteno, maro nayto, hinteno laammiyanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:3">laymatiya zareto, haa yiite.<verse eid="ISA 57:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 57:4" />Hinte oona qelqiseetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:4">Hinte oona boreetiii?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:4">Hinte inxarsaa oodde bolla kesseetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:4">Hinte geellatanne wordancho nayta gideketii?<verse eid="ISA 57:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 57:5" />Hinte wolaa garsaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:5">daashsha mitha garsan amon xuugeteeta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:5">Hinte nayta zangaaraninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:5">zaalla qophon shukidi yarsheeta.<verse eid="ISA 57:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 57:6" />Zangaaran de7iya liiqo shuchati hinte xoossata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:6">Hinte entaw ushsha yarsho tigideta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:6">Kathaa yarshoka immideta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:6">yaatin, taani haysan hanqetikina?<verse eid="ISA 57:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 57:7" />Zumaa huuphen hiixa yeggideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:7">yan yarshanaw keydeta.<verse eid="ISA 57:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 57:8" />Hinte pengiyafenne gobanetape</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:8">soo baggara eeqa misileta essideta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:8">Tana aggidi hinte arsa dalgisidi, yaa keydeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:8">entara caaqideta; yaatidi enta arsa dosideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:8">enta kalluwa be7ideta.<verse eid="ISA 57:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 57:9" />Zaytenne shitto ekidi Moloka geetetiya eeqako bideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:9">hinte kiitanchota haaho soo kiittideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:9">hari attoshin si7oole gakanaw wodhideta.<verse eid="ISA 57:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 57:10" />Hinte hara xoossata koyishe daaburideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:10">shin, ‘Ufaysi baawa’ gibeeketa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:10">Hinte wolqay haa ooraxis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:10">hessa gisho, labbanidi kundibeeketa.<verse eid="ISA 57:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 57:11" />“Hinte oona yayyidi, taw wordotidetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:11">Hinte tana qopibeketa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:11">hinte wozanan qopibeketa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:11">Hinte taw yayyonna ixiday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:11">taani daro wode si77i gida gisho gidennee?<verse eid="ISA 57:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 57:12" />Taani hinte xillotethaanne hinte oosota awaajana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:12">shin hintena aykoka go77okona.<verse eid="ISA 57:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 57:13" />Hinte maado demmanaw waassiya wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">hinte shiishida eeqati hintena ashshena!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:13">Enta ubbaa carkoy efana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">issi toho carkiya carkoy enta punnidi dhaysana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:13">Shin tana baw baqatidi attiya besse oothiya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">uray biitta laattana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">ta geeshsha zumaa ekana”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 57:13">yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 57:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wozani Meqida Asaas Minthetho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 57:14" />“Baasite, baasite! Oge giigisite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:14">ta asaa ogiyape dhubiyaba ubbaa diggite”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 57:14">yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ISA 57:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 57:15" />Merinaw de7eysi, gitay, dhoqa bessan de7eysi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">iya sunthay Geeshsha geeteteysi, yaagees:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:15">“Kawuyida asaa ayyaana denthethanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">meqida wozani de7eyisata koolanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">kawuyidanne meqida ayyaani de7eysara daana.<verse eid="ISA 57:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 57:16" />Ta medhida asa ayyaanaynne shempoy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:16">ta sinthan docconna mela taani merinaw mootike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:16">ubba wode hanqetike.<verse eid="ISA 57:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 57:17" />Enta nagaraa gaason taani enta hanqetada seeras;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:17">ta som7uwa entafe genthas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:17">shin enti ha77ika banta wozanaa qofan bidosona.<verse eid="ISA 57:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 57:18" />Taani enta ogiya be7as;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:18">shin taani enta pathana, kaalethana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:18">iyawunne iya gisho yeekeyisata minthethana.<verse eid="ISA 57:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 57:19" />Isra7eele biittan yeekeyisata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:19">mettershan galata kunthana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:19">Haahoninne matan de7eysatas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:19">saroy giddo; taani enta pathana”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 57:19">yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ISA 57:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 57:20" />Shin iitati urqanne silimo kessiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:20">wopu gaanaw danda7onna abba beeta mela.<verse eid="ISA 57:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 57:21" />“Iitatas saroy baawa”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 57:21">yaagees ta Xoossay.<verse eid="ISA 57:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="ISA 58" />
  <para style="s1">Tuma Xooma</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 58:1" />Goday haysada yaagees:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:1">“Ne qaala dhoqu oothada waassa; guye goopa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:1">ne qaala moyzeda dhoqu ootha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:1">Ta asaas enta geellatetha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:1">Yayqooba keethaas enta nagaraa oda.<verse eid="ISA 58:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 58:2" />Shin enti tana gallas gallas koyoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">ta ogiya kaallanaw dosiya daanosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:2">Xillo oothidanne Xoossaa kiitaa aggiboonna asada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">enti tana suure pirda oychoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">taako Xoossaako shiiqanaw dosiya daanosona.<verse eid="ISA 58:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 58:3" />Enti Godaako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">‘Nuuni xoomos, shin neeni ayis nuna xeellikii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">Nuuni nunatethaa kawushida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">shin neeni ayis eronnaada hanadi’ yaagosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:3">Goday zaaridi, ‘Heko, hinte xoomiya wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">hintena ufaysiyabaa ootheeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">hinte oosanchota un7etheeta.’<verse eid="ISA 58:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 58:4" />Hinte ooshshaninne palaman xoomeeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:4">qadhey bayna iita deshethi dechanaw xoomeeta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:4">Hessa mela xoomiya hinte woosay bolla saluwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:4">si7etonna mela oothees.<verse eid="ISA 58:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 58:5" />Taani doorida xoomay haysa mela xoomee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">Issi asi banatetha kawushey haysa mela gallasa xalaalanee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:5">Taani koyiya xoomay asi ba huuphiya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">kaxida gasheda hoksana melanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">bido tiyetidi kayo ma7o ma7idi utetheyee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:5">Hinte hessa xooma gidi xeegetiyee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">He xooma gallasay Godaa sinthan eketiyee?<verse eid="ISA 58:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 58:6" />“Taani dooriya xoomay haysa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:6">suure pirda dhayo santhalaata billana melanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:6">qambara menthidi un7etidaysata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:6">la77a kessana mela gidenneyee?<verse eid="ISA 58:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 58:7" />Taani dooriya xoomay koshatidaysa muzana mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:7">keethi bayna manqota soo ekana mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:7">kallotidaysa be7ada mayzana melanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:7">maado koyiya hinte dabbuwafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:7">hintena genthonna melasa gidennee?<verse eid="ISA 58:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 58:8" />Yaatiko, hinte poo7oy wonta xalqeda poo7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:8">hinte paxotethay eeson yaana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:8">Hinte xillotethay hintefe sinthara baana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:8">Godaa bonchoy hintefe guyera gididi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:8">hintena naagana.<verse eid="ISA 58:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 58:9" />He wode hinte xeegana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:9">Goday hintew koyana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:9">Hinte maado koyidi waassana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:9">I, ‘Heko, taani haysan de7ayis!’ yaagana.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 58:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:9">“Hinte giddofe un7ethiya qambara diggiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:9">biradhen malleysanne iitaba odeteysa aggiko,<verse eid="ISA 58:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 58:10" />Koshatidaysa muziko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:10">metootidaysata koshshiyaban maaddiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:10">he wode hinte poo7oy dhuman poo7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:10">hinte qammay seeta gallas gidana.<verse eid="ISA 58:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 58:11" />Goday hintena ubba wode kaalethana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:11">hintena mela biittan koshshiyaban kalsana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:11">hinte xaphuwa xaalisana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:11">Hinte haathe uyaa gannate melanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:11">meli eronna haatha pulto mela gidana.<verse eid="ISA 58:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 58:12" />Ne asay beni laaletida bessata zaaridi keexana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:12">daro wodepe kase baasetida baasota keexidi dhoqu oothana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:12">Hinte ‘Laaletida gimbeta gimbeysatanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:12">asay de7iya bessaanne wogga ogey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:12">de7iya katamata esseyisata geetetana.’<verse eid="ISA 58:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 58:13" />“Sambaata gallasaa boncho aggonna ixiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">ta geeshsha gallas hinte go77a yedetheysa aggiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">Sambaata ufaysinne bonchetida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">Godaa gallasaa boncho gada xeegiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">hinte hinte ogiya boonna aggidi he gallasaa bonchiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">hintena ufaysiyabaa oothonnanne hadaba odetonna aggiko,<verse eid="ISA 58:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 58:14" />he wode hinte Godan ufaytana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:14">taani hintena daro bonchetidaysata oothana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:14">hinte aawa Yayqooba laata hinte maana mela oothana.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 58:14">Taani Goday haysa odas” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 58:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="ISA 59" />
  <para style="s1">Nagaranne Pirda</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 59:1" />Heko, Godaa kushey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:1">hintena ashshanaw qaammibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:1">iya haythay si7anaw tullibeenna.<verse eid="ISA 59:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 59:2" />Shin hinte nagaray hintefenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:2">hinte Xoossaafe giddon shaahetethi medhis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:2">I si7onna mela hinte nagaray</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:2">iya som7uwa hintefe genthis.<verse eid="ISA 59:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 59:3" />Hinte kushey suuthan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:3">hinte biradhey naaqon tunis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:3">hinte doonay wordo odetees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:3">hinte inxarsay iitaba zuuzumees.<verse eid="ISA 59:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 59:4" />Xillotethan mootey baawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:4">suuretethan pirdeyka baawa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:4">Enti coo palaman ceeqetoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:4">wordo odetoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:4">cimo qanthatidi iitatethi yeloosona.<verse eid="ISA 59:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 59:5" />Enti shoosha phuuphulle haphoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:5">shango haada daddoosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:5">He phuuphulleta miya asi hayqees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:5">phuuphulliyafe issoy meqiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:5">iyape shooshi keyees.<verse eid="ISA 59:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 59:6" />Enti daddida shango haaday ma7os hanenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:6">iyara banta asatethaa kammanaw danda7okona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:6">Enta oosoy iita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:6">geella oosoy enta kushen kumis.<verse eid="ISA 59:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 59:7" />Enta tohoti iitabaa oothanaw woxoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:7">xillo suuthi gussanaw eesotoosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:7">Enta qofay iita; enti bida bessa ubban</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:7">qohoynne boshi de7ees.<verse eid="ISA 59:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 59:8" />Enti sarotetha oge erokona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:8">enta ogiyan suure pirdi baawa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:8">Enti banta ogiya geellayidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:8">he ogiyara hemetiya oonika saro demmenna.<verse eid="ISA 59:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 59:9" />Hessa gisho, suure pirdi nuupe haakis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:9">xillotethi nuuko shiiqenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:9">Nuuni poo7o koyoos, shin dhuma gidis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:9">wagagga poo7o koyoos,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:9">shin sakana dhuman hemetoos.<verse eid="ISA 59:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 59:10" />Nuuni qooqeda dirsaa gimbiya bolla tattafoos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:10">seeta gallas, sa7i lem7in hemetiyada dhubetoos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:10">wolqara de7iya asaa giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:10">nuuni hayqida asa mela gidida.<verse eid="ISA 59:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 59:11" />Nuuni ubbay babanthada waassos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:11">holleda kayotidi oolos.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:11">Nuuni suure pirda koyida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:11">shin demmibooko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:11">atotethi koyida, shin I nuupe haakis.<verse eid="ISA 59:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 59:12" />Nu balay ne sinthan daris;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:12">nu nagaray nu bolla markatees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:12">Nu naaqoy nuura de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:12">nu qohuwa nu eroos.<verse eid="ISA 59:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 59:13" />Nuuni makallidi, Godaa kadhida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:13">nu Xoossaa aggidi guye simmida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:13">Geellatethinne gene odetida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:13">nuuni wordo qanthatidi wordo yelida.<verse eid="ISA 59:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 59:14" />Suure pirdi guye sugetis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:14">xillotethi nuupe haakis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:14">Tumatethi dabaaban dhubetees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:14">ammanetethi gelanaw besse dhayis.<verse eid="ISA 59:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 59:15" />Tumatethi awunka bentenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:15">iitatethafe haakiya asi qohos aadhidi imetees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:15">Goday suure pirdi baynaysa be7idi azzanis.<verse eid="ISA 59:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 59:16" />Un7eteyisata maaddiya asinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:16">entaw gaannatiya asi baynaysa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:16">Goday be7idi malaaletis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:16">Hessa gisho, iya qesey iyaw atotethi ehis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:16">iya xillotethay iya katisidi oykis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">59:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:5">Isa 63:5</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 59:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 59:17" />I, xillotethi tiran wothiya ola miisheda ma7is;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:17">ba huuphiyan atotetha barneexa wothis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:17">halo kessi ma7oda, hanqo afilada ma7is.<verse eid="ISA 59:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 59:18" />I entaw enta oosuwada oosuwada zaarana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:18">hanquwa ba morketas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:18">seera baara eqeteysatas ciggana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:18">yuushoy abban teqetida biittatas enta oosuwada immana.<verse eid="ISA 59:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 59:19" />Godaa peenoy wolqaama goteda di77ishe yaana gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:19">wuloha baggan de7eysati Godaa sunthaas yayyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:19">doloha baggan de7eysati iya bonchana.<verse eid="ISA 59:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 59:20" />“Xiyoonesinne Yayqooba zeretha giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:20">banta nagarape simmeyisata Wozeysi yaana.<verse eid="ISA 59:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 59:21" />Taw entara de7iya caaqoy haysa:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:21">hinte bolla de7iya ta Ayyaanaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:21">taani hinte doonan wothida ta qaalay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:21">hachife doomidi, merinaa gakanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:21">hinte doonape, hinte nayta doonapenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:21">hinte nayta nayta doonape shaaketenna”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 59:21">yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ISA 59:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="ISA 60" />
  <para style="s1">Xiyoone Bonchuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 60:1" />Ne poo7oy yida gisho, dendada poo7isa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:1">Godaa bonchoy ne bolla poo7ana.<verse eid="ISA 60:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 60:2" />Heko, dhumi sa7aa, sakana dhumi asaa kammana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:2">shin Goday ne bolla dendana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:2">iya bonchoy ne bolla poo7ana.<verse eid="ISA 60:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 60:3" />Kawotethati ne poo7uwako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:3">kawotika ne wonta xolqethaako yaana.<verse eid="ISA 60:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 60:4" />Dhoqu gada ne yuushuwa xeella;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:4">ubbay issife neeko yaana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:4">Ne adde nayti haahope yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:4">ne macca nayti ba7etidi neeko yaana.<verse eid="ISA 60:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 60:5" />He wode neeni be7ada ufaytana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:5">ne wozanay ufaysan noocu gaana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:5">Abbaa bolla de7iya shaloy neeko yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:5">kawotethata duretethay nebaa gidana.<verse eid="ISA 60:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 60:6" />Midiyaamepenne Efa biittafe yida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:6">gimale wudey ne biitta kammana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:6">Worqanne ixaane eheysati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:6">Godaa galataa awaajishe Saabape yaana.<verse eid="ISA 60:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 60:7" />Qedaarenne Nebayoota dorsa wude ubbay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:7">ta yarsho bessa neeko yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:7">taani ta boncho keethaa bonchana.<verse eid="ISA 60:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 60:8" />“Haysati shaarada woyko holleda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:8">banta keethako paalleysati oonee?<verse eid="ISA 60:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 60:9" />Tuma yuushoy abban teqetida biittati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">tanan ufaysi wothana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:9">Isra7eele geeshshay, Goday hinte Xoossay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">hintena bonchida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:9">Tarsesa markabeti sinthati keyidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">ne nayta haaho biittafe enta biraranne worqara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">Xoossaa bonchuwas ehana.<verse eid="ISA 60:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 60:10" />“Allaga biittati ne dirsaa gimbana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:10">enta kawoti new oothana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:10">Nena taani ta hanquwan kase shocas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:10">shin ha77i ta qadhiyan nena maaras.<verse eid="ISA 60:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 60:11" />Ne pengeti ubba wode dooya daana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:11">kawotethata duretethaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:11">enta kawoti di7etidi neeko yaana mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:11">gallasinne qamma gordetokona.<verse eid="ISA 60:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 60:12" />New oothonna asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:12">woyko kawotethi ubbay dhayana.<verse eid="ISA 60:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 60:13" />Ta keethaa bessaa loythana mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:13">Libaanose boncho gidida zigay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:13">xiiddaynne xaythay neeko yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:13">taani ta tohuwa wothiya bessaa bonchana.<verse eid="ISA 60:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 60:14" />Nena un7ethida asaa nayti yidi new hokana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:14">nena kadhida ubbay ne sinthan goyinnana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:14">Enti nena, ‘Godaa Katame, Xiyoone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:14">Isra7eele, Geeshsha Katame’ yaagidi xeegana.<verse eid="ISA 60:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 60:15" />“Haysafe kase oonika ne giddora kanthonna mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:15">yegetadasanne ixetadasa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:15">Shin ha77i taani nena merinaw gita oothana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:15">yeletethaa ubbay nenan ufaytana.<verse eid="ISA 60:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 60:16" />Neeni kawotethata maatha uyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:16">kawota dhantha dhammana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:16">Goday, nena Ashsheysa, wozeysanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:16">Yayqooba wolqaama gideysa neeni erana.<verse eid="ISA 60:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 60:17" />Naase birata gisho worqa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:17">birata gisho bira, mitha gisho naase birata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:17">shucha gisho birata taani new ehana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:17">Taani, sarotethi nena ayseysa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:17">xillotethi new halaqa oothana.<verse eid="ISA 60:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 60:18" />Geellatethi ne biittan, dhayoy woyko boshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:18">ne zawan si7etenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:18">Neeni ne dirsa gimbiya, ‘Atotethaa’,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:18">ne pengiya, ‘Galata’ yaagada xeegana.<verse eid="ISA 60:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 60:19" />Gallas awa poo7o, qamma ageena poo7o new koshshenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:19">Goday new merinaa poo7o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:19">ne Xoossay new boncho gidana.<verse eid="ISA 60:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 60:20" />Awi nam7antho wullenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:20">ne ageenay poo7o aggenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:20">Goday new merinaa poo7o gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:20">neeni yeekida gallasati new gidana.<verse eid="ISA 60:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 60:21" />Ne asa ubbay xillo gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:21">enti biitta merinaw laattana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:21">Enti taani ta bonchuwa qoncisanaw tokida puutota;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:21">ta kushe oosota.<verse eid="ISA 60:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 60:22" />Hinte giddon issi keethan de7iya guutha asata darsana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:22">ubbaafe guuthaa gita kawotethi oothana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:22">Taani Godaa; wodey gakiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:22">taani hessa eeson polana” yaagees.<verse eid="ISA 60:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="ISA 61" />
  <para style="s1">Atotetha Mishiraacho</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 61:1" />Ubbaa Haariya Godaa Ayyaanay ta bolla de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">manqotas lo77oba odana mela Goday tana tiyis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:1">Wozani meqidaysata koolana mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">di7etidaysata la77a kessana melanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">qashetidaysata billana mela Goday tana kiittis.<verse eid="ISA 61:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 61:2" />Dosetida Godaa laytha odana mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:2">nu Xoossay halo keyana gallasaa awaajana mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:2">azzaneyisata ubbaa minthethana mela tana kiittis.<verse eid="ISA 61:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 61:3" />Xiyoonen kayoteysatas, bido gisho kallacha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">yeeho gisho ufaysa zayte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">azzano gisho galata ma7o immana mela tana kiittis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">Enti Goday ba bonchuwas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">tokida xillo mitha geetetidi xeegetana.<verse eid="ISA 61:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 61:4" />Enti beni laaletida bessata zaaridi keexana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:4">beni kundida bessata zaaridi essana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:4">Enti daro yeletethaafe kase laaletidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:4">onida katamata zaaridi keexana.<verse eid="ISA 61:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 61:5" />Allaga asati hinte dorsa wudiya heemmana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:5">imathati hinte gadiya goyana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:5">enti hinte woyne gadiya naagana.<verse eid="ISA 61:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 61:6" />Asay hintena, “Godaa kahinetanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:6">nu Xoossaa oosanchota” yaagidi xeegana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:6">Hinte kawotethata duretetha maana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:6">enta shaluwan hinte nashetana.<verse eid="ISA 61:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 61:7" />Ta asay banta yeella gisho nam7u kushe ekana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:7">banta kawusha gisho laatan ufaytana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:7">Hessa gisho, hinte enta biittan dako laattana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:7">hinte ufaysay merinaa ufaysi gidana.<verse eid="ISA 61:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 61:8" />“Taani, Goday suure pirda dosayis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:8">bonqenne iita ooso ixayis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:8">Taani tuma enta oosuwa gatiya qanxana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:8">Taani entara merinaw caaqana.<verse eid="ISA 61:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 61:9" />Enta kochati kawotethata giddon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:9">enta nayti dereta giddon eretana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:9">enta be7ida ubbay taani, Goday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:9">enta anjida asi gideysa erana.”<verse eid="ISA 61:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 61:10" />Taani Godan daro ufaytayis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">ta shempiya ta Xoossan hashshu gawusu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:10">Ekeysi ba huuphen kallacha wotheysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">geliyara bana alleeqiseysada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:10">I tana atotetha ma7o mayzis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">xillotethi afila bollara gujis.<verse eid="ISA 61:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 61:11" />Biittafe mithi maati doleysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:11">gadey tokidaba dicheysada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:11">Ubbaa Haariya Goday xillotethinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:11">galata kawotetha ubbaa sinthan purcisana.<verse eid="ISA 61:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="ISA 62" />
  <para style="s1">Xiyoone Ooratha Suntha</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 62:1" />Xiyoone gisho, taani si77i giike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:1">Yerusalaame xillotethay poo7oda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:1">I atotethay wonta xalqeda keyana gakanaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:1">taani si77i giike.<verse eid="ISA 62:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 62:2" />Kawotethati ne xillotethaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:2">kawoti ubbay ne bonchuwa be7ana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:2">Goday sunthiya ooratha sunthan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:2">neeni xeegetana.<verse eid="ISA 62:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 62:3" />Neeni Godaa kushen lo77ida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:3">kawotetha kallacha gidana.<verse eid="ISA 62:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 62:4" />Neeni, “Dogetidaaro” geetetaka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">ne biittiya, “Dhonthu” geetetuku.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:4">Shin neeni, “Ta ufaysay in de7iyaro”,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">ne biittiya, “Azina gelidaaro” geetetana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:4">Goday nenan ufaytana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">ne biittiyaka azini de7iyaro gidana.<verse eid="ISA 62:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 62:5" />Panthi geela7o ekeysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:5">ne nayti nena machana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:5">Ekeysi geliyarin ufayteysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:5">ne Xoossay nenan ufaytana.<verse eid="ISA 62:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 62:6" />Neno Yerusalaame, ne dirsa gimbiya bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:6">wocheyisata taani wothas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:6">enti gallasinne qamma si77i gookona.<verse eid="ISA 62:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 62:7" />Hinteno, Godaa qofiseysato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:7">I, Yerusalaame keexana gakanawunne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:7">biitta ubban nashetida katama oothana gakanaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:7">hinteka shempopite; iyaka shempisopite.<verse eid="ISA 62:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 62:8" />Goday ba ushacha kushiyaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:8">ba wolqaama qesiyan haysada yaagidi caaqis:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:8">“Taani nam7antho hinte katha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:8">hinte morketi maana mela oothike.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:8">Hinte daaburida hinte woyne ushsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:8">allagati uyokona.<verse eid="ISA 62:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 62:9" />Shin banta kathaa cakidaysati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:9">midi Godaa galatana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:9">woyne maxeysati ta keethaa dabaaban uyana.<verse eid="ISA 62:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 62:10" />Aadhite! Pengera keyidi biite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:10">Asaas oge giigisite! Wogga oge kessite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:10">Shuchaa diggite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:10">kawotethati ogiya demmana mela malla essite.<verse eid="ISA 62:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 62:11" />Goday sa7a gaxas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:11">haysada yaagidi awaajis:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">62:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:10">Isa 40:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:12">Qon 22:12</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:11">‘Xiyoone asaas haysada yaagite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:11">heko, hintena Ashsheysi gakis!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:11">Iya gatey iyara de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:11">I immiya woytoy iya sinthan de7ees’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 62:11">yaagite.<verse eid="ISA 62:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 62:12" />Hinte, ‘Goday Wozida Geeshsha asata’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:12">geetetidi xeegetana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:12">Yerusalaamey, ‘Koyetiyaronne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:12">Yegeta Attaboona Katamiw’ ” geetetana.<verse eid="ISA 62:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="ISA 63" />
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Pirda Gallas</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 63:1" />Edoome biittan, Baasora katamaape</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:1">zo7o ma7o ma7idi yey haysi oonee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:1">Boncho ma7o ma7idi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:1">ba wolqaa minotethan sinthe hordofey oonee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:1">“Xillo odeteynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:1">ashshiya wolqi de7ey tana”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 63:1">yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ISA 63:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 63:2" />Woyne gum7iyason woyne yedhiya asa ma7oda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:2">ne ma7oy ayis zo77idee?<verse eid="ISA 63:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 63:3" />“Taani woyne gum7iyason woyniya tarka yedhas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">kawotethatape issi asika taara baawa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:3">Taani enta ta hanquwan yedhas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">ta yiluwan enta dirxerethas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:3">Enta suuthay ta ma7uwa bolla dharcetin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">ta ma7o ubbay iitis.<verse eid="ISA 63:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 63:4" />Taani ta asaa woziya gallasaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:4">enta morketa halo keyiya laythay gakis.<verse eid="ISA 63:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 63:5" />Taani be7as,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:5">shin tana maaddiya issi asika demmabike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:5">maaddey dhayida gisho, taani malaaletas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:5">Hessa gisho, ta qesey taw atotethi ehis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:5">ta hanqoy tana maaddis.<verse eid="ISA 63:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 63:6" />Taani ta hanquwan kawotethata yedhas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:6">ta yiluwan enta dirxerethas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:6">enta suuthaa biittan gussas” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ISA 63:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Woosanne Galata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 63:7" />Goday nuus oothida ooso ubbaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">Goday ba maarotethaaninne ba qadhiyan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:7">Isra7eele asaas oothida lo77o ooso ubbaanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">iya sunthay galatetana mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">bessida keehatetha ubbaa taani odana.<verse eid="ISA 63:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 63:8" />I, “Enti tuma ta asenne ta na7a gidiya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:8">taw wordotokona” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:8">Hessa gisho, I enta ashsheysa gidis.<verse eid="ISA 63:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 63:9" />Enta waaye ubbaa I waayetis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:9">iya Sinthaa Kiitanchoy enta ashshis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:9">I enta ba siiquwaninne ba maarotan wozis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:9">kase aadhida wodeta ubban I enta tookis.<verse eid="ISA 63:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 63:10" />Shin enti makallidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:10">iya Geeshsha Ayyaana azzanthidosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:10">Hessa gisho, I simmidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:10">entaw morke gidis; enta olis.<verse eid="ISA 63:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 63:11" />Hessafe guye asay benibaanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:11">ba aylliya Muse wode oothidaba qopidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:11">haysada yaagidosona:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:11">“Ba wudiya henthanchotara issife</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:11">abba giddora kanthisida Xoossay awun de7ii?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:11">He wode ba Geeshsha Ayyaana enta giddon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:11">wothida Xoossay ha77i awun de7ii?<verse eid="ISA 63:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 63:12" />Baw merinaa sunthu gidana mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:12">enta sinthan haatha shaakidi, ba boncho wolqaama qesey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:12">Muses ushacha kushe gidana mela kiittidaysi awun de7ii?<verse eid="ISA 63:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 63:13" />Biitta bollara pari biyada enti dhubetonna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:13">ciimmo haatha giddora pinthidaysi awun de7ii?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 63:13">yaagidosona. <verse eid="ISA 63:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 63:14" />Zangaara wodhiya meheda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:14">Godaa Ayyaanay entaw shempo immis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:14">Ne sunthay bonchetana mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:14">hessada oothada ne asaa kaalethadasa.<verse eid="ISA 63:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 63:15" />Abeeti Godaw, salora duge xeella;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:15">neeni de7iya geeshshinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:15">boncho gidida araatape be7a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:15">Ne qinaateynne ne wolqay anee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:15">Ne maarotaynne ne qadhey nuupe haakis.<verse eid="ISA 63:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 63:16" />Abrahaamey nuna eronna ixikoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:16">Yayqoobi nuna akeekona ixikoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:16">abeeti Godaw, neeni nu aawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:16">benipe doomidi, ne sunthay nuna wozeysa.<verse eid="ISA 63:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 63:17" />Abeeti Godaw, nuuni ne ogiyape</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:17">dhayanaadanne new yayyonnaada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:17">nu wozanaa ayis muumisadii?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:17">Godaw, ne aylleta gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:17">ne laata gidida kochata gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:17">nuuko simma.<verse eid="ISA 63:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 63:18" />Ne geeshsha asay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:18">ne keetha guutha wodes laattidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:18">shin ha77i nu morketi iya yedhidosona.<verse eid="ISA 63:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 63:19" />Nuuni benipe nebaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:19">shin enta neeni haarabaaka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:19">ne sunthanka enti xeegetibookona.<verse eid="ISA 63:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="ISA 64" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 64:1" />Abeeti Godaw, salota daakada duge wodha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:1">dereti ne sinthan kokoro.<verse eid="ISA 64:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 64:2" />Tami eexidi haathe pentiseysada duge wodhada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:2">ne suntha ne morketa erisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:2">kawotethataka ne sinthan kokorsa.<verse eid="ISA 64:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 64:3" />Kase nuuni naagiboonna malaatata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:3">neeni oothida wode wodhadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:3">dereti ne sinthan kokoridosona.<verse eid="ISA 64:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 64:4" />Benipe doomidi, nena ammanetidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:4">naageysatas malaatata oothiday neepe attishin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:4">hara Xoossi asa haythi si7ibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:4">asa ayfey be7ibeenna.<verse eid="ISA 64:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 64:5" />Ufaytidi xillotethi ootheysatanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">ne ogiya qopeyisata neeni maaddadasa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:5">Shin nuuni nagara ooso aggonna ixida wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">neeni hanqetadasa; nuuni waanidi attanee?<verse eid="ISA 64:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 64:6" />Nuuni ubbay tuna asi gidida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:6">nu xillotetha ooso ubbay tuna curqa mela.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:6">Nu ubbay boncoda qoletida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:6">nu nagaray nuna carkoda pitidi efis.<verse eid="ISA 64:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 64:7" />Neeni ne sinthaa nuupe genthadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:7">nu nagaray nuna dhaysana mela aggadasa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:7">Ne sunthaa xeegey deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:7">nena minthidi oykanaw koyey baawa.<verse eid="ISA 64:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 64:8" />Gidoshin, abeeti Godaw, neeni nu aawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:8">nuuni urqa; ne urqa medhadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:8">nuuni ubbay ne kushen medhetida.<verse eid="ISA 64:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 64:9" />Abeeti Godaw, daro hanqetofa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:9">nu nagaraa merinaw qopofa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:9">Nuuni ubbay ne ase gidiya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:9">nuna be7a.<verse eid="ISA 64:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 64:10" />Ne geeshsha katamati mela biitta gididosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:10">Xiyoone katamay mela biitta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:10">Yerusalaamey baysa gidis.<verse eid="ISA 64:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 64:11" />Nu aawati iyan nena galatida geeshshinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:11">lo77o gidida nu xoossa keethay taman xuugetis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:11">nu lo77o bessa ubbay laaletis.<verse eid="ISA 64:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 64:12" />Abeeti Godaw, neeni haysa ubbaa be7ashe si77i gaanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:12">ha ubbay hanin, nuuko simmikii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:12">Neeni si77i gada zawi bayna seeranee?<verse eid="ISA 64:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="ISA 65" />
  <para style="s1">Pirdanne Atotethi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 65:1" />“Tana oychiboonaysatas qoncas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:1">tana koyboonaysatas bentas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:1">Ta sunthaa xeegiboonna kawotethas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:1">‘Yee! Yee!’ yaagada koyas.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:20">Roome 10:20</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 65:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 65:2" />Banta qofaa kaallidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:2">lo77o gidonna ogiyan hemetiya geella asaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:2">gallas kumethi ta kushiya miccas.<verse eid="ISA 65:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 65:3" />Ha asay, ta sinthan atakilte gaden yarshishenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:3">xuube yarsho bessan ixaane cuyisishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:3">tana ubba wode hanqethoosona.<verse eid="ISA 65:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 65:4" />Enti duufon utteyisata, geema bessan aqeyisata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:4">guduntho asho meyisata; enta xaaruwan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:4">tuna asho cambi de7eyisata.<verse eid="ISA 65:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 65:5" />“Enti, ‘New yan de7a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:5">taani neepe geeshshi gidiya gisho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:5">taako shiiqopa!’ yaagosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:5">Hessa mela asati siidhe tucciya cuyaa mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:5">gallas kumethi eexiya tama mela.<verse eid="ISA 65:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 65:6" />“Heko, ta sinthan xaafeti uttis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:6">taani entaw zaarana si77i giike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:6">enta seeranaw dendas.<verse eid="ISA 65:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 65:7" />Taani enta nagaraanne enta aawata nagaraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:7">acuwa issife entaw qanxana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:7">Enti deriya bolla ixaane cuyisidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:7">zumata bolla tana cayidosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:7">Enti kase oothida oosuwa acuwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:7">taani entaw qanxana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ISA 65:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 65:8" />Goday yaagees:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:8">“Iita woyne susa giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:8">lo77o woyne ayfey de7eysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:8">asay, ‘Iya giddon lo77o woyne ayfey de7iya gisho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:8">ubbaa wora holopite’ geysa mela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:8">Taani ta aylleta haysada oothana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:8">taani enta ubbaa dhaysike.<verse eid="ISA 65:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 65:9" />Taani Yayqoobape koche,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:9">Yihudape ta deriya laatteyisata kessana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:9">ta dooridaysati iya laattana; ta aylleti yan daana.<verse eid="ISA 65:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 65:10" />Tana minthidi koyiya ta asaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:10">Saaroni dorsa wudey heemetiya bessi gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:10">Akoora zangaaray miiza wudey allatiya bessi gidana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:24-25">Iyya 7:24-25</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 65:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 65:11" />“Shin hinteno, Godaa aggidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:11">ta geeshsha zumaa dogidaysato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:11">‘Qaada’ geetetiya eeqas gibira giigiseysato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:11">hinte wursethaa eranaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:11">‘Saama’ geetetiya eeqas walaha woyne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:11">ushsha wancan kuntheysato,<verse eid="ISA 65:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 65:12" />Taani hinte wursethaa mashshas aathada immana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">hinte ubbay goyretanaw hokana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:12">Taani hintena xeegin koybeketa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">odisin si7ibeeketa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:12">Hinte ta sinthan iitabaa oothideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">taani dosonnaba doorideta.”<verse eid="ISA 65:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 65:13" />Ubbaa Haariya Goday yaagees:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:13">“Ta aylleti maana, shin hinte koshatana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:13">ta aylleti uyana, shin hinte saamotana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:13">ta aylleti ufaytana, shin hinte yeellatana.<verse eid="ISA 65:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 65:14" />Ta aylleti wozanape ufaytidi yexana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:14">shin hinte wozanape kayotana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:14">hinte ayyaanay meqida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:14">hinte zeleelidi yeekana.<verse eid="ISA 65:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 65:15" />Hinte, hinte sunthaa ta dooretida deriyas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:15">qangethi oothidi immana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:15">Ubbaa Haariya Goday hintena wodhana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:15">shin I ba aylleta dumma sunthan xeegana.<verse eid="ISA 65:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 65:16" />Kase metoti dogetida gishonne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:16">ta ayfiya sinthafe geemmida gisho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:16">he biittan anjo koyiya ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:16">tuma Xoossaa sunthan woossana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:16">He biittan caaqo caaqiya ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:16">tuma Xoossaa sunthan caaqana.<verse eid="ISA 65:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ooratha Salonne Sa7a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 65:17" />“Heko, taani ooratha salotanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:17">ooratha sa7a medhana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:17">kaseba ubbay hassayetenna; qofetenna.<verse eid="ISA 65:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 65:18" />Shin taani medhiyaban</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:18">merinaw ufaytitenne hashshu giite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:18">Taani Yerusalaame ufaysasinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:18">I asaaka galatan kumidaysata oothada medhana.<verse eid="ISA 65:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 65:19" />Taani Yerusalaamen ufaytana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:19">ta asan hashshu gaana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:19">Hizape guye yeehoynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:19">un7a waasoy yan si7etenna.<verse eid="ISA 65:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 65:20" />“Yerusalaamen hizape guye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">guutha wode de7idi hayqiya na7i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">ba laytha wursonna hayqiya cima asi deenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:20">Xeetu laythara hayqiya uray,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">na7atethan hayqis geetetana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">xeetu laythi gathonna hayqey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">baadetida asada taybetana.<verse eid="ISA 65:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 65:21" />He wode asay keethe keexidi daana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:21">woyne tokidi iya ayfiya maana.<verse eid="ISA 65:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 65:22" />Enti keexin hari deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:22">enti tokin hari meenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:22">Ta asaa laythay mitha laythada aduqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:22">taani dooridaysati adussa wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:22">banta kushe oosuwan ufaytana.<verse eid="ISA 65:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 65:23" />Enti coo daaburokona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:23">qaadi bayna na7a yelokona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:23">Enti banta naytara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:23">Godan anjetida kochata gidana.<verse eid="ISA 65:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 65:24" />Enti tana xeeganaape sinthe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:24">taani entaw koyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:24">enti buroo haasayonna de7ishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:24">taani enta si7ana.<verse eid="ISA 65:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 65:25" />Suudhumeynne dorsa urgey issife heemetana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">gaammoy boorada kale maana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">baani shooshas kathi gidana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:25">He wode ta geeshsha zumaa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">enti qohetokonanne dhayokona”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:6-9">Isa 11:6-9</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 65:25">yaagees Godaa Xoossay.<verse eid="ISA 65:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="ISA 66" />
  <para style="s1">Pirdanne Ufaysi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 66:1" />Goday yaagees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:1">Saloy ta araata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:1">sa7i ta tohoy yedhiya besse.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:1">Yaatin hinte taw keexiya keethay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:1">ay mela keethee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:1">Ta shempana bessay awusee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:34">Maato 5:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:22">23:22</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 66:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 66:2" />Haysa ubbaa ta kushey oothis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">entika hanidosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:2">Shin taani bana ziqi oothiya uraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">ba ayyaanan meqida uraanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">ta qaalan kokoriya ura xeellana.<verse eid="ISA 66:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 66:3" />Korma yarshey ase wodhiya asa mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">urge dorsi yarshey kana yarshiya asa mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">katha yarsho yarshey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">guduntho suuthi yarshiya asa mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">qofiso ixaane cuyisey eeqa goyinniya asa mela.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:3">Asa ubbay baw injetiya oge dooridosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">enta shempoy enta tunatethan ufaytees.<verse eid="ISA 66:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 66:4" />Hessa gisho, taani enta metos aatha immana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:4">enti yayyidaba enta bolla ehana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:4">Taani xeegida wode oonika koybeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:4">taani odiya wode oonika si7ibeenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:4">Enti ta sinthan iitabaa oothidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:4">tana ufaysonnaba dooridosona.<verse eid="ISA 66:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 66:5" />Hinteno, Godaa qaalas kokoreysato</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">iya qaala si7ite:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:5">“Hintena ixiya hinte ishati, ta sunthaa gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">hintena kureysati, ‘Hinte ufaytin nuuni be7ana mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">ane Goday boncheto’ ” yaagidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">shin enti yeellatana.<verse eid="ISA 66:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 66:6" />Katamaape yaa waasuwa si7ite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:6">xoossa keethafe keyiya girsaa si7ite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:6">He girsay ba morketas enta oosuwada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:6">kushe zaariya Godaa girsaa.<verse eid="ISA 66:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 66:7" />“Iqetonna na7a yeliya maccas de7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:7">Bannakonna adde na7a yeliya maccas de7ii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:5">Qon 12:5</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 66:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 66:8" />Haysa melaba oone si7iday?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:8">Hessa melaba oone be7iday?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:8">Issi derey issi gallas yeletanaw danda7iyee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:8">issi kawotethi qiphi zaaron medhetiyee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:8">Xiyooney buroo iqethi oykonna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:8">ellesada ba nayta yelasu.<verse eid="ISA 66:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 66:9" />Yelana wode gathiya taani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:9">enti yelanaada oothikinaayee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:9">Yelanaada oothiya taani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:9">yeliya ulo gordaynaayee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:9">Haysa giday tana, Godaa, ne Xoossaa.<verse eid="ISA 66:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 66:10" />Hinteno Yerusalaamo dosiya ubbaw, iira ufaytite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:10">I gisho ufaysan noocu giite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:10">Hinteno iw yeekiya ubbaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:10">iira ufaytite.<verse eid="ISA 66:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 66:11" />Hinte, iya minthethiya dhantha dhammidi kallana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:11">I daro bonchuwafe loythi uyidi, ufaytana.”<verse eid="ISA 66:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 66:12" />Goday yaagees;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:12">“Taani iw sarotethaa shaafada darsana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:12">iw kawotethata duretetha kixa shaafada ehana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:12">Hinte hessa dhammana; I hashiyan tooketana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:12">I ki7on uttidi baalotana.<verse eid="ISA 66:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 66:13" />Aayiya ba na7a minthetheysada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:13">taani hintena minthethenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:13">hinte Yerusalaamen minettana.<verse eid="ISA 66:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 66:14" />Hessa hinte be7iya wode hinte wozanay ufaytana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:14">hinte meqethay maata mela aacana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:14">Godaa kushey iya aylleta bolla de7eysin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:14">iya hanqoy iya morketa bolla de7eysi eretana.<verse eid="ISA 66:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 66:15" />Heko, Goday tamara yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:15">iya para gaareti gote mela.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:15">Ba sheniya hanqon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:15">ba seeraka tama lacon qoncisees.<verse eid="ISA 66:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 66:16" />Goday asho ma7ida ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:16">tamaninne mashshan pirdana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:16">daroti Godaa mashshan hayqana.<verse eid="ISA 66:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 66:17" />“Banta eeqa goyinnanaw atakilte gade baanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:17">bantana dummayeysatinne geeshsheysati;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:17">guduntho, ecerenne hara tunabata meyisata giddofe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:17">issuwa kaallidi beysati ubbay dhayana.<verse eid="ISA 66:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 66:18" />“Taani enta oosuwanne enta qofaa eriya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:18">kawotethatanne dumma dumma doonan odeteyisata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:18">issife shiishana; enti shiiqidi, ta bonchuwa be7ana.<verse eid="ISA 66:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 66:19" />Taani enta giddon malaata oothana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:19">entafe attidaysata giddofe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:19">ta gitatetha si7iboonanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:19">ta bonchuwa be7iboona kawotethatako,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:19">Tarsesako, Liibeko, Liideko, Tubaalako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:19">Yawaanakonne yuushoy abban teqetidi haaho biittatako kiittana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:19">enti ta bonchuwa kawotethata giddon awaajana.<verse eid="ISA 66:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 66:20" />Isra7eele asay katha yarshuwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:20">geeshsha miishen wothidi xoossa keethi eheysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:20">enti hinte ishata ubbaa kawotethata giddofe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:20">paratan, para gaaretan, gimaletan, baqulotaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:20">caane gaaretan utisidi, Godaas imo oothidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:20">ta geeshsha zumaa bolla Yerusalaame ehana.<verse eid="ISA 66:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 66:21" />Entafe issota issota kahinenne Leewe oothana”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 66:21">yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ISA 66:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 66:22" />“Taani medhida ooratha salotinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:22">ooratha sa7i ta sinthan minnidi de7eysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:22">hinte kochaynne hinte sunthay minnidi daana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:17">Isa 65:17</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:13">2 Phex 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:1">Qon 21:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 66:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 66:23" />Ageena xeerope bidi ageena xeero gakanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:23">Sambaatape bidi Sambaata gakanaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:23">asa ubbay ta sinthan goyinnanaw yaana.<verse eid="ISA 66:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 66:24" />Enti keyidi bishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:24">ta bolla makallida asaa aha be7ana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:24">Enta miya guxuney hayqenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:24">enta xuuggiya tamay to7enna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:24">enti asa ubbaas shaatiyaba gidana”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:48">Mar 9:48</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 66:24">yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ISA 66:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 66" />
</usx>